po convention)\n- i18n: save-error strings EN+IT; E2E re-login asserts username input\n\n710 core unit + 111 web unit passing.","tree":{"sha":"d6ad2bc3208f178c42dc6ed34b9093f7905bf0f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/git/trees/d6ad2bc3208f178c42dc6ed34b9093f7905bf0f1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/git/commits/5f8ffadd91ebfc8ee6d32bd55b1f26f086ba9bd5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/plexica/plexica/commit/5f8ffadd91ebfc8ee6d32bd55b1f26f086ba9bd5","node_id":"C_kwDORxknwtoAKDVmOGZmYWRkOTFlYmZjOGVlNmQzMmJkNTViMWYyNmYwODZiYTliZDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/plexica/plexica/commit/4e1235e5d640befb2048390c87e1f31e6267e5cd","sha":"4e1235e5d640befb2048390c87e1f31e6267e5cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/commits/4e1235e5d640befb2048390c87e1f31e6267e5cd"}],"sha":"5f8ffadd91ebfc8ee6d32bd55b1f26f086ba9bd5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/commits/5f8ffadd91ebfc8ee6d32bd55b1f26f086ba9bd5"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/commits/4e1235e5d640befb2048390c87e1f31e6267e5cd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T15:22:52Z","email":"muse-spark@plexica.local","name":"muse-spark"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T15:22:52Z","email":"muse-spark@plexica.local","name":"muse-spark"},"message":"fix(e2e): send empty JSON body in profile-sessions direct DELETE calls\n\nfreshBearer always sets Content-Type: application/json; page.request.delete\nwith no body hits Fastify FST_ERR_CTP_EMPTY_JSON_BODY (400) before the\nownership check runs, so the 404 assertions never executed. Send data: {}\nmatching the UI client and the sse-asserts read-all convention.","tree":{"sha":"87e66ffb3b1fdea490e30ddbfb3b9a942aafe34d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/git/trees/87e66ffb3b1fdea490e30ddbfb3b9a942aafe34