"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/commits/bacaca243769493f9a3eff75a5dfb8c2596223b8"}],"sha":"98388a3cc80d2d7051245b4dd33a61a1ae6a989f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/commits/98388a3cc80d2d7051245b4dd33a61a1ae6a989f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/commits/bacaca243769493f9a3eff75a5dfb8c2596223b8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T15:00:28Z","email":"muse-spark@plexica.local","name":"muse-spark"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T15:00:28Z","email":"muse-spark@plexica.local","name":"muse-spark"},"message":"feat(user-profile): add Phase 5 profile extensions for Spec 006\n\n- Keycloak Admin helpers: listUserSessions, deleteUserSession (404-tolerant),\n  syncEmail, syncDisplayName (no terminateUserSessions duplication)\n- Profile service: JWT picture claim to avatarUrl/avatarSource (picture wins),\n  keycloakAccountUrl from pattern, Keycloak-first email sync with single\n  atomic local write (no divergence on rejected sync)\n- Session routes: GET /profile/sessions, DELETE ownership-first (404\n  not-found-or-not-owned, no enumeration), 503/502 mapping, self-revoke 200,\n  session.revoke audit post-delete\n- Frontend: sessions card (per-row pending + localized errors), password card\n  (Keycloak account link), avatar header (keycloak source wins), email field\n  with localized validation, dirty-flag prefs-style save\n- i18n profile domain EN+IT (14 keys) registered in both aggregators\n- Tests: 8 keycloak-admin unit, 5 sessions unit (503/502/audit), 7 Keycloak\n  integration (incl. cross-user 404), 5 E2E profile-sessions, avatar E2E\n  (header + profile, keycloak source)\n\n702 core unit + 111 web unit passing.","tree":{"sha":"cd876ad092a4b9cf28936fc4d03dadacecc9bff0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/git/trees/cd876ad092a4b9cf28936fc4d03dadacecc9bff0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/git/commits/bacaca243769493f9a3eff75a5dfb8c