pe guard\nfor EN/IT parity; drop over-broad storage.* origin fallback (require explicit\nVITE_PLUGIN_ASSET_ORIGIN); dedupe override drafts by persisted key + surface\nkey validation errors; resolve vite-plugin outDir against root; keep i18n copy\nin build --watch; harden upload script manifest parse (explicit file check +\nreadFileSync+JSON.parse, was swallowed MODULE_NOT_FOUND).\n\nTracking: epic-06, decision-log, tasks.md, sprint-006, kanban reflect Phase 4\ndelivery (9/13 stories, 19 pts).","tree":{"sha":"e1c6814694ef311a28c5cdaeeda678d578f2c030","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/git/trees/e1c6814694ef311a28c5cdaeeda678d578f2c030"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/git/commits/93d370f5ea657735210ce580d1d91aca39a50125","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/plexica/plexica/commit/93d370f5ea657735210ce580d1d91aca39a50125","node_id":"C_kwDORxknwtoAKDkzZDM3MGY1ZWE2NTc3MzUyMTBjZTU4MGQxZDkxYWNhMzlhNTAxMjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/plexica/plexica/commit/a3c1a808efe1d8d7bc7dd8368f9ced4de88d686a","sha":"a3c1a808efe1d8d7bc7dd8368f9ced4de88d686a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/commits/a3c1a808efe1d8d7bc7dd8368f9ced4de88d686a"}],"sha":"93d370f5ea657735210ce580d1d91aca39a50125","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/commits/93d370f5ea657735210ce580d1d91aca39a50125"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/commits/a3c1a808efe1d8d7bc7dd8368f9ced4de88d686a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T11:36:40Z","email":"muse-spark@plexica.local","name":"muse-spark"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T11:36:40Z","email":"muse-spark@plexica.local","name":"muse-spark"},"message":"fix(i18n): cast updated_by to uuid + clear session before member switch in E2E\n\n- PUT /tenant/translations/:key failed with ''column updated_by is of type uuid\n  but expression is of type text'' (Prisma $queryRaw binds text): add the\n  explicit ::uuid cast matching the repo convention (notification/outbox/email\n  repositories)\n- tenant-translation-overrides test 1 hung in loginAsMember after loginAsAdmin\n  on the same page (stale sessionStorage token + Keycloak SSO cookie); clear\n  both before the identity switch, matching plugin-system/ac-02-authorization","tree":{"sha":"0eee1631cf48f9448da5eb84c7ab600125f3b1de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/git/trees/0eee1631cf48f9448da5eb84c7ab600125f3b1de"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/git/commits/a3c1a808efe1d8d7bc7dd8368f9ced4de88d686a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/plexica/plexica/commit/a3c1a808efe1d8d7bc7dd8368f9ced4de88d686a","node_id":"C_kwDORxknwtoAKGEzYzFhODA4ZWZlMWQ4ZDdiYzdkZDgzNjhmOWNlZDRkZTg4ZDY4NmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/plexica/plexica/commit/5f09f72838b9906e8e6157da04ceee1ba3d8832d","sha":"5f09f72838b9906e8e6157da04ceee1ba3d8832d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/commits/5f09f72838b9906e8e6157da04ceee1ba3d8832d"}],"sha":"a3c1a808efe1d8d7bc7dd8368f9ced4de88d686a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/commits/a3c1a808efe1d8d7bc7dd8368f9ced4de88d686a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/commits/5f09f72838b9906e8e6157da04ceee1ba3d8832d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T13:00:14Z","email":"muse-spark@plexica.local","name":"muse-spark"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T13:00:14Z","email":"muse-spark@plexica.local","name":"muse-spark"},"message":"fix(e2e): scope i18n specs to role links + restore EN in finally\n\nSidebar renders twice (desktop aside + hidden drawer), so getByText nav labels\nhit 2 elements (strict-mode violation). Switch to getByRole(''link'', exact)\nwhich excludes display:none from the a11y tree. A failed assertion previously\nleaked the IT profile (shared server state) into downstream specs waiting for\nEN strings (Crea workspace, Esci) - invitation-flow/logout/notification-center\ncascade. Restore EN in finally so no failure path leaks the locale.","tree":{"sha":"883f4df1c1bbe555ba229c34e078d1eec6e65ff6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/git/trees/883f4df1c1bbe555ba229c34e078d1eec6e65ff6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/git/commits/5f09f72838b9906e8e6157da04ceee1ba3d8832d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/plexica/plexica/commit/5f09f72838b9906e8e6157da04ceee1ba3d8832d","node_id":"C_kwDORxknwtoAKDVmMDlmNzI4MzhiOTkwNmU4ZTYxNTdkYTA0Y2VlZTFiYTNkODgzMmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/plexica/plexica/commit/7844eabf050f7f77f500b9a171aa1a2c870637fc","sha":"7844eabf050f7f77f500b9a171aa1a2c870637fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/commits/7844eabf050f7f77f500b9a171aa1a2c870637fc"}],"sha":"5f09f72838b9906e8e6157da04ceee1ba3d8832d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/commits/5f09f72838b9906e8e6157da04ceee1ba3d8832d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/commits/7844eabf050f7f77f500b9a171aa1a2c870637fc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T12:22:21Z","email":"muse-spark@plexica.local","name":"muse-spark"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T12:22:21Z","email":"muse-spark@plexica.local","name":"muse-spark"},"message":"fix(web): restore ToastViewport inside ToastProvider to unblock boot\n\nThe IntlMessageProvider reorder moved ToastViewport outside ToastProvider;\nRadix throws on first render (''ToastViewport must be used within\nToastProvider''), unmounting the tree and blocking the Keycloak auth redirect\n(CI contract E2E timed out waiting for /realms/ on both projects).\nReproduced headless; one-line nesting fix restores the PR #195 invariant.","tree":{"sha":"be8ec62ca204c2a2d7155544caeeb110f2474fd3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/git/trees/be8ec62ca204c2a2d7155544caeeb110f2474fd3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/git/commits/7844eabf050f7f77f500b9a171aa1a2c870637fc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/plexica/plexica/commit/7844eabf050f7f77f500b9a171aa1a2c870637fc","node_id":"C_kwDORxknwtoAKDc4NDRlYWJmMDUwZjdmNzdmNTAwYjlhMTcxYWExYTJjODcwNjM3ZmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/plexica/plexica/commit/795059d90b397e5444fca71ed2717415addd617f","sha":"795059d90b397e5444fca71ed2717415addd617f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/commits/795059d90b397e5444fca71ed2717415addd617f"}],"sha":"7844eabf050f7f77f500b9a171aa1a2c870637fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/commits/7844eabf050f7f77f500b9a171aa1a2c870637fc"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/commits/795059d90b397e5444fca71ed2717415addd617f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T11:55:15Z","email":"muse-spark@plexica.local","name":"muse-spark"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T11:55:15Z","email":"muse-spark@plexica.local","name":"muse-spark"},"message":"fix(i18n): break plugin-bundle fetch/re-render loop + presign batching\n\nHIGH: loadPluginI18n now no-ops when hasPluginBundle (was dead code), the\nslot wrappers memoize filtered entries (render-stable deps), and the registry\nnotifies only on real message change with a per-locale monotonic counter\n(replaces the same-ms Date.now() sum).\n\nMEDIUM: presign remoteEntry + all locales in one parallel Promise.all (N\ninstalls = 1 storage latency); useWorkspacePlugins staleTime 5min +\nrefetchOnWindowFocus false. MINOR: failed locale presign drops just that\nlocale; manifest i18n.bundles constrained BCP-47-lite + deduped. CRM example\nids unified to plugin.crm.* with defaultMessage (crm.* duplicates purged from\ncore catalogs). Queries gated on accessToken; value trim + whitespace = delete.\n\n16 new tests (111 web + 688 core unit passing).","tree":{"sha":"51f4a47e5d9dfadd197604f2e3f46e52219dc52d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/git/trees/51f4a47e5d9dfadd197604f2e3f46e52219dc52d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/git/commits/795059d90b397e5444fca71ed2717415addd617f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/plexica/plexica/commit/795059d90b397e5444fca71ed2717415addd617f","node_id":"C_kwDORxknwtoAKDc5NTA1OWQ5MGIzOTdlNTQ0NGZjYTcxZWQyNzE3NDE1YWRkZDYxN2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/plexica/plexica/commit/615e35c217e5ab5d8596d732b981e69526dab3a4","sha":"615e35c217e5ab5d8596d732b981e69526dab3a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/commits/615e35c217e5ab5d8596d732b981e69526dab3a4"}],"sha":"795059d90b397e5444fca71ed2717415addd617f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/commits/795059d90b397e5444fca71ed2717415addd617f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/commits/615e35c217e5ab5d8596d732b981e69526dab3a4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T11:15:15Z","email":"muse-spark@plexica.local","name":"muse-spark"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T11:15:15Z","email":"muse-spark@plexica.local","name":"muse-spark"},"message":"fix(i18n): address Phase 4 review findings (3 blockers + 5 majors)\n\n- i18n-keys test: resolve CRM fixtures from import.meta.url (plugin block now\n  runs) and assert the real D-8 invariant (unprefixed files + schema\n  acceptance + plugin.crm.* merged keys + en/it parity), not its inverse\n- Serve plugin i18n bundles in prod/E2E: upload dist-ui/i18n/*.json to\n  plugins/{slug}/{version}/i18n/ per-locale (all publish paths), marketplace\n  returns explicit per-object presigned i18nBundleUrls (no SigV4 sibling\n  leak), production fixture manifest declares i18n.bundles en/it\n- Auth E2E direct requests with freshBearer + tenantApiUrl (member 403 and\n  admin 200 are now actually asserted)\n- Audit translation writes: targetId null, key/locale/value in JSON facets\n  (was feeding keys into a UUID column -> silent audit loss)\n- Override editor: re-sync draft on value change (revert clears field) and\n  surface PUT errors via localized feedback\n- Dedupe safeTimezone (lib exports, hook imports); gate bootstrap locale sync\n  to initial profile load (no EN->IT flicker on unrelated refetches)\n- Dedupe eslint-plugin-formatjs to root; byte-accurate bundle size cap\n  (TextEncoder); web lint green with formatjs rule, zero violations\n\n99 web + 684 core unit passing.","tree":{"sha":"0ed716969435f436ab79c953de93b721dd5c0a3c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/git/trees/0ed716969435f436ab79c953de93b721dd5c0a3c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/git/commits/615e35c217e5ab5d8596d732b981e69526dab3a4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/plexica/plexica/commit/615e35c217e5ab5d8596d732b981e69526dab3a4","node_id":"C_kwDORxknwtoAKDYxNWUzNWMyMTdlNWFiNWQ4NTk2ZDczMmI5ODFlNjk1MjZkYWIzYTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/plexica/plexica/commit/6f1923c5b22ca63d16789e9cbd29aa8dcca1a186","sha":"6f1923c5b22ca63d16789e9cbd29aa8dcca1a186","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/commits/6f1923c5b22ca63d16789e9cbd29aa8dcca1a186"}],"sha":"615e35c217e5ab5d8596d732b981e69526dab3a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/commits/615e35c217e5ab5d8596d732b981e69526dab3a4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8351507?v=4","events_url