g false accepts the payload into the buffer — it only\nsignals backpressure. writeEvent now returns a discriminated SseWriteResult\n(written+backpressure vs not-written drain/closed); publish queues ONLY the\ndrain-pending skip, and flush no longer unshifts an already-written frame.\nEliminates duplicate SSE notification emission on drain. Migration none.\n\nTests updated/added (663 total passing).","tree":{"sha":"f7b5f0c0f08615d0b036e9b081621dcabab9e1d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/git/trees/f7b5f0c0f08615d0b036e9b081621dcabab9e1d9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/git/commits/f5bab0e3b24251b9f08bc2f61fc1b0189972e460","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/plexica/plexica/commit/f5bab0e3b24251b9f08bc2f61fc1b0189972e460","node_id":"C_kwDORxknwtoAKGY1YmFiMGUzYjI0MjUxYjlmMDhiYzJmNjFmYzFiMDE4OTk3MmU0NjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/plexica/plexica/commit/c58925b8612c6693919a462785f466912d0e2167","sha":"c58925b8612c6693919a462785f466912d0e2167","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/commits/c58925b8612c6693919a462785f466912d0e2167"}],"sha":"f5bab0e3b24251b9f08bc2f61fc1b0189972e460","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/commits/f5bab0e3b24251b9f08bc2f61fc1b0189972e460"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/commits/c58925b8612c6693919a462785f466912d0e2167/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-19T19:31:56Z","email":"muse-spark@plexica.local","name":"muse-spark"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-19T19:31:56Z","email":"muse-spark@plexica.local","name":"muse-spark"},"message":"fix(notification): make email delivery effectively-once via delivered_at marker\n\nWrite delivered_at immediately after sendMailNow resolves (fenced by lease),\nbefore settle; claim() excludes delivered rows and retires delivered-but-\nunsettled rows to sent without re-sending. A stale marker write stops with\nno settle and no re-send. Closes the CodeRabbit #10 duplicate-send window\n(settle failure after confirmed delivery). Migration 016.\n\n10 new tests (661 total passing).","tree":{"sha":"b5f699066d6e2f18f80f5e22429811d41762090c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/git/trees/b5f699066d6e2f18f80f5e22429811d41762090c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/git/commits/c58925b8612c6693919a462785f466912d0e2167","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/plexica/plexica/commit/c58925b8612c6693919a462785f466912d0e2167","node_id":"C_kwDORxknwtoAKGM1ODkyNWI4NjEyYzY2OTM5MTlhNDYyNzg1ZjQ2NjkxMmQwZTIxNjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/plexica/plexica/commit/e8316ce6f5fb1fd10f1be95bde8d6e570b74246a","sha":"e8316ce6f5fb1fd10f1be95bde8d6e570b74246a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/commits/e8316ce6f5fb1fd10f1be95bde8d6e570b74246a"}],"sha":"c58925b8612c6693919a462785f466912d0e2167","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/commits/c58925b8612c6693919a462785f466912d0e2167"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/commits/e8316ce6f5fb1fd10f1be95bde8d6e570b74246a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T17:34:04Z","email":"muse-spark@plexica.local","name":"muse-spark"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T17:34:04Z","email":"muse-spark@plexica.local","name":"muse-spark"},"message":"fix(notification): retain backpressured SSE frames in bounded per-connection queue\n\nWhen writeEvent returns false (writableNeedDrain), publish now queues the\nframe in a bounded FIFO (bound 32 via NOTIFICATION_SSE_PENDING_QUEUE_BOUND)\nand flushes it from the response drain handler, instead of dropping it.\nEvict-on-overflow guards memory (caps per-user buffering at 160 frames with\nthe 5-conn/user cap); queue + listener cleared on close/error/evict.\n\n5 new tests (651 total passing).","tree":{"sha":"e4756e67a03c25cbfbf0a633a208cbdbfc3f2c34","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/git/trees/e4756e67a03c25cbfbf0a633a208cbdbfc3f2c34"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/git/commits/e8316ce6f5fb1fd10f1be95bde8d6e570b74246a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/plexica/plexica/commit/e8316ce6f5fb1fd10f1be95bde8d6e570b74246a","node_id":"C_kwDORxknwtoAKGU4MzE2Y2U2ZjVmYjFmZDEwZjFiZTk1YmRlOGQ2ZTU3MGI3NDI0NmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/plexica/plexica/commit/e859c49b6f1cf1a2bc0f21445d5b9cb1ffe0f174","sha":"e859c49b6f1cf1a2bc0f21445d5b9cb1ffe0f174","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/commits/e859c49b6f1cf1a2bc0f21445d5b9cb1ffe0f174"}],"sha":"e8316ce6f5fb1fd10f1be95bde8d6e570b74246a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/commits/e8316ce6f5fb1fd10f1be95bde8d6e570b74246a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/commits/e859c49b6f1cf1a2bc0f21445d5b9cb1ffe0f174/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T16:32:23Z","email":"muse-spark@plexica.local","name":"muse-spark"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T16:32:23Z","email":"muse-spark@plexica.local","name":"muse-spark"},"message":"fix(notification): supervise consumer startup and refine heartbeat backpressure\n\n- Add consumer-supervisor: 5 retries with 1s/2s/4s/8s/16s backoff, unref''d\n  timers, stop signal on shutdown (no restart during/after teardown),\n  exhausted retries log and stop (never loop forever)\n- Heartbeat/publish treat a false res.write or writableNeedDrain as\n  backpressure (skip, resume after drain) and evict ONLY on closed/\n  destroyed/ended/errored sockets; update tests accordingly\n\n12 new tests (646 total passing).","tree":{"sha":"be341d5a04fa1b7d38a4eb63bd84f82759fcb7ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/git/trees/be341d5a04fa1b7d38a4eb63bd84f82759fcb7ed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/git/commits/e859c49b6f1cf1a2bc0f21445d5b9cb1ffe0f174","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/plexica/plexica/commit/e859c49b6f1cf1a2bc0f21445d5b9cb1ffe0f174","node_id":"C_kwDORxknwtoAKGU4NTljNDliNmYxY2YxYTJiYzBmMjE0NDVkNWI5Y2IxZmZlMGYxNzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/plexica/plexica/commit/47cfbce1981718b38a6a000b4676425c75a873a7","sha":"47cfbce1981718b38a6a000b4676425c75a873a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/commits/47cfbce1981718b38a6a000b4676425c75a873a7"}],"sha":"e859c49b6f1cf1a2bc0f21445d5b9cb1ffe0f174","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/commits/e859c49b6f1cf1a2bc0f21445d5b9cb1ffe0f174"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/commits/47cfbce1981718b38a6a000b4676425c75a873a7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T15:34:41Z","email":"muse-spark@plexica.local","name":"muse-spark"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T15:34:41Z","email":"muse-spark@plexica.local","name":"muse-spark"},"message":"fix(notification): address final 5 CodeRabbit comments (lease fencing, SMTP abort)\n\n- Abort hung SMTP before retry: socket timeouts 10s to 8s so nodemailer\n  deterministically destroys the connection before the 10s race backstop\n  rejects; close transport on every path (timeout/success/failure)\n- Correct misleading duplicate-on-re-claim comment; GDPR-purged rows are\n  0-row updates (no re-send)\n- Add lease_token to core.email_queue (migration 015); claim stamps a\n  per-batch UUID, settle predicates on id AND lease_token (stale 0-row\n  update ignored)\n- writeHeartbeat returns res.write result; evict connection on failed\n  heartbeat write (mirrors publish eviction)\n\n15 new tests (634 total passing).","tree":{"sha":"c5934d71a114748886f02312bda782c1cb09af22","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/git/trees/c5934d71a114748886f02312bda782c1cb09af22"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/git/commits/47cfbce1981718b38a6a000b4676425c75a873a7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/plexica/plexica/commit/47cfbce1981718b38a6a000b4676425c75a873a7","node_id":"C_kwDORxknwtoAKDQ3Y2ZiY2UxOTgxNzE4YjM4YTZhMDAwYjQ2NzY0MjVjNzVhODczYTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/plexica/plexica/commit/046f079ac8a7bc8ea50148514ea5a5b4544a4c9e","sha":"046f079ac8a7bc8ea50148514ea5a5b4544a4c9e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/commits/046f079ac8a7bc8ea50148514ea5a5b4544a4c9e"}],"sha":"47cfbce1981718b38a6a000b4676425c75a873a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/commits/47cfbce1981718b38a6a000b4676425c75a873a7"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/commits/046f079ac8a7bc8ea50148514ea5a5b4544a4c9e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T13:35:48Z","email":"muse-spark@plexica.local","name":"muse-spark"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T13:35:48Z","email":"muse-spark@plexica.local","name":"muse-spark"},"message":"fix(notification): address CodeRabbit round-2 residuals\n\n- Use raw (unescaped) tenantName/workspaceName in email subjects; keep\n  escaping only in the HTML body (queue worker forwards subject as plain\n  text, so HTML entities leaked into the subject line)\n- Surface multi().exec() error tuples in the consumer cap (a persistent\n  EXPIRE failure left the counter TTL-less, violating ADR-012 fail-open)\n- Require valid UUID for workspaceId in consumer pipeline (malformed\n  values hit the ::uuid cast and dead-lettered)\n\n7 new tests (619 total passing).","tree":{"sha":"d72da89d0e17f83642fb853d93df816752d9e775","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/git/trees/d72da89d0e17f83642fb853d93df816752d9e775"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/git/commits/046f079ac8a7bc8ea50148514ea5a5b4544a4c9e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/plexica/plexica/commit/046f079ac8a7bc8ea50148514ea5a5b4544a4c9e","node_id":"C_kwDORxknwtoAKDA0NmYwNzlhYzhhN2JjOGVhNTAxNDg1MTRlYTVhNWI0NTQ0YTRjOWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/plexica/plexica/commit/5cf150bb613cb7d1b931fb94276f7bdf9e279cd9","sha":"5cf150bb613cb7d1b931fb94276f7bdf9e279cd9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/commits/5cf150bb613cb7d1b931fb94276f7bdf9e279cd9"}],"sha":"046f079ac8a7bc8ea50148514ea5a5b4544a4c9e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/commits/046f079ac8a7bc8ea50148514ea5a5b4544a4c9e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/commits/5cf150bb613cb7d1b931fb94276f7bdf9e279cd9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T13:05:04Z","email":"muse-spark@plexica.local","name":"muse-spark"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T13:05:04Z","email":"muse-spark@plexica.local","name":"muse-spark"},"message":"fix(notification): address 10 valid CodeRabbit findings on notifications core\n\n- Fix consumer-email query to use ''invitation'' table (42P01 dead-letter on\n  every tenant-user invite email)\n- Escape invitation HTML (CWE-79) via shared escapeHtml for tenantName and\n  inviteUrl in renderInvitationHtml\n- Make INCR/EXPIRE atomic with redis multi().expire(..., ''NX'') in consumer\n  cap and emit rate limiter (TTL-less key suppression)\n- Exclude non-active tenants from email claim (purge/worker race)\n- Validate workspaceId in consumer pipeline (uuid cast DLQ)\n- Drop unvalidated payload.event_id override (global dedupe_key collision)\n- Reject empty plugin type suffix in schema refine\n- Wrap prefs read-merge-write in transaction with SELECT FOR UPDATE\n- Add consumer startup/shutdown closing guard (race on teardown)\n\n29 new tests (612 total passing).","tree":{"sha":"763b1c67c2b8a6ea92b027a30d915c5bea270e25","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/git/trees/763b1c67c2b8a6ea92b027a30d915c5bea270e25"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/git/commits/5cf150bb613cb7d1b931fb94276f7bdf9e279cd9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/plexica/plexica/commit/5cf150bb613cb7d1b931fb94276f7bdf9e279cd9","node_id":"C_kwDORxknwtoAKDVjZjE1MGJiNjEzY2I3ZDFiOTMxZmI5NDI3NmY3YmRmOWUyNzljZDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/plexica/plexica/commit/0ed102b1e11a537b9c5d87618038c6ddf0b763ae","sha":"0ed102b1e11a537b9c5d87618038c6ddf0b763ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/commits/0ed102b1e11a537b9c5d87618038c6ddf0b763ae"}],"sha":"5cf150bb613cb7d1b931fb94276f7bdf9e279cd9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/commits/5cf150bb613cb7d1b931fb94276f7bdf9e279cd9"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/commits/0ed102b1e11a537b9c5d87618038c6ddf0b763ae/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T11:52:40Z","email":"muse-spark@plexica.local","name":"muse-spark"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T11:52:40Z","email":"muse-spark@plexica.local","name":"muse-spark"},"message":"fix(admin): register email_queue_purge step in deletion panel and E2E\n\nThe 5-step saga crashed the admin deletion panel: STEP_LABELS lacked\nemail_queue_purge so intl.formatMessage(undefined) threw during render and\nunmounted the app. Add the step label + i18n string + DeletionStepName type\nunion, and update the deletion E2E to expect 5 steps. Verified locally:\n005-07-deletion passes (18.4s).","tree":{"sha":"fe27903673546242af7491d02910d890829c3f54","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/git/trees/fe27903673546242af7491d02910d890829c3f54"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/git/commits/0ed102b1e11a537b9c5d87618038c6ddf0b763ae","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/plexica/plexica/commit/0ed102b1e11a537b9c5d87618038c6ddf0b763ae","node_id":"C_kwDORxknwtoAKDBlZDEwMmIxZTExYTUzN2I5YzVkODc2MTgwMzhjNmRkZjBiNzYzYWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/plexica/plexica/commit/3203b7fc0917e2bc210f42420002b815bc7b135c","sha":"3203b7fc0917e2bc210f42420002b815bc7b135c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/commits/3203b7fc0917e2bc210f42420002b815bc7b135c"}],"sha":"0ed102b1e11a537b9c5d87618038c6ddf0b763ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/commits/0ed102b1e11a537b9c5d87618038c6ddf0b763ae"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/commits/3203b7fc0917e2bc210f42420002b815bc7b135c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T11:12:28Z","email":"muse-spark@plexica.local","name":"muse-spark"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T11:12:28Z","email":"muse-spark@plexica.local","name":"muse-spark"},"message":"fix(notification): wire email queue worker and consumer into bootstrap\n\nStart email queue worker before notification consumer in\nstartBackgroundServices (worker is the email delivery critical path),\nwith fire-and-forget graceful degradation on Kafka/Redis unavailability\nmatching the existing bootstrap pattern. Add reverse-order teardown.\nProvision plexica.workspace.invite + plexica.notification topics in\nredpanda init so the consumer can subscribe on fresh stacks.\nVerified live: worker sent queued email to Mailpit, consumer start/stop OK.","tree":{"sha":"aebd9e39e891cee6bab03ce8c4438080a788e458","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/plexica/plexica/git/trees/aebd9e39e891cee6bab03ce8c4438080a788e458"},"url":"https://api.