"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"sweimer","providerType":"User"},"email":"sweimer65@hotmail.com","name":"Scott Weimer"},"authoredDate":"2026-03-28T01:13:25Z","committedDate":"2026-03-28T01:13:25Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"sweimer","providerType":"User"},"email":"sweimer65@hotmail.com","name":"Scott Weimer"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T22:22:59.326Z","repositoryId":1192861608,"sha":"153b91ae53c3c5360927726eeb9392a2ea2c9140"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"sweimer","providerType":"User"},"email":"sweimer65@hotmail.com","name":"Scott Weimer"},"authoredDate":"2026-03-28T01:11:37Z","committedDate":"2026-03-28T01:11:37Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"sweimer","providerType":"User"},"email":"sweimer65@hotmail.com","name":"Scott Weimer"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T22:22:59.326Z","repositoryId":1192861608,"sha":"ad6d0b5e4631d283d52394b4f44be30c5b12be32"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"sweimer","providerType":"User"},"email":"sweimer65@hotmail.com","name":"Scott Weimer"},"authoredDate":"2026-03-28T01:09:15Z","committedDate":"2026-03-28T01:09:15Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"sweimer","providerType":"User"},"email":"sweimer65@hotmail.com","name":"Scott Weimer"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T22:22:59.326Z","repositoryId":1192861608,"sha":"b3b19ea0ee3d01045dc67bf02c1e256fe1c555ce"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-08T22:22:59.326Z","raw":[{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1145769?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sweimer","id":1145769,"login":"sweimer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNDU3Njk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sweimer/sandbox-glazed/commits/ee5b5d85d04054283e374a81b69bad1669e098c2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-13T19:46:55Z","email":"sweimer65@hotmail.com","name":"Scott Weimer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-13T19:46:55Z","email":"sweimer65@hotmail.com","name":"Scott Weimer"},"message":"fix: crx hard-restart Apache + curl warmup replaces flaky drush warmup\n\nGraceful apache2ctl stop left workers stuck in Drupal bootstrap, causing\nport 80 deadlocks on cold starts. New crx kills master via PID file + pkill,\nwaits for HTTP response via curl loop (accepts 200/301/302/404), then rebuilds\nrouter with drush. Logs session end/start workflow to prevent recurrence.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f266017c678ae98179f1544829130b9ac3b69e49","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sweimer/sandbox-glazed/git/trees/f266017c678ae98179f1544829130b9ac3b69e49"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sweimer/sandbox-glazed/git/commits/ee5b5d85d04054283e374a81b69bad1669e098c2","verification":{"payload":"tree f266017c678ae98179f1544829130b9ac3b69e49\nparent 308374fded2db76ea99fe657167849e916996f17\nauthor Scott Weimer <sweimer65@hotmail.com> 1776109615 -0400\ncommitter Scott Weimer <sweimer65@hotmail.com> 1776109615 -0400\n\nfix: crx hard-restart Apache + curl warmup replaces flaky drush warmup\n\nGraceful apache2ctl stop left workers stuck in Drupal bootstrap, causing\nport 80 deadlocks on cold starts. New crx kills master via PID file + pkill,\nwaits for HTTP response via curl loop (accepts 200/301/302/404), then rebuilds\nrouter with drush. Logs session end/start workflow to prevent recurrence.\n\nCo-Autho