2c9a25599c8f4e28f151afe","node_id":"C_kwDORxmfqNoAKDM4YTExY2RiMjg5OTU4ODA3MmM5YTI1NTk5YzhmNGUyOGYxNTFhZmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sweimer/sandbox-glazed/commit/c064e366f1cdb5b37678d6df3fc341420cac7b44","sha":"c064e366f1cdb5b37678d6df3fc341420cac7b44","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sweimer/sandbox-glazed/commits/c064e366f1cdb5b37678d6df3fc341420cac7b44"}],"sha":"38a11cdb2899588072c9a25599c8f4e28f151afe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sweimer/sandbox-glazed/commits/38a11cdb2899588072c9a25599c8f4e28f151afe"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1145769?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sweimer","id":1145769,"login":"sweimer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNDU3Njk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sweimer/sandbox-glazed/commits/c064e366f1cdb5b37678d6df3fc341420cac7b44/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-07T16:12:07Z","email":"sweimer65@hotmail.com","name":"Scott Weimer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-07T16:12:07Z","email":"sweimer65@hotmail.com","name":"Scott Weimer"},"message":"fix: Drupal bootstrap deadlock — /etc/hosts blackhole + PHP fatal + settings\n\n- .lando.yml build_as_root: blackhole external module HTTP endpoints in /etc/hosts\n  (updates.drupal.org, www.drupal.org, dxpr.com, api.openai.com, googleapis.com)\n  Root cause: Docker DNS hangs indefinitely on these hosts during Drupal bootstrap,\n  blocking all Apache workers simultaneously. Blackholing causes instant ECONNREFUSED\n  instead — bootstrap now completes in ~30s vs hanging indefinitely.\n- settings.php: add connect_timeout=3 and timeout=5 inside Lando block only.\n  Pantheon retains timeout=30 (needed for Anthropic API calls).\n  Also disable update.settings check.disabled=TRUE locally (no outbound update checks).\n- hudx_3pd_assets AssetsController: rename config() → themeConfig() to fix PHP fatal.\n  ControllerBase::config($name) returns ImmutableConfig; child method returning\n  JsonResponse caused \"Declaration must be compatible\" fatal on every class autoload,\n  breaking router rebuild and Drupal bootstrap.\n- hudx_3pd_assets routing.yml: updated controller reference to ::themeConfig\n\nNote: /etc/hosts blackhole requires lando rebuild -y to take effect permanently.\nCurrently applied manually to running container — will auto-apply on next rebuild.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2fe45d6085391ca6b7db3c067a70bba3f783555b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sweimer/sandbox-glazed/git/trees/2fe45d6085391ca6b7db3c067a70bba3f783555b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sweimer/sandbox-glazed/git/commits/c064e366f1cdb5b37678d6df3fc341420cac7b44","verification":{"payload":"tree 2fe45d6085391ca6b7db3c067a70bba3f783555b\nparent cb2bb4b94b239af7879956998259e32c9c943b9b\nauthor Scott Weimer <sweimer65@hotmail.com> 1775578327 -0400\ncommitter Scott Weimer <sweimer65@hotmail.com> 1775578327 -0400\n\nfix: Drupal bootstrap deadlock — /etc/hosts blackhole + PHP fatal + settings\n\n- .lando.yml build_as_root: blackhole external module HTTP endpoints in /etc/hosts\n  (updates.drupal.org, www.drupal.org, dxpr.com, api.openai.com, googleapis.com)\n  Root cause: Docker DNS hangs indefinitely on these hosts during Drupal bootstrap,\n  blocking all Apache workers simultaneously. Blackholing causes instant ECONNREFUSED\n  instead — bootstrap now completes in ~30s vs hanging indefinitely.\n- settings.php: add connect_timeout=3 and timeout=5 inside Lando block only.\n  Pantheon retains timeout=30 (needed for Anthropic API calls).\n  Also disable update.settings check.disabled=TRUE locally (no outbound update checks).\n- hudx_3pd_assets AssetsController: rename config() → themeConfig() to fix PHP fatal.\n  ControllerBase::config($name) returns ImmutableConfig; child method returning\n  JsonResponse caused \"Declaration must be compatible\" fatal on every class autoload,\n  breaking router rebuild and Drupal bootstrap.\n- hudx_3pd_assets routing.yml: updated controller reference to ::themeConfig\n\nNote: /etc/hosts blackhole requires lando rebuild -y to take effect permanently.\nCurrently applied manually to running container — will auto-apply on next rebuild.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg/ovTxW8D+tSKYPFFbOIrxyscoA\n3PLPYOO3sKmqX4lh0AAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQE+fbosPsLHv1QAZuUb4MSBrXl1c70eXn0/BWffJ5Qlk4gUDpdJvRt2u1Iro2WG/Fz\n5m0jyCI0FAYqdCoU2zbAY=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-07T16:12:13Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1145769?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sweimer","id":1145769,"login":"sweimer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNDU3Njk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.gith