page.js: reads themeSystem from 3pd.config.json, injects correct CDN\n  (Bootstrap/USWDS/assetsUrl) into dist/page.html at build time; @3pd-demo guard\n- starter-template: PUBLIC_ASSETS_URL env var + Layout.astro conditional loading\n  from assetsUrl vs local drupal-dev-styles.css; @3pd-demo marker on index.astro\n- astro-forms-app.js: writes PUBLIC_ASSETS_URL from assetsUrl, skips styles sync\n- PROMPT.txt: documented all new patterns (themeSystem, assetsUrl, hudx_3pd_assets)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2c4b66bfa31208cdf7f912e2939c44a6f944f4ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sweimer/sandbox-glazed/git/trees/2c4b66bfa31208cdf7f912e2939c44a6f944f4ad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sweimer/sandbox-glazed/git/commits/8a8258307b365fdb7367acd5f7dd7a96946495bd","verification":{"payload":"tree 2c4b66bfa31208cdf7f912e2939c44a6f944f4ad\nparent d7f9dabcac93682fdcdea8a069852ae249c2d5c8\nauthor Scott Weimer <sweimer65@hotmail.com> 1775153878 -0400\ncommitter Scott Weimer <sweimer65@hotmail.com> 1775153878 -0400\n\nfeat: theme bridge infrastructure — hudx_3pd_assets module + themeSystem portability\n\nAdds a three-part system making the astro-forms starter kit portable across\nany Drupal project regardless of design system (Bootstrap, USWDS, or custom).\n\n- web/modules/custom/hudx_3pd_assets/: new Drupal module that serves the active\n  theme''s compiled CSS/JS/config at public URLs (/3pd-assets/styles.css, etc.)\n- create-page.js: reads themeSystem from 3pd.config.json, injects correct CDN\n  (Bootstrap/USWDS/assetsUrl) into dist/page.html at build time; @3pd-demo guard\n- starter-template: PUBLIC_ASSETS_URL env var + Layout.astro conditional loading\n  from assetsUrl vs local drupal-dev-styles.css; @3pd-demo marker on index.astro\n- astro-forms-app.js: writes PUBLIC_ASSETS_URL from assetsUrl, skips styles sync\n- PROMPT.txt: documented all new patterns (themeSystem, assetsUrl, hudx_3pd_assets)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Clau