hook_theme_suggestions_page_alter applies page template on route\n  - PageController renders at a real page route (/<appName>)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"233085cea4bcc540be06215f06dc709c3b134c60","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sweimer/sandbox-glazed/git/trees/233085cea4bcc540be06215f06dc709c3b134c60"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sweimer/sandbox-glazed/git/commits/b7d0c225ffed1e675556dbde60b7c5d576e8f5ac","verification":{"payload":"tree 233085cea4bcc540be06215f06dc709c3b134c60\nparent a2e0659d03421ddabff01dc9f59f4247fe102fc1\nauthor Scott Weimer <sweimer65@hotmail.com> 1775076685 -0400\ncommitter Scott Weimer <sweimer65@hotmail.com> 1775076685 -0400\n\nfeat: add 3pd astro-forms page command (roadmap #3)\n\nAdds a full-page Drupal module generator for Astro Forms apps.\nUnlike the block generator, the page generator creates a real Drupal\nroute that owns the entire page viewport — no block chrome, no regions.\n\nNew files:\n  apps/0.starter-astro-forms/create-page.js\n  starter-scripts/cli/commands/astro-forms-page.js\n  starter-scripts/cli/index.js (registered 3pd astro-forms page)\n\nKey differences from block mode:\n  - No Plugin/Block/ class\n  - Two twig files: content template (Astro body HTML) + page template\n    (page--{hyphenName}-page.html.twig strips all Drupal regions)\n  - hook_theme_suggestions_page_alter applies page template on route\n  - PageController renders at a real page route (/<appName>)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg/ovTxW8D+tSKYPFFbOIrxyscoA\n3PLPYOO3sKmqX4lh0AAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQI8c5LXCcMAzW1p3A9oO5Bwj0o6eUssj+Vxix99OP6f5lhGLmAILcFh6uTB4qVvO/t\naokI4vDCj05NRX7exSRQ4=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-02T15:39:06Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubuserco