n- hudx-resize.js: add ResizeObserver on document.body to catch accordion\n  opens and dynamic content changes that don''t trigger window events\n- embed---sc-training: switched to embedUrl mode (CloudFront), removed\n  staticDir dependency — no static files needed in Drupal repo\n- inject-and-sync-s3.js: new script for injecting snippet + syncing to S3\n- PROMPT.txt: updated with all Muse debugging lessons learned\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f54eefb6a74639b14dbc6814c05ec03359abdb14","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sweimer/sandbox-glazed/git/trees/f54eefb6a74639b14dbc6814c05ec03359abdb14"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sweimer/sandbox-glazed/git/commits/3e84478bb08ae5fb6729392d9538b896b2ae7154","verification":{"payload":"tree f54eefb6a74639b14dbc6814c05ec03359abdb14\nparent 3a710e6ee1651cbee73491b132c18f4fddb05ee6\nauthor Scott Weimer <sweimer65@hotmail.com> 1774967930 -0400\ncommitter Scott Weimer <sweimer65@hotmail.com> 1774967930 -0400\n\nsmart embed: sc-training CloudFront POC fully working\n\n- hudx-resize.js: use body.scrollHeight only (documentElement pinned to\n  tallest-ever page in Muse multi-page sessions — caused all pages to\n  report 5736px regardless of content)\n- hudx-resize.js: debounce ALL events through shared 600ms timer (resize\n  cascade from parent iframe adjustment was inflating heights non-deterministically)\n- hudx-resize.js: add ResizeObserver on document.body to catch accordion\n  opens and dynamic content changes that don''t trigger window events\n- embed---sc-training: switched to embedUrl mode (CloudFront), removed\n  staticDir dependency — no static files needed in Drupal repo\n- inject-and-sync-s3.js: new script for injecting snippet + syncing to S3\n- PROMPT.txt: updated with all Muse debugging lessons learned\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAA