l":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sweimer/sandbox-glazed/commits/5ff3b75b477ccbc0a63eb7e0786a8ea2509ad3f2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-29T00:00:34Z","email":"sweimer65@hotmail.com","name":"Scott Weimer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-29T00:00:34Z","email":"sweimer65@hotmail.com","name":"Scott Weimer"},"message":"Commit services.yml so Pantheon gets CORS config for Astro dev\n\nWas gitignored — Pantheon had no CORS headers, blocking cross-origin\nJSON:API fetches from Astro dev server (localhost:4321).\nUpdated .gitignore to only exclude services.local.yml.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cb105b7041b2b36d500eab51056adefe1129ba3a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sweimer/sandbox-glazed/git/trees/cb105b7041b2b36d500eab51056adefe1129ba3a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sweimer/sandbox-glazed/git/commits/5ff3b75b477ccbc0a63eb7e0786a8ea2509ad3f2","verification":{"payload":"tree cb105b7041b2b36d500eab51056adefe1129ba3a\nparent ff51995ed6758793663e00d8a64356bb8cd50a37\nauthor Scott Weimer <sweimer65@hotmail.com> 1774742434 -0400\ncommitter Scott Weimer <sweimer65@hotmail.com> 1774742434 -0400\n\nCommit services.yml so Pantheon gets CORS config for Astro dev\n\nWas gitignored — Pantheon had no CORS headers, blocking cross-origin\nJSON:API fetches from Astro dev server (localhost:4321).\nUpdated .gitignore to only exclude services.local.yml.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg/ovTxW8D+tSKYPFFbOIrxyscoA\n3PLPYOO3sKmqX4lh0AAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQAwW/vdQspWwlz+NN57K8c1uuC/HI5F45VQYk8mgVcTLarC1v6NkGzNrdPP2wSw2oI\nqhDh6ZZlsO/oqj2TG+wwA=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-29T00:00:37Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1145769?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sweimer","id":1145769,"login":"sweimer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNDU3Njk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sweimer/sandbox-glazed/commit/5ff3b75b477ccbc0a63eb7e0786a8ea2509ad3f2","node_id":"C_kwDORxmfqNoAKDVmZjNiNzViNDc3Y2NiYzBhNjNlYjdlMDc4NmE4ZWEyNTA5YWQzZjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sweimer/sandbox-glazed/commit/ff51995ed6758793663e00d8a64356bb8cd50a37","sha":"ff51995ed6758793663e00d8a64356bb8cd50a37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sweimer/sandbox-glazed/commits/ff51995ed6758793663e00d8a64356bb8cd50a37"}],"sha":"5ff3b75b477ccbc0a63eb7e0786a8ea2509ad3f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sweimer/sandbox-glazed/commits/5ff3b75b477ccbc0a63eb7e0786a8ea2509ad3f2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1145769?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sweimer","id":1145769,"login":"sweimer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNDU3Njk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sweimer/sandbox-glazed/commits/ff51995ed6758793663e00d8a64356bb8cd50a37/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-28T23:56:05Z","email":"sweimer65@hotmail.com","name":"Scott Weimer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-28T23:56:05Z","email":"sweimer65@hotmail.com","name":"Scott Weimer"},"message":"Fix Lando bootstrap deadlock from external HTTP calls\n\nModules making DNS lookups during bootstrap (ai, dxpr_builder,\nannouncements_feed, update etc.) deadlock all Apache workers after\na lando rebuild. Fix: 5s HTTP client timeout in settings.php prevents\nany module from blocking bootstrap indefinitely.\n\nAlso add router table truncate + rebuild to lando crx command so\n\"No route found\" errors don''t appear after cache clears.\nRequires lando rebuild -y to take effect.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"33c9497528d40bdc14edff0194ae5441ee763f18","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sweimer/sandbox-glazed/git/trees/33c9497528d40bdc14edff0194ae5441ee763f18"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sweimer/sandbox-glazed/git/commits/ff51995ed6758793663e00d8a64356bb8cd50a37","verification":{"payload":"tree 33c9497528d40bdc14edff0194ae5441ee763f18\nparent 1a44c6713f5f938b4980c6b525b01ce6799d8d80\nauthor Scott Weimer <sweimer65@hotmail.com> 1774742165 -0400\ncommitter Scott Weimer <sweimer65@hotmail.com> 1774742165 -0400\n\nFix Lando bootstrap deadlock from external HTTP calls\n\nModules making DNS lookups during bootstrap (ai, dxpr_builder,\nannouncements_feed, update etc.) deadlock all Apache workers after\na lando rebuild. Fix: 5s HTTP client timeout in settings.php prevents\nany module from blocking bootstrap indefinitely.\n\nAlso add router table truncate + rebuild to lando crx command so\n\"No route found\" errors don''t appear after cache clears.\nRequires lando rebuild -y to take effect.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg/ovTxW8D+tSKYPFFbOIrxyscoA\n3PLPYOO3sKmqX4lh0AAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQJhqlp6rAIY1och6ypVKiy/LExI0JWyhETEn9YUPme72ycbphz15Tt9uaS9+VglHMY\nrSFev+lXNPdmzIogiKlQs=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-28T23:56:07Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1145769?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sweimer","id":1145769,"login":"sweimer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNDU3Njk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.git