ost_patterns, twig cache paths, and PantheonServiceProvider.\nvendor/ is included in the Pantheon push via GH Actions artifact.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2d4f32d0944f01b4001bc1724ee97185be662d98","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sweimer/sandbox-glazed/git/trees/2d4f32d0944f01b4001bc1724ee97185be662d98"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sweimer/sandbox-glazed/git/commits/3d03c923d90574d7825f8d89f6e89f410b4468c3","verification":{"payload":"tree 2d4f32d0944f01b4001bc1724ee97185be662d98\nparent 5bac0a086cedb604f001db66f8be3f181b41b971\nauthor Scott Weimer <sweimer65@hotmail.com> 1774731899 -0400\ncommitter Scott Weimer <sweimer65@hotmail.com> 1774731899 -0400\n\nLoad settings.pantheon.php from vendor/ (official Pantheon integration)\n\nPantheon passes DB credentials via PRESSFLOW_SETTINGS (JSON), not\nindividual DB_* env vars. Use the official file from\npantheon-systems/drupal-integrations which also sets hash_salt,\ntrusted_host_patterns, twig cache paths, and PantheonServiceProvider.\nvendor/ is included in the Pantheon push via GH Actions artifact.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg/ovTxW8D+tSKYPFFbOIrxyscoA\n3PLPYOO3sKmqX4lh0AAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQAOReCyUrpVT9f8yKMdwI0Tv2K0kWqXCA6Yoz7jHiOfGDCKgGIvqLuPaARCj51Uymv\nmqp4hAeBBOcCzI1AAe+Ag=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-28T21:05:03Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1145769?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sweimer","id":1145769,