ithub.com/users/sweimer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sweimer/sandbox-glazed/commits/5bac0a086cedb604f001db66f8be3f181b41b971/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-28T21:01:02Z","email":"sweimer65@hotmail.com","name":"Scott Weimer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-28T21:01:02Z","email":"sweimer65@hotmail.com","name":"Scott Weimer"},"message":"Fix Pantheon DB connection using environment variables\n\nsettings.pantheon.php is not auto-provided on custom sites.\nRead DB credentials directly from Pantheon''s injected env vars\n(DB_NAME, DB_USER, DB_PASSWORD, DB_HOST, DB_PORT), gated by\nPANTHEON_ENVIRONMENT check.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"87a330a740fe0a4c637bd33eeada831fae0e5275","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sweimer/sandbox-glazed/git/trees/87a330a740fe0a4c637bd33eeada831fae0e5275"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sweimer/sandbox-glazed/git/commits/5bac0a086cedb604f001db66f8be3f181b41b971","verification":{"payload":"tree 87a330a740fe0a4c637bd33eeada831fae0e5275\nparent f1f69cc12bc84f9c664749e36bf9d2066dcbd0f6\nauthor Scott Weimer <sweimer65@hotmail.com> 1774731662 -0400\ncommitter Scott Weimer <sweimer65@hotmail.com> 1774731662 -0400\n\nFix Pantheon DB connection using environment variables\n\nsettings.pantheon.php is not auto-provided on custom sites.\nRead DB credentials directly from Pantheon''s injected env vars\n(DB_NAME, DB_USER, DB_PASSWORD, DB_HOST, DB_PORT), gated by\nPANTHEON_ENVIRONMENT check.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg/ovTxW8D+tSKYPFFbOIrxyscoA\n3PLPYOO3sKmqX4lh0AAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQKHgnfdYSDxi1d9Iry+Gap1Llm9KrcKh9zN7kkPA1I1eaLbMY7fN2QILWT/7gWJvoa\nY3ZJBAsX45K6ZFXN3AGwI=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-28T21:01:04Z"}