hotmail.com","name":"Scott Weimer"},"message":"Remove invalid composer_version key from pantheon.yml\n\nPantheon does not support this key — it caused a validation error and\nblocked the git push entirely.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"236cd0eeb2e7b715bd7d0d2a9c54993317faea79","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sweimer/sandbox-glazed/git/trees/236cd0eeb2e7b715bd7d0d2a9c54993317faea79"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sweimer/sandbox-glazed/git/commits/521d077cd337ecbf22ff6939752b1a74b6d16e47","verification":{"payload":"tree 236cd0eeb2e7b715bd7d0d2a9c54993317faea79\nparent 4e973265eeb03bc4e4baa72882053760523bcd53\nauthor Scott Weimer <sweimer65@hotmail.com> 1774714798 -0400\ncommitter Scott Weimer <sweimer65@hotmail.com> 1774714798 -0400\n\nRemove invalid composer_version key from pantheon.yml\n\nPantheon does not support this key — it caused a validation error and\nblocked the git push entirely.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg/ovTxW8D+tSKYPFFbOIrxyscoA\n3PLPYOO3sKmqX4lh0AAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQIHKuEOG2z8RKVltB4neHOIqkc0sqLwpdRqb+9iveQYXc0McZ2k04OIgd5r79aTNv/\nBkDk8zuuE+ySj5XwTIMQk=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-28T16:20:01Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1145769?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sweimer","id":1145769,"login":"sweimer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNDU3Njk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sweimer/sandbox-glazed/commit/521d077cd337ecbf22ff6939752b1a74b6d16e47","node_id":"C_kwDORxmfqNoAKDUyMWQwNzdjZDMzN2VjYmYyMmZmNjkzOTc1MmIxYTc0YjZkMTZlNDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sweimer/sandbox-glazed/commit/4e973265eeb03bc4e4baa72882053760523bcd53","sha":"4e973265eeb03bc4e4baa72882053760523bcd53","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sweimer/sandbox-glazed/commits/4e973265eeb03bc4e4baa72882053760523bcd53"}],"sha":"521d077cd337ecbf22ff6939752b1a74b6d16e47","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sweimer/sandbox-glazed/commits/521d077cd337ecbf22ff6939752b1a74b6d16e47"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1145769?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sweimer","id":1145769,"login":"sweimer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNDU3Njk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sweimer/sandbox-glazed/commits/4e973265eeb03bc4e4baa72882053760523bcd53/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-28T16:16:58Z","email":"sweimer65@hotmail.com","name":"Scott Weimer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-28T16:16:58Z","email":"sweimer65@hotmail.com","name":"Scott Weimer"},"message":"Clean up repo and fix Pantheon build\n\n- Remove pantheon.upstream.yml (had trailing space in filename, was confusing\n  Pantheon build pipeline and should not exist in a non-upstream repo)\n- Remove drupal/ directory from git (stray module copy, not the real location)\n- Add composer_version: ^2 to pantheon.yml to ensure stable composer 2 build\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"15d874eed1dfdeed40483e3e193156fa77f6b870","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sweimer/sandbox-glazed/git/trees/15d874eed1dfdeed40483e3e193156fa77f6b870"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sweimer/sandbox-glazed/git/commits/4e973265eeb03bc4e4baa72882053760523bcd53","verification":{"payload":"tree 15d874eed1dfdeed40483e3e193156fa77f6b870\nparent df81794c99b4ebaf19ec66794809a15010de6667\nauthor Scott Weimer <sweimer65@hotmail.com> 1774714618 -0400\ncommitter Scott Weimer <sweimer65@hotmail.com> 1774714618 -0400\n\nClean up repo and fix Pantheon build\n\n- Remove pantheon.upstream.yml (had trailing space in filename, was confusing\n  Pantheon build pipeline and should not exist in a non-upstream repo)\n- Remove drupal/ directory from git (stray module copy, not the real location)\n- Add composer_version: ^2 to pantheon.yml to ensure stable composer 2 build\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg/ovTxW8D+tSKYPFFbOIrxyscoA\n3PLPYOO3sKmqX4lh0AAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQCGkrglaETBDyEFAJyRSbB+dSUcNYCMKXXsvVXr8Y2FnI9AXchIRPRK5A9VX5GUHTj\nQOajlMIk8gOiDwxajdHQk=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-28T16:17:05Z"}},"committe