Q6VXNlcjExNDU3Njk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sweimer/sandbox-glazed/commits/df81794c99b4ebaf19ec66794809a15010de6667/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-28T16:03:49Z","email":"sweimer65@hotmail.com","name":"Scott Weimer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-28T16:03:49Z","email":"sweimer65@hotmail.com","name":"Scott Weimer"},"message":"Fix SSL mismatch between appserver MariaDB client 11.8.3 and database MariaDB 10.6\n\nNewer MariaDB Connector/C requires SSL by default but the 10.6 server has no\nSSL configured. Added build_as_root step to drop a my.cnf that disables SSL\nfor all mysql clients in the appserver container (covers both CLI and PHP PDO).\nAlso added --skip-ssl explicitly to the crx mysql command as a backstop.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"48ad652653a49b39b46194e5c4b0b438729b9268","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sweimer/sandbox-glazed/git/trees/48ad652653a49b39b46194e5c4b0b438729b9268"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sweimer/sandbox-glazed/git/commits/df81794c99b4ebaf19ec66794809a15010de6667","verification":{"payload":"tree 48ad652653a49b39b46194e5c4b0b438729b9268\nparent dd1960eb6f6ec6cc81ba085ae44df1facc774663\nauthor Scott Weimer <sweimer65@hotmail.com> 1774713829 -0400\ncommitter Scott Weimer <sweimer65@hotmail.com> 1774713829 -0400\n\nFix SSL mismatch between appserver MariaDB client 11.8.3 and database MariaDB 10.6\n\nNewer MariaDB Connector/C requires SSL by default but the 10.6 server has no\nSSL configured. Added build_as_root step to drop a my.cnf that disables SSL\nfor all mysql clients in the appserver container (covers both CLI and PHP PDO).\nAlso added --skip-ssl explicitly to the crx mysql command as a backstop.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg/ovTxW8D+tSKYPFFbOIrxyscoA\n3PLPYOO3sKmqX4lh0AAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQAVToAcW/cscjdX9NsuLnXPt6J3QawFLwyyDtMs53Jh7xa9HVhXy240pZTkUO4Uagh\nN1iXTEFK3eLxsA4WWWsAY=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-28T16:17:05Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1145769?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sweimer","id":1145769,"login":"sweimer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNDU3Njk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sweimer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sweimer/sandbox-glazed/commit/df81794c99b4ebaf19ec66794809a15010de6667","node_id":"C_kwDORxmfqNoAKGRmODE3OTRjOTliNGViYWYxOWVjNjY3OTQ4MDlhMTUwMTBkZTY2Njc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sweimer/sandbox-glazed/commit/dd1960eb6f6ec6cc81ba085ae44df1facc774663","sha":"dd1960eb6f6ec6cc81ba085ae44df1facc774663","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sweimer/sandbox-g