/github.com/bogarrenato","id":55398708,"login":"bogarrenato","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1Mzk4NzA4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bogarrenato/frameworkindependetlib/commits/29caceb9b88c7bd29bedb5cb1fff9f09a1c849a4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-16T06:37:58Z","email":"bogarrenato@gmail.com","name":"Bogár Renátó"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-16T06:37:58Z","email":"bogarrenato@gmail.com","name":"Bogár Renátó"},"message":"feat(ff-button): sync icon-start/icon-end slots from polyrepo\n\nSyncs the icon slot feature from fuggetlenfe-components@8e723e7:\n  - icon-start and icon-end named slots in render()\n  - gap: var(--ff-button-gap, 0.5em) in CSS\n  - ::slotted() sizing for icon elements\n  - 3 new spec tests (17 total)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c75ed871fbd41b45545cbc5b0b3fc3e228949444","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bogarrenato/frameworkindependetlib/git/trees/c75ed871fbd41b45545cbc5b0b3fc3e228949444"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bogarrenato/frameworkindependetlib/git/commits/29caceb9b88c7bd29bedb5cb1fff9f09a1c849a4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55398708?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bogarrenato","id":55398708,"login":"bogarrenato","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1Mzk4NzA4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bogarrenato/frameworkindependetlib/commit/29caceb9b88c7bd29bedb5cb1fff9f09a1c849a4","node_id":"C_kwDORxu6Y9oAKDI5Y2FjZWI5Yjg4YzdiZDI5YmVkYjVjYjFmZmY5ZjA5YTFjODQ5YTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bogarrenato/frameworkindependetlib/commit/67c91f2a57df0f4755511cc65225373ed126a0c0","sha":"67c91f2a57df0f4755511cc65225373ed126a0c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bogarrenato/frameworkindependetlib/commits/67c91f2a57df0f4755511cc65225373ed126a0c0"}],"sha":"29caceb9b88c7bd29bedb5cb1fff9f09a1c849a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bogarrenato/frameworkindependetlib/commits/29caceb9b88c7bd29bedb5cb1fff9f09a1c849a4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55398708?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bogarrenato","id":55398708,"login":"bogarrenato","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1Mzk4NzA4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bogarrenato/frameworkindependetlib/commits/67c91f2a57df0f4755511cc65225373ed126a0c0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-15T19:37:56Z","email":"bogarrenato@gmail.com","name":"Bogár Renátó"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-15T19:37:56Z","email":"bogarrenato@gmail.com","name":"Bogár Renátó"},"message":"docs+governance: Source Alignment Gate, README truth, manifest cross-refs\n\n- Add `docs/governance.md` codifying the Source Alignment Gate: a primitive\n  ships only if it has a Figma source registered in the manifest at\n  `fuggetlenfe-tokens/src/figma-source-manifest.json`. Documents the\n  primitive lifecycle (add / roadmap / deprecate / remove), the status model\n  (stable / roadmap / docs-only / non-shipped), and the out-of-scope list.\n- Align the main README and the three package READMEs with the actual\n  shipped surface (just `ff-button`; `ff-input` listed as roadmap with the\n  two open design decisions) and add an explicit non-shipped audit trail\n  for the `ff-dropdown` / `ff-modal` / `ff-data-table` removals.\n- Rewrite the public-contract clause to reference manifest status rather\n  than a fixed four-wrapper list, so the doc does not re-drift as the\n  primitive set grows.\n- Fix landing page marketing copy in `scripts/build-pages.mjs` that still\n  claimed four primitives.\n- Update `ff-button.tsx` delegatesFocus comment to reference a generic\n  consumer-owned focus trap instead of the removed ff-modal.\n\nNo behavioral code changes — all edits are documentation and copy.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"20a02bf0f9f99c53e34bf05cd2ece6de61777417","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bogarrenato/frameworkindependetlib/git/trees/20a02bf0f9f99c53e34bf05cd2ece6de61777417"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bogarrenato/frameworkindependetlib/git/commits/67c91f2a57df0f4755511cc65225373ed126a0c0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55398708?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bogarrenato","id":55398708,"login":"bogarrenato","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1Mzk4NzA4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bogarrenato/frameworkindependetlib/commit/67c91f2a57df0f4755511cc65225373ed126a0c0","node_id":"C_kwDORxu6Y9oAKDY3YzkxZjJhNTdkZjBmNDc1NTUxMWNjNjUyMjUzNzNlZDEyNmEwYzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bogarrenato/frameworkindependetlib/commit/9728d01cb7747b6b643a3eb77054d9b00a096919","sha":"9728d01cb7747b6b643a3eb77054d9b00a096919","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bogarrenato/frameworkindependetlib/commits/9728d01cb7747b6b643a3eb77054d9b00a096919"}],"sha":"67c91f2a57df0f4755511cc65225373ed126a0c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bogarrenato/frameworkindependetlib/commits/67c91f2a57df0f4755511cc65225373ed126a0c0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55398708?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bogarrenato","id":55398708,"login":"bogarrenato","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1Mzk4NzA4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bogarrenato/frameworkindependetlib/commits/9728d01cb7747b6b643a3eb77054d9b00a096919/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-06T07:38:50Z","email":"bogarrenato@gmail.com","name":"Bogár Renátó"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-06T07:38:50Z","email":"bogarrenato@gmail.com","name":"Bogár Renátó"},"message":"refactor: remove non-Figma components, keep only ff-button\n\nThe component library must contain only primitives that exist in the Figma\nVariables API. The ff-dropdown, ff-modal, and ff-data-table were manually\nadded and have no Figma Variables backing — removed.\n\nWhat stays:\n- ff-button (Figma-backed: 3 brands × 2 themes × 4 states = 24 token sets)\n- Token contract CSS (generated from Figma Variables)\n- Brand pack CSS files (generated per brand × theme)\n- React and Angular wrappers (auto-generated, now only export FfButton)\n- SSR hydrate module (DSD pre-render for ff-button)\n- Storybook stories (ff-button only)\n\nWhat was removed:\n- ff-dropdown component (src + CSS + types + custom elements bundle)\n- ff-data-table component (same)\n- ff-modal component (same, including focus trap implementation)\n- Storybook registration for the three removed components\n- React showcase section ''SSR-safe primitives'' with dropdown/table/modal demos\n- Related state, constants, and imports in showcase apps\n\nThe four SSR demo pages now render only ff-button variants with DSD markup,\ncorrectly reflecting the Figma-sourced component surface. The assertion in\nprerender scripts was relaxed to check for shadowrootmode=\"open\" substring\nrather than the exact opening tag, since delegatesFocus adds an additional\nattribute to the DSD template element.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e6b7c0af862e36a387321c8deae89563e4343fc0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bogarrenato/frameworkindependetlib/git/trees/e6b7c0af862e36a387321c8deae89563e4343fc0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bogarrenato/frameworkindependetlib/git/commits/9728d01cb7747b6b643a3eb77054d9b00a096919","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55398708?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bogarrenato","id":55398708,"login":"bogarrenato","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1Mzk4NzA4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bogarrenato/frameworkindependetlib/commit/9728d01cb7747b6b643a3eb77054d9b00a096919","node_id":"C_kwDORxu6Y9oAKDk3MjhkMDFjYjc3NDdiNmI2NDNhM2ViNzcwNTRkOWIwMGEwOTY5MTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bogarrenato/frameworkindependetlib/commit/a56ba7f6f4babb1504bafadefcd3fb2478f3d66b","sha":"a56ba7f6f4babb1504bafadefcd3fb2478f3d66b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bogarrenato/frameworkindependetlib/commits/a56ba7f6f4babb1504bafadefcd3fb2478f3d66b"}],"sha":"9728d01cb7747b6b643a3eb77054d9b00a096919","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bogarrenato/frameworkindependetlib/commits/9728d01cb7747b6b643a3eb77054d9b00a096919"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55398708?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bogarrenato","id":55398708,"login":"bogarrenato","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1Mzk4NzA4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bogarrenato/frameworkindependetlib/commits/a56ba7f6f4babb1504bafadefcd3fb2478f3d66b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-05T17:45:32Z","email":"bogarrenato@gmail.com","name":"Bogár Renátó"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-05T17:45:32Z","email":"bogarrenato@gmail.com","name":"Bogár Renátó"},"message":"fix(ff-modal): focus trap shadow DOM + slotted light DOM aware\n\nThree bugs fixed in the modal focus trap:\n\n1. getFocusables() only queried the modal''s own shadow root, missing\n   slotted action buttons in the footer. Now collects focusables from\n   both shadowRoot (close X) and host light DOM (Cancel, Export and\n   any ff-button/ff-dropdown/native tabbable).\n\n2. offsetParent visibility check returned null for slotted elements\n   projected into a shadow DOM, so Cancel and Export were filtered out.\n   Replaced with Element.checkVisibility() and a bounding-rect fallback.\n\n3. isInsideModal() and hostHoldsActive() used Node.contains(), which\n   does not cross shadow DOM boundaries. Focus inside a slotted\n   ff-button''s own shadow DOM looked like escaped focus and the safety\n   net bounced it back to the close button. Replaced with a new\n   isDescendantOfAny() helper that walks parentNode and steps from a\n   ShadowRoot up to its host.\n\nAlso enables shadow: { delegatesFocus: true } on ff-button so that\n.focus() on a host element forwards to the inner native button. Without\nthis the trap could not focus a slotted ff-button.\n\nVerified locally with a four-scenario cycle test on the React showcase:\n- middle (Cancel / Export) + Tab: trap does NOT preventDefault\n- first (closeX) + Shift+Tab: wraps to Export\n- last (Export) + Tab: wraps to closeX\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"71e45a7e51bf96d485974df8a686d5a8838d8de7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bogarrenato/frameworkindependetlib/git/trees/71e45a7e51bf96d485974df8a686d5a8838d8de7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bogarrenato/frameworkindependetlib/git/commits/a56ba7f6f4babb1504bafadefcd3fb2478f3d66b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55398708?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bogarrenato","id":55398708,"login":"bogarrenato","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1Mzk4NzA4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bogarrenato/frameworkindependetlib/commit/a56ba7f6f4babb1504bafadefcd3fb2478f3d66b","node_id":"C_kwDORxu6Y9oAKGE1NmJhN2Y2ZjRiYWJiMTUwNGJhZmFkZWZjZDNmYjI0NzhmM2Q2NmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bogarrenato/frameworkindependetlib/commit/cc2c5e8ef12c40103382846b30f277f555d8fec9","sha":"cc2c5e8ef12c40103382846b30f277f555d8fec9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bogarrenato/frameworkindependetlib/commits/cc2c5e8ef12c40103382846b30f277f555d8fec9"}],"sha":"a56ba7f6f4babb1504bafadefcd3fb2478f3d66b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bogarrenato/frameworkindependetlib/commits/a56ba7f6f4babb1504bafadefcd3fb2478f3d66b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55398708?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bogarrenato","id":55398708,"login":"bogarrenato","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1Mzk4NzA4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bogarrenato/frameworkindependetlib/commits/cc2c5e8ef12c40103382846b30f277f555d8fec9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-05T17:25:33Z","email":"bogarrenato@gmail.com","name":"Bogár Renátó"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-05T17:25:33Z","email":"bogarrenato@gmail.com","name":"Bogár Renátó"},"message":"fix(ssr): inline token contract + brand pack CSS into ssr-demo first paint\n\nThe previous prerender script kept the <head> lean and noted that the \"real\ntoken contract + brand pack CSS is wired up by the main SPA''s bundler\". That\nassumption was wrong for the static ssr-demo.html pages: those pages have no\nVite entry point and no runtime CSS injection, so the shadow DOM rules were\nresolving every --ff-* custom property to its transparent/inherit fallback.\nFirst paint showed unstyled native buttons even though the DSD serialization\nitself was 100% correct.\n\nFix: the prerender script now reads contract.css and the active brand pack CSS\ndirectly from packages/tokens/src/ and packages/brand-styles/src/, and inlines\nthem as <style data-ff-critical=\"...\"> blocks in the <head>. Brand identity is\nparameterized via SSR_BRAND / SSR_THEME env vars so the same script produces\nfour differently-skinned outputs (brand-1, brand-2, custom-brand) for the four\nshowcase apps without duplication.\n\nThis is the \"critical CSS\" pattern for SSR of tokenized web components: the\n--ff-* variables must ship in the same byte stream as the DSD markup, because\nthe shadow DOM CSS resolves var(...) references at parse time. Locally verified\nby inspecting each of the four deployed pages — buttons, dropdown, table, and\nmodal now arrive fully brand-themed on first paint, with brand separation\nvisible between brand-1 (purple), brand-2 (green), and custom (orange pill).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"62a02ebf29dc4f90fcfd152d709de2d212800de0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bogarrenato/frameworkindependetlib/git/trees/62a02ebf29dc4f90fcfd152d709de2d212800de0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bogarrenato/frameworkindependetlib/git/commits/cc2c5e8ef12c40103382846b30f277f555d8fec9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55398708?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bogarrenato","id":55398708,"login":"bogarrenato","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1Mzk4NzA4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bogarrenato/frameworkindependetlib/commit/cc2c5e8ef12c40103382846b30f277f555d8fec9","node_id":"C_kwDORxu6Y9oAKGNjMmM1ZThlZjEyYzQwMTAzMzgyODQ2YjMwZjI3N2Y1NTVkOGZlYzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bogarrenato/frameworkindependetlib/commit/59a3d78040c28408a8a5babe10b208a8d693046a","sha":"59a3d78040c28408a8a5babe10b208a8d693046a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bogarrenato/frameworkindependetlib/commits/59a3d78040c28408a8a5babe10b208a8d693046a"}],"sha":"cc2c5e8ef12c40103382846b30f277f555d8fec9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bogarrenato/frameworkindependetlib/commits/cc2c5e8ef12c40103382846b30f277f555d8fec9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55398708?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bogarrenato","id":55398708,"login":"bogarrenato","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1Mzk4NzA4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bogarrenato/frameworkindependetlib/commits/59a3d78040c28408a8a5babe10b208a8d693046a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-05T16:56:22Z","email":"bogarrenato@gmail.com","name":"Bogár Renátó"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-05T16:56:22Z","email":"bogarrenato@gmail.com","name":"Bogár Renátó"},"message":"feat(ssr): SSR/SSG-safe polyrepo contract with 4 primitives + hydrate pipeline\n\nAdds the Stencil dist-hydrate-script output target, three new SSR-safe primitives\n(ff-dropdown, ff-modal, ff-data-table), server entry points for both wrapper\npackages, and a per-app prerender step that emits Declarative Shadow DOM demo\npages into every showcase build. Updates READMEs for the SSR contract, the new\ncomponents, the polyrepo intent, and the Figma Variables fallback plan.\n\n- packages/components: dist-hydrate-script target, dist-custom-elements relocated\n  to ./components/ for wrapper import alignment, ff-button refactored to document\n  the SSR author-time rules, post-build patch script re-exports the Components\n  type namespace into components/index.d.ts so the Angular proxy directives can\n  resolve it from the custom-elements path.\n- ff-dropdown, ff-modal, ff-data-table: SSR-safe by construction — pure renders,\n  no DOM globals in connectedCallback or componentWillLoad, controlled open/close\n  state via props, all visual values resolved through the token contract.\n- packages/react-wrapper: adds /server subpath export that re-exports renderToString\n  and hydrateDocument from @fuggetlenfe/components/hydrate.\n- packages/angular-wrapper: same /server subpath export for Angular Universal\n  pipelines; tsconfig.lib.json now compiles both entries.\n- apps/*/scripts/prerender.mjs: feeds a hand-authored HTML template through the\n  hydrate module and writes dist/ssr-demo.html with fully inlined DSD markup.\n  Exits non-zero if the hydrate module reports errors or the output lacks\n  <template shadowrootmode=\"open\">.\n- scripts/build-pages.mjs: runs the Angular prerender explicitly after ng build\n  and copies each dist/ssr-demo.html into the corresponding GitHub Pages slot.\n  Landing page gains an \"SSR / SSG demos\" section linking to all four demos and\n  a new \"SSR / SSG safe\" design principle card.\n- apps/react-showcase/src/App.tsx, apps/react-custom-demo/src/App.tsx: fixed a\n  pre-existing JSX comment syntax error at the top-level return; added a new\n  section showcasing the dropdown, data table, and modal primitives driven by\n  controlled props (useState + memoized data) so the tree is hydration-stable.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a02a2ec0e26ec50788db571fa90ec915ea5fd978","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bogarrenato/frameworkindependetlib/git/trees/a02a2ec0e26ec50788db571fa90ec915ea5fd978"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bogarrenato/frameworkindependetlib/git/commits/59a3d78040c28408a8a5babe10b208a8d693046a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55398708?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bogarrenato","id":55398708,"login":"bogarrenato","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1Mzk4NzA4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bogarrenato/frameworkindependetlib/commit/59a3d78040c28408a8a5babe10b208a8d693046a","node_id":"C_kwDORxu6Y9oAKDU5YTNkNzg