tes, parts, and combined scenarios\n- Add Variants story to all 3 Storybooks (Stencil, React, Angular) showing\n  8 API variations: default, disabled, fullWidth, submit, reset, pill, custom\n  token override, and label-only\n- Upgrade Angular and React wrapper docs with CSS custom properties table,\n  shadow parts, slots, keyboard navigation, ARIA reference, token architecture,\n  and additional code examples\n- Enhance all 4 showcase apps with a Component API section demonstrating every\n  button variant\n- Replace basic landing page with architecture diagram, design principles,\n  token contract summary, and quick start guide\n- Remove `as CSSProperties` type assertions in React apps, replace with\n  truthful CssTokenOverrides intersection type\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"909e512b891b9dc6b78812ddf0ed1cd958d9be92","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bogarrenato/frameworkindependetlib/git/trees/909e512b891b9dc6b78812ddf0ed1cd958d9be92"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bogarrenato/frameworkindependetlib/git/commits/56c6bacf1933945c7ac5492dbd05bfb0bbe83bdd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55398708?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bogarrenato","id":55398708,"login":"bogarrenato","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1Mzk4NzA4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bogarrenato/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.co