ession_012eBRTpWXTkLmcwBVzmHEcE\n\n* docs(decision): AI-DLC は今回採用を見送る、に決定を更新 (refs #526)\n\n調査結果は変えず、決定だけを実際の判断に合わせた。\n\n- 決定を「別コピーで運用する」から「今回は採用しない（見送り）」へ\n- 却下案の表に「メインの作業フォルダに置き git に見せない」を追加。\n  却下理由は費用ではなく必要が立っていないこと、と明記\n- 「後で採用する場合の手順」を新設（.git/info/exclude と\n  settings.local.json を使えばリポジトリは汚れず、15分で始められる）\n- 見直す条件を3つ明記\n- 持ち込む2規律は AI-DLC と独立に実施できる follow-up として整理\n\n見送りが「その弱点を承知で先送りする判断」であることを Consequences に明記した。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012eBRTpWXTkLmcwBVzmHEcE\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqmXnoCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA1ikQAAGZKyWDlAH2soRXuJDjzb1m\nFys4fSB3rKUEY2kcv4ydpTWq63N2h4oB2y5dqMkMmg+uVSfovwLoLaqholzV/VX5\nC66DwKl3Pv+IMrz+DH7tYAdbD8v+YcxxOO7SG1mc58QdtzZD3FP1Do4dJbB+afzP\nCBaT0cPSrE7RfiBSiUfZ2YIB5fe7VHAW3ITHrh/dVXRqGz0d57/YcPBj6ps0xt6V\nC+3Nq+CxQAbiwMYarVJpqjkBdne0THvADGwT+e+OIJ3AYzc3jQsTD5tmc3aCh3CF\nqw/PsMHEfJtPPKz1E84UmQVfdI+FFRQf39T6XwfZPk8Zpf3lxx6VLIaNqn93/87K\neQ/DT9ybUcn6eM0fCQpqrZYg8fY0As4FaD/pB+Uh7x9arNDoa26oG9mkQ6Pea8IJ\nq2Pfcxc96JrwNxiKnW2VT/f3QmLkTmWuZurxrnn/IJW2O4xdkSZExLKKvhrlsLqB\n2UAfxskJ175iJqO6jXOJlJCPFf+v1nQnDng5dzClm8oAGxPwNLfFAgQozVvhRkFM\nqeSIagK/Sc9KdKGCGwp5tKHSvBQriILzcGixIyvRYj3mOFndC8Vc7XeZgMzxs14X\nfNFmDwcImAyJgFxRytEI+du3FnVLdpJZ71ksZ3XzU8t0Y843X0nV3TwoZRa4Ro/b\nOiZgJZVWtOBMhMEeA7mo\n=cs8Y\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-03T13:45:13Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"w