VA pin 未実施 (^0.7.1 → 0.7.1 exact、\n  vite / lightningcss / biome と同じ exact-pin 規律。0.7.x は 0.7.1 が唯一の\n  解決版のため挙動変化なし)\n- 未来形記述を確定形に更新 (Pre-1.0 (current) → (historical) / \"Once #154\n  ships\" / \"CONTRIBUTING.md (planned for v0.15.0)\")\n- README: Installation 配下に \"API stability commitment\" 節を新設\n- CONTRIBUTING: §Changesets & release に breaking-change checklist を追記\n\ncloses #170\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs(api-stability): Deprecation 期間の文言一本化 + CVA exact-pin decision log (review-pr P0/P2)\n\n- policy 表の Deprecation 行を「one full major cycle」から「at least one minor\n  release before the next major」に修正 — §When you''re about to ship a change\n  step 3 および README / CONTRIBUTING の記述と一本化 (doc 内矛盾の解消)\n- docs/decisions/2026-07-cva-exact-pin.md を追加 — pin の根拠と、将来の\n  dependabot cva バンプ時のレビュー観点 (出力チェーンが変わるなら major) を記録。\n  api-stability §CVA output stability から相互リンク\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7de6480304185c88a7bd21dc80ae7fc48ae0c01b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/git/trees/7de6480304185c88a7bd21dc80ae7fc48ae0c01b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/git/commits/5a33f982ae243955f918d8266a879a96d9b85436","verification":{"payload":"tree 7de6480304185c88a7bd21dc80ae7fc48ae0c01b\nparent cfd922fd46a5f55d1accfab77ade280b7a4848f3\nauthor y-ohno <30785878+yasmro@users.noreply.github.com> 1784382958 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784382958 +0900\n\nrelease(1.0): API stability commitment 発効 — reconcile pass + CVA exact pin (closes #170) (#489)\n\n* release(1.0): API stability commitment 発効 — reconcile pass + CVA exact pin (closes #170)\n\napi-stability.md の RC blocker (冒頭 blockquote) を実施記録に置換し、doc を\nv1.0.0 の実 surface と一致させた:\n\n- 実査で発見した言行不一致 2 件を解消 — peer 列挙漏れ (lucide-react ^1.0.0\n  + 全 peer optional の明文化) / CVA pin 未実施 (^0.7.1 → 0.7.1 exact、\n  vite / lightningcss / biome と同じ exact-pin 規律。0.7.x は 0.7.1 が唯一の\n  解決版のため挙動変化なし)\n- 未来形記述を確定形に更新 (Pre-1.0 (current) → (historical) / \"Once #154\n  ships\" / \"CONTRIBUTING.md (planned for v0.15.0)\")\n- README: Installation 配下に \"API stability commitment\" 節を新設\n- CONTRIBUTING: §Changesets & release に breaking-change checklist を追記\n\ncloses #170\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs(api-stability): Deprecation 期間の文言一本化 + CVA exact-pin decision log (review-pr P0/P2)\n\n- policy 表の Deprecation 行を「one full major cycle」から「at least one minor\n  release before the next major」に修正 — §When you''re about to ship a change\n  step 3 および README / CONTRIBUTING の記述と一本化 (doc 内矛盾の解消)\n- docs/decisions/2026-07-cva-exact-pin.md を追加 — pin の根拠と、将来の\n  dependabot cva バンプ時のレビュー観点 (出力チェーンが変わるなら major) を記録。\n  api-stability §CVA output stability から相互リンク\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqW4XuCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAsogQAHenrMfvSo17jpKmaWL7sfBs\nA1ppIyuYv8uBOFnytBwLPbvlBjo+/6teeXfsIJpWUJli6vlUs1sNu4Dvm3T6VYnx\niUWArAn9RqRFdUafjJ0kirqxUTaV9VeUqqYckVwCNDyxj/kfo9+H+RUvl/0YewYV\nXGQpQ5DZsbr4BcPH9oTU+vfyg3JoKTRjbEDPpBOE56CJcV6m/QiP2PLxBd3rl0wn\nqu8CNbwEi/LK9pwnMkpoFvU8Ux7XeoobtSPerbUO0ZjclusymRdsk1M38dzq0zDT\nmZi/CpjWUUpPEIPyd2bNAtlXHp60Sk8prky08tAzkt0Ti1RwKfmnQihFoTeu0Kwc\nctIBgzgtq9jBlvqLOvigdTSuG1vOV/NWq/6BjwEgPpQuYJRVGZE1GZ7ky4c6zo4J\nxRJeqcWoVNZaLcYRg7+woqIyLUzCa6LDCvXB2ePD39sxpcgnzSgBKT5NUPr5vnV9\nKjDQCNIEsaATqNwROp7nHUiMqdyxYzk8nNDPqVOkCZEDAgq0xQAjelQ7hVq7K+1R\nMB3veSOgztrQOoaS+fYS2jwa/F8OB7Ku1Cg7TjTz9n3TS5X4dKGU49lj6CKgXxQ+\n4wziuNFXcUnN0nwk4rQ4HvCB77UYluNPG0XDk48Qtqb/mcFFqWaLmYj26RiZ3YMm\nrJnRy7iIKUi0N/5MCj50\n=q4Sz\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-18T13:55:59Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/