41bf54578d5f75d639f7"}],"sha":"c695e52cc5facad1a90dd7ba9d144a1465178ec7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/commits/c695e52cc5facad1a90dd7ba9d144a1465178ec7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30785878?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yasmro","id":30785878,"login":"yasmro","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzg1ODc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/commits/f7cf99b6c937476f010341bf54578d5f75d639f7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T00:20:27Z","email":"30785878+yasmro@users.noreply.github.com","name":"y-ohno"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T00:20:27Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor(build): ESM-only 化 — CJS export (exports.require / main) を削除 (closes #479) (#484)\n\n* refactor(build): ESM-only 化 — CJS export (exports.require / main) を削除 (closes #479)\n\n#208 の採択 (ESM-only) の実装。exports の全 8 entry から require 条件を削除し、\ntop-level main と tsup の CJS ビルドグループを撤去。dual-package hazard\n(Toast store / Field・FieldSet・Tooltip Context の module-instance 二重化に\nよる無音故障) を構造的に解消する。\n\n- import 条件のみを維持し default 条件は使わない: Node >= 22.12 の\n  require(esm) が default を解決してしまい、hazard が Node バージョン依存で\n  再発するため。require() は全 Node で ERR_PACKAGE_PATH_NOT_EXPORTED で\n  fail-fast (tarball install で実証済み)\n- 恒久 gate scripts/check-esm-only.mjs を新設し、CI の lint job (exports map)\n  と manifest job (build 後の dist) に組み込み\n- api-stability.md に「Module format — ESM-only」節、migration guide に\n  item 12、README に ESM-only 要件を追記\n- tarball unpacked size: 1,296.6 kB → 792.8 kB (-38.9%)\n\ncloses #479\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* refactor(build): レビューフォローアップ — 文字列 JS target 検出 + engines.node 宣言\n\n/review-pr の P0 / P2 対応:\n\n- check-esm-only: プレーン文字列の JS target を検出対象に追加。Node の\n  解決規則では文字列 target は default 条件と等価で require() でも\n  解決されるため、gate の default 禁止をすり抜ける穴だった。negative\n  fixture で 4 検出 (main / require / default / 文字列 JS) の発火と\n  CSS/JSON 文字列 entry の非検出を確認済み\n- package.json に engines.node \">=18\" を宣言し、api-stability.md\n  (サポート対象 consumer + 範囲を狭めるのは major) と changeset に反映\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fb37b1d9659f532f9b8ff475fa58026db03bf36f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/git/trees/fb37b1d9659f532f9b8ff475fa58026db03bf36f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/git/commits/f7cf99b6c937476f010341bf54578d5f75d639f7","verification":{"payload":"tree fb37b1d9659f532f9b8ff475fa58026db03bf36f\nparent 4861bdb108c05e6da72b8e7fe20d7c550976b414\nauthor y-ohno <30785878+yasmro@users.noreply.github.com> 1784161227 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784161227 +0900\n\nrefactor(build): ESM-only 化 — CJS export (exports.require / main) を削除 (closes #479) (#484)\n\n* refactor(build): ESM-only 化 — CJS export (exports.require / main) を削除 (closes #479)\n\n#208 の採択 (ESM-only) の実装。exports の全 8 entry から require 条件を削除し、\ntop-level main と tsup の CJS ビルドグループを撤去。dual-package hazard\n(Toast store / Field・FieldSet・Tooltip Context の module-instance 二重化に\nよる無音故障) を構造的に解消する。\n\n- import 条件のみを維持し default 条件は使わない: Node >= 22.12 の\n  require(esm) が default を解決してしまい、hazard が Node バージョン依存で\n  再発するため。require() は全 Node で ERR_PACKAGE_PATH_NOT_EXPORTED で\n  fail-fast (tarball install で実証済み)\n- 恒久 gate scripts/check-esm-only.mjs を新設し、CI の lint job (exports map)\n  と manifest job (build 後の dist) に組み込み\n- api-stability.md に「Module format — ESM-only」節、migration guide に\n  item 12、README に ESM-only 要件を追記\n- tarball unpacked size: 1,296.6 kB → 792.8 kB (-38.9%)\n\ncloses #479\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* refactor(build): レビューフォローアップ — 文字列 JS target 検出 + engines.node 宣言\n\n/review-pr の P0 / P2 対応:\n\n- check-esm-only: プレーン文字列の JS target を検出対象に追加。Node の\n  解決規則では文字列 target は default 条件と等価で require() でも\n  解決されるため、gate の default 禁止をすり抜ける穴だった。negative\n  fixture で 4 検出 (main / require / default / 文字列 JS) の発火と\n  CSS/JSON 文字列 entry の非検出を確認済み\n- package.json に engines.node \">=18\" を宣言し、api-stability.md\n  (サポート対象 consumer + 範囲を狭めるのは major) と changeset に反映\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqWCPLCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA89EQAAOsgYA0ySNA9UIkzYarLlTB\nirsmPMt4sTlYVxUnfaj6gNP++3B8UMvOZQgQSyrsPIlxIsTDT0BOssDtWhw3t0/M\nKivi3uUYfHgBbrxfiK9brryAxjy+FvnB9ZLFz0CmrVVLznNTRJm/Y2O0I9sCL//b\nksC/QRCWySWO5Vvp/JT2aEr9n1KwTq2UOSIRRV2o19WKiG0kqnfc8MjTkQHQui+/\no7V2gdP4afE6Hw8CJAMYp5w5I3ncVoszuna4a7rjGiby2kZuachU6YUEl1KfIlBg\nRK0Cl2gTDA7HZwLOLafC+zvlDVaDPhghZZpME/XMJPSV8555+zT5kM+Kfq6fxsPJ\nPAJO2rd3r4StcuP4T5hgeV/WqEDchOKREG+8NSJSMeRaWvqbQSD4okgYR7/oMzVe\nGjMH0kuwLnv2glkXeQ5gbzRDqP7Gu2mbi4k7fBiSYt3XRvjdgbE+YKx+KAxjizVO\nFvDXSkWPIBAPvbeG1mvY8W5kki/q9OklnhPK4YfzrtYaaT7P6cQdlH+Mp4CTfa3F\nDX9l5wjnR5Am+tWsSOd8nqmwta2Fmm8HyKOdJ9iX5H9skmod9DXwiJxVMAu1dng1\n92q0Vs0IW+OeFmsoFegtWvyJDRCoS+pMjhH61lIToizfjQnJlggB83gef+GPqfFA\nvA7EDWYgwxHBq2dHFaN8\n=RttG\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-16T00:20:27Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars