tps://api.github.com/users/yasmro/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yasmro","id":30785878,"login":"yasmro","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzg1ODc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/commits/8863eb908f9bdc01a3a4247a38bc7863afac80fd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T22:21:40Z","email":"30785878+yasmro@users.noreply.github.com","name":"y-ohno"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T22:21:40Z","email":"30785878+yasmro@users.noreply.github.com","name":"y-ohno"},"message":"chore(release): v0.15.0\n\npending changeset 8 件 (全 patch) を消費し、1.0 RC 準備の区切りとして\nminor で 0.15.0 を発番。公開 surface (.st-* 252 / state 属性 8 /\nCSS 変数 127) は完全不変 (脱 Tailwind #317 / CSS 変数 audit #231 は\nsurface 不変、他は docs/test)。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9b24e5dae29c8a9a9f4a3bf9891993185873573d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/git/trees/9b24e5dae29c8a9a9f4a3bf9891993185873573d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/git/commits/8863eb908f9bdc01a3a4247a38bc7863afac80fd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30785878?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yasmro","id":30785878,"login":"yasmro","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzg1ODc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/yasmro/schatten/commit/8863eb908f9bdc01a3a4247a38bc7863afac80fd","node_id":"C_kwDORxxzJtoAKDg4NjNlYjkwOGY5YmRjMDFhM2E0MjQ3YTM4YmM3ODYzYWZhYzgwZmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yasmro/schatten/commit/4c690325f89c6367bffb62a88716bbafa00bfd55","sha":"4c690325f89c6367bffb62a88716bbafa00bfd55","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/commits/4c690325f89c6367bffb62a88716bbafa00bfd55"}],"sha":"8863eb908f9bdc01a3a4247a38bc7863afac80fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/commits/8863eb908f9bdc01a3a4247a38bc7863afac80fd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30785878?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yasmro","id":30785878,"login":"yasmro","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzg1ODc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/commits/4c690325f89c6367bffb62a88716bbafa00bfd55/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T23:19:57Z","email":"30785878+yasmro@users.noreply.github.com","name":"y-ohno"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-12T23:19:57Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"test(audit): 必須 common-case テスト存在を機械検査する advisory 列を追加 (#472)\n\n* test(audit): 必須 common-case テスト存在を機械検査する advisory 列を追加\n\naudit-coverage.mjs に「テスト存在」の 3 列 (ref.test / testid.test /\nrole.test) を追加。testing-guideline / component-testid-guideline /\ncomponent-architecture §8 が要求するが、どの gate も見ていなかった\n「実装は健全なのに pin する必須テストが未実装」という系統的欠落を可視化する。\n\n- ref.test    : forwardRef 実装に ref-lands テストが無ければ ⚠ (grep)\n- testid.test : {...props} 透過に data-testid pass-through テストが無ければ ⚠\n- role.test   : ROLE_NAME_CONTRACT の component に getByRole(role,{name}) が無ければ ⚠\n\n3 列は advisory (非ブロッキング): row.missing ではなく row.advisories に入り、\nhasFailures / --check の exit code には影響しない (グリフも ✗ ではなく ⚠、\n専用の \"Test-existence gaps\" セクションに列挙)。既存の blocking audit CI job の\n出力に相乗りするだけで workflow 変更は不要。blocking 化は別 issue\n(#307 audit / #346 a11y の staged-gate 昇格パターンに倣う)。\n\n判明済みの系統的欠落をバックフィル (15 test files):\n- ref-lands  x10: Button/Checkbox/DropdownMenu/Popover/Radio/Select/\n               Separator/Switch/Text/Tooltip\n- testid     x8 : Button/Checkbox/Input/Radio/Select/Switch/Textarea/Tooltip\n- role+name  x4 : Dialog/FieldSet/Radio/Text\n\nSpinner role.test は対象外: role=\"status\" は content で名付けられる live\nregion で accessible name を持たない (getByRole(''status'',{name}) は不成立)。\n既に getByRole(''status'') + getByText(''Loading'') で担保済みなので誤検知。\n代わりに fan-out が見落としていた Radio-testid を検出・バックフィル。\n\n型付けは scripts/audit-coverage.d.mts を同時更新 (AuditFiles 3 列 /\nadvisories / ROLE_NAME_CONTRACT / predicate 5 export、JSON $schemaVersion 2)。\n公開 surface 非影響 (.claude/scripts/*.test.tsx のみ) → no-changeset。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* review(audit): role.test 網羅性ガード + doc 同期 + 昇格 issue 参照\n\n/review-pr #472 の P0/P1/P2 を反映。\n\nP1 — role.test の適用可否は手動 ROLE_NAME_CONTRACT 依存で「新規 role-bearing\nコンポーネントの登録漏れ」を CI が拾えない盲点があった。ROLE_NAME_EXEMPT を\n新設し、両者で lv1 tree を exhaustive partition。roleContractPartitionGaps()\n+ partition テストで「どちらの set にも無い（or 両方にある）」を赤テスト化。\nPARITY_EXEMPT と同型の forcing function。\n\nP2 — CLAUDE.md / AGENTS.md の /audit-coverage サマリに advisory 3 列を追記。\n併せて CLAUDE.md:82 の stale 記述を修正（audit job は既に Phase 2 blocking で\ncontinue-on-error は撤去済み。旧文は \"continue-on-error: true / Phase 1\" のまま\nだった）。\n\nP0 — blocking 昇格の follow-up を #474 として起票し、コード/doc の\n「別 issue」参照を #474 に置換。\n\n型は .d.mts 同時更新（ROLE_NAME_EXEMPT / roleContractPartitionGaps）。\n公開 surface 非影響 → no-changeset。test 1126 passed。\n\nRefs #474\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6f86b2826e20df3ef5fa33aaba7de763b9545edc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/git/trees/6f86b2826e20df3ef5fa33aaba7de763b9545edc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/git/commits/4c690325f89c6367bffb62a88716bbafa00bfd55","verification":{"payload":"tree 6f86b2826e20df3ef5fa33aaba7de763b9545edc\nparent 3cb2eddf3518a2cf4140f8b725d21460030d1423\nauthor y-ohno <30785878+yasmro@users.noreply.github.com> 1783898397 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783898397 +0900\n\ntest(audit): 必須 common-case テスト存在を機械検査する advisory 列を追加 (#472)\n\n* test(audit): 必須 common-case テスト存在を機械検査する advisory 列を追加\n\naudit-coverage.mjs に「テスト存在」の 3 列 (ref.test / testid.test /\nrole.test) を追加。testing-guideline / component-testid-guideline /\ncomponent-architecture §8 が要求するが、どの gate も見ていなかった\n「実装は健全なのに pin する必須テストが未実装」という系統的欠落を可視化する。\n\n- ref.test    : forwardRef 実装に ref-lands テストが無ければ ⚠ (grep)\n- testid.test : {...props} 透過に data-testid pass-through テストが無ければ ⚠\n- role.test   : ROLE_NAME_CONTRACT の component に getByRole(role,{name}) が無ければ ⚠\n\n3 列は advisory (非ブロッキング): row.missing ではなく row.advisories に入り、\nhasFailures / --check の exit code には影響しない (グリフも ✗ ではなく ⚠、\n専用の \"Test-existence gaps\" セクションに列挙)。既存の blocking audit CI job の\n出力に相乗りするだけで workflow 変更は不要。blocking 化は別 issue\n(#307 audit / #346 a11y の staged-gate 昇格パターンに倣う)。\n\n判明済みの系統的欠落をバックフィル (15 test files):\n- ref-lands  x10: Button/Checkbox/DropdownMenu/Popover/Radio/Select/\n               Separator/Switch/Text/Tooltip\n- testid     x8 : Button/Checkbox/Input/Radio/Select/Switch/Textarea/Tooltip\n- role+name  x4 : Dialog/FieldSet/Radio/Text\n\nSpinner role.test は対象外: role=\"status\" は content で名付けられる live\nregion で accessible name を持たない (getByRole(''status'',{name}) は不成立)。\n既に getByRole(''status'') + getByText(''Loading'') で担保済みなので誤検知。\n代わりに fan-out が見落としていた Radio-testid を検出・バックフィル。\n\n型付けは scripts/audit-coverage.d.mts を同時更新 (AuditFiles 3 列 /\nadvisories / ROLE_NAME_CONTRACT / predicate 5 export、JSON $schemaVersion 2)。\n公開 surface 非影響 (.claude/scripts/*.test.tsx のみ) → no-changeset。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* review(audit): role.test 網羅性ガード + doc 同期 + 昇格 issue 参照\n\n/review-pr #472 の P0/P1/P2 を反映。\n\nP1 — role.test の適用可否は手動 ROLE_NAME_CONTRACT 依存で「新規 role-bearing\nコンポーネントの登録漏れ」を CI が拾えない盲点があった。ROLE_NAME_EXEMPT を\n新設し、両者で lv1 tree を exhaustive partition。roleContractPartitionGaps()\n+ partition テストで「どちらの set にも無い（or 両方にある）」を赤テスト化。\nPARITY_EXEMPT と同型の forcing function。\n\nP2 — CLAUDE.md / AGENTS.md の /audit-coverage サマリに advisory 3 列を追記。\n併せて CLAUDE.md:82 の stale 記述を修正（audit job は既に Phase 2 blocking で\ncontinue-on-error は撤去済み。旧文は \"continue-on-error: true / Phase 1\" のまま\nだった）。\n\nP0 — blocking 昇格の follow-up を #474 として起票し、コード/doc の\n「別 issue」参照を #474 に置換。\n\n型は .d.mts 同時更新（ROLE_NAME_EXEMPT / roleContractPartitionGaps）。\n公開 surface 非影響 → no-changeset。test 1126 passed。\n\nRefs #474\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n-------