00bfd55","node_id":"C_kwDORxxzJtoAKDRjNjkwMzI1Zjg5YzYzNjdiZmZiNjJhODg3MTZiYmFmYTAwYmZkNTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yasmro/schatten/commit/3cb2eddf3518a2cf4140f8b725d21460030d1423","sha":"3cb2eddf3518a2cf4140f8b725d21460030d1423","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/commits/3cb2eddf3518a2cf4140f8b725d21460030d1423"}],"sha":"4c690325f89c6367bffb62a88716bbafa00bfd55","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/commits/4c690325f89c6367bffb62a88716bbafa00bfd55"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30785878?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yasmro","id":30785878,"login":"yasmro","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzg1ODc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/commits/3cb2eddf3518a2cf4140f8b725d21460030d1423/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T23:08:02Z","email":"30785878+yasmro@users.noreply.github.com","name":"y-ohno"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-12T23:08:02Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs: Storybook 全 docs ページの最終チェック — stale 記述修正 + docs a11y 掃引 (closes #160) (#473)\n\n* docs(storybook): Tokens ページの @theme/base.css stale 記述を registrar 参照に修正 (refs #160)\n\n#317 (脱 Tailwind) / #231 (CSS 変数監査) 後に stale 化した記述を現行の姿に更新:\n\n- Spacing / Radius / Motion / Elevation の 4 ページで、公開トークンの根拠を\n  「base.css の @theme ブロック登録」→「public-token registrar\n  (src/styles/public-tokens.css) 登録 + manifest 掲載」に書き換え (計 14 箇所)。\n  base.css の @theme は #317 以降 Storybook 専用のため、消費者向けの公開契約の\n  説明からは撤去。Tailwind への言及は消費者側 (Tailwind-using consumers) の\n  事実としてのみ温存。\n- CSS API Overview の Icon note の minifier 記述を修正\n  (Tailwind''s --minify → lightningcss)。\n\nVRT: prose 変更に伴い Spacing (spacing-scale / half-steps)・Radius\n(radius-scale)・Elevation (shadow-scale)・CSSApi (reference) の baseline を\ndiff 目視の上 re-baseline。half-steps-dark / reference-* は 1% 閾値未満で\ngreen だったため削除 → 再取得 (sub-threshold trap 対応)。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs(storybook): 全 docs ページ横断チェック — stale 記述修正 + docs a11y 掃引 (refs #160)\n\nv0.15.0 (1.0 RC) の docs 最終チェック本体。3 系統の修正:\n\n1. stale 記述 (前回 refinement 後に landed した #317/#231/#428/#318 由来):\n   - CSS API overview: minifier 記述 (Tailwind --minify → lightningcss)、\n     manifest/registrar の公開契約 1 段落を追加、\"all 18 lv1\" 等の件数を\n     現行 25 に更新 (件数は drift しない表現に変更)\n   - Testing: Toast の role=\"status\" 主張を撤去 (Sonner の live region が\n     announce、visible toast に role なし — text で query する)\n   - FormComposition / Accessibility: 「Field は aria-required を伝播しない」\n     旧記述を announce-only 伝播 (#428) に更新\n   - Color: 旧称 \"primary scale\" → \"theme scale\" ×2\n   - Welcome: hero の Tailwind 記述を consumer-side Tailwind-free に、\n     \"Four places\" → \"Five places\"\n   - CSSApiParity / fixture: 区 C/D 列挙に DropdownMenu / Popover を追加\n   - registrar 呼称を「public-token registrar」に統一\n\n2. docs ページの実 a11y violation 修正 (74 story × light/dark の axe 掃引):\n   - state chip (curated/raw/applied/defined-only/owner) を\n     text-{state} → text-{state}-emphasis に (#344 の emphasis 契約)\n   - 名前なし SelectTrigger demo に aria-label (Welcome / FormStates /\n     Accessibility / Testing — axe button-name critical)\n   - docs-ui CodeBlock に tabIndex={0} (scrollable-region-focusable)\n   - ZIndex stack tile のラベル色を ramp 固定に (Mode 不変で AA 確保)\n   - Welcome Toast mock を emphasis + opacity 撤去で AA に\n   - ThemeAudit の code chip に text-foreground (dark で AA 割れ)\n   - 意図的例外 (solid trilemma / subtle-tier demo) は story-scoped\n     parameters.a11y disable + 理由コメントで panel を green に\n     (Color / Accessibility Contrast / CSSApi Reference / Parity)\n\n3. VRT: prose/chip 変更に伴い 13 baseline を diff 目視の上 re-baseline。\n   sub-threshold trap (1% 閾値未満で green のまま stale 化) は該当 PNG を\n   削除して忠実に再取得。全 suite 411 件 zero-diff で pass。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs(storybook): Season toolbar の stale ラベル Default (Blue) を Default (Alabaster) に (refs #160)\n\n#150 以降 default theme ramp は neutral alabaster。PR preview 確認中に発見。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c56499183c2ddeb3925134e9d5ba1d39344ca7b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/git/trees/c56499183c2ddeb3925134e9d5ba1d39344ca7b0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/git/commits/3cb2eddf3518a2cf4140f8b725d21460030d1423","verification":{"payload":"tree c56499183c2ddeb3925134e9d5ba1d39344ca7b0\nparent 52805446c8e0209821c49828d984199af64a5e90\nauthor y-ohno <30785878+yasmro@users.noreply.github.com> 1783897682 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783897682 +0900\n\ndocs: Storybook 全 docs ページの最終チェック — stale 記述修正 + docs a11y 掃引 (closes #160) (#473)\n\n* docs(storybook): Tokens ページの @theme/base.css stale 記述を registrar 参照に修正 (refs #160)\n\n#317 (脱 Tailwind) / #231 (CSS 変数監査) 後に stale 化した記述を現行の姿に更新:\n\n- Spacing / Radius / Motion / Elevation の 4 ページで、公開トークンの根拠を\n  「base.css の @theme ブロック登録」→「public-token registrar\n  (src/styles/public-tokens.css) 登録 + manifest 掲載」に書き換え (計 14 箇所)。\n  base.css の @theme は #317 以降 Storybook 専用のため、消費者向けの公開契約の\n  説明からは撤去。Tailwind への言及は消費者側 (Tailwind-using consumers) の\n  事実としてのみ温存。\n- CSS API Overview の Icon note の minifier 記述を修正\n  (Tailwind''s --minify → lightningcss)。\n\nVRT: prose 変更に伴い Spacing (spacing-scale / half-steps)・Radius\n(radius-scale)・Elevation (shadow-scale)・CSSApi (reference) の baseline を\ndiff 目視の上 re-baseline。half-steps-dark / reference-* は 1% 閾値未満で\ngreen だったため削除 → 再取得 (sub-threshold trap 対応)。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs(storybook): 全 docs ページ横断チェック — stale 記述修正 + docs a11y 掃引 (refs #160)\n\nv0.15.0 (1.0 RC) の docs 最終チェック本体。3 系統の修正:\n\n1. stale 記述 (前回 refinement 後に landed した #317/#231/#428/#318 由来):\n   - CSS API overview: minifier 記述 (Tailwind --minify → lightningcss)、\n     manifest/registrar の公開契約 1 段落を追加、\"all 18 lv1\" 等の件数を\n     現行 25 に更新 (件数は drift しない表現に変更)\n   - Testing: Toast の role=\"status\" 主張を撤去 (Sonner の live region が\n     announce、visible toast に role なし — text で query する)\n   - FormComposition / Accessibility: 「Field は aria-required を伝播しない」\n     旧記述を announce-only 伝播 (#428) に更新\n   - Color: 旧称 \"primary scale\" → \"theme scale\" ×2\n   - Welcome: hero の Tailwind 記述を consumer-side Tailwind-free に、\n     \"Four places\" → \"Five places\"\n   - CSSApiParity / fixture: 区 C/D 列挙に DropdownMenu / Popover を追加\n   - registrar 呼称を「public-token registrar」に統一\n\n2. docs ページの実 a11y violation 修正 (74 story × light/dark の axe 掃引):\n   - state chip (curated/raw/applied/defined-only/owner) を\n     text-{state} → text-{state}-emphasis に (#344 の emphasis 契約)\n   - 名前なし SelectTrigger demo に aria-label (Welcome / FormStates /\n     Accessibility / Testing — axe button-name critical)\n   - docs-ui CodeBlock に tabIndex={0} (scrollable-region-focusable)\n   - ZIndex stack tile のラベル色を ramp 固定に (Mode 不変で AA 確保)\n   - Welcome Toast mock を emphasis + opacity 撤去で AA に\n   - ThemeAudit の code chip に text-foreground (dark で AA 割れ)\n   - 意図的例外 (solid trilemma / subtle-tier demo) は story-scoped\n     parameters.a11y disable + 理由コメントで panel を green に\n     (Color / Accessibility Contrast / CSSApi Reference / Parity)\n\n3. VRT: prose/chip 変更に伴い 13 baseline を diff 目視の上 re-baseline。\n   sub-threshold trap (1% 閾値未満で green のまま stale 化) は該当 PNG を\n   削除して忠実に再取得。全 suite 411 件 zero-diff で pass。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs(storybook): Season toolbar の stale ラベル Default (Blue) を Default (Alabaster) に (refs #160)\n\n#150 以降 default theme ramp は neutral alabaster。PR preview 確認中に発見。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqVB5SCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAxlwQACcCGY1cKh9+NlL2rHDZD6/Z\nPSiRaEr/2zamBL01kUP4rBcl9mNhCk9PUg4p1LcAtfCfpg+j99hj6f29Zn37Vwy+\nDFnr4I57DpQlb4vJiihGW7mFKKXzJ09yDjoAfMqnUu1vdawTzgzQ1o44J1UD8rwJ\nRIhM4TiAwdjM6RlQtter60LRziTDWr1OQlNH6zGeAGOXPg6yTvJOaIOcTsHFTaDv\nsTYP7pn+avcYEnv32yuo55n2BwDPbUyZhVSVw1MPMzcn5dicLIWaFnnY+gnnCoCq\n5DRO3aNVUB9Yi3TX1ubLGyQMIGlaNXLGeExiZ1yGz38AsUYKLMk4rwxBuHdstjKC\nbAHegTWI80coF+sumzdLiO95BtrBxvJMfRC8XcCacm3n3BqZihJhaVdyq7mJ2Xb9\nLdNMHY8CP2SEmsyrlG0VpwiygQxP/MSuEa+lUKudfEhfjRo13qjLyh1iiK29fLIW\nlXoiE9R0OBHkmOitV5tUyA4hy3eplkU7Csp51yn/5jQsfnqVuoZdfGu0SgtGDrsZ\nSE6PZ2QW99Dytg/UBlglb5bOLV1bAWMWOSSoT7jsZ10PKJtq7rJI5uYC4I2T1Mba\n0vYxHXD4pxXBq3siPVy9m5WO2yImK/tYso2ioyTwujfHz5VMqYQNKgFrJJHTdwDz\nDwEaAKVuHqL9GB2HnNGd\n=EGfQ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-12T23:08:03Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github