n/commits/279811172d7ebacf4b2933bf2264ef57b9608ad5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30785878?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yasmro","id":30785878,"login":"yasmro","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzg1ODc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/commits/8926bdd90cfe0604311ca897df02b2157c2162e1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-07T20:59:04Z","email":"30785878+yasmro@users.noreply.github.com","name":"y-ohno"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-07T20:59:04Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(deps): drop tailwind-merge (#461)\n\n* chore(deps): drop tailwind-merge (dead weight after .st-* sweep)\n\nCVA output and component JSX now emit only .st-* BEM classes, so twMerge\nhad no conflicting Tailwind utilities to dedupe — it was a no-op passthrough.\ncn() now wraps clsx alone (byte-identical output), removing a runtime dep\nfrom consumers'' installs. cn is internal, so this is non-breaking.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* test(lib): add cn() unit test; changeset: note patch rationale\n\nAdds the first src/lib test — pins cn''s clsx-only behavior (join, falsy\ndrop, object/array syntax, order preserved with no dedupe) as a regression\nnet for the seam. Documents in the changeset why the tailwind-merge removal\nis scoped patch (internal cn, identical output, transitive dep out-of-contract).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"eb37507922411e891852ff2fbb104fc630067a24","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/git/trees/eb37507922411e891852ff2fbb104fc630067a24"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/git/commits/8926bdd90cfe0604311ca897df02b2157c2162e1","verification":{"payload":"tree eb37507922411e891852ff2fbb104fc630067a24\nparent d39847a65577d1783758661a9918add5dba57829\nauthor y-ohno <30785878+yasmro@users.noreply.github.com> 1783457944 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783457944 +0900\n\nchore(deps): drop tailwind-merge (#461)\n\n* chore(deps): drop tailwind-merge (dead weight after .st-* sweep)\n\nCVA output and component JSX now emit only .st-* BEM classes, so twMerge\nhad no conflicting Tailwind utilities to dedupe — it was a no-op passthrough.\ncn() now wraps clsx alone (byte-identical output), removing a runtime dep\nfrom consumers'' installs. cn is internal, so this is non-breaking.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* test(lib): add cn() unit test; changeset: note patch rationale\n\nAdds the first src/lib test — pins cn''s clsx-only behavior (join, falsy\ndrop, object/array syntax, order preserved with no dedupe) as a regression\nnet for the seam. Documents in the changeset why the tailwind-merge removal\nis scoped patch (internal cn, identical output, transitive dep out-of-contract).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqTWiYCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAF8sQAK8CUOVZ7bjMNe5w6m/gw0Lg\nEDn+Yu/CjP27JA7Eop5rUPlI7vvH6dVTN5SZ1r2Jgs1aQGzMFGDpbb01j6PH