b.com/users/yasmro/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yasmro","id":30785878,"login":"yasmro","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzg1ODc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/commits/9bbb95442ddcff3210dbf6f558d1d319f169fb08/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-05T13:13:33Z","email":"30785878+yasmro@users.noreply.github.com","name":"y-ohno"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-05T13:13:33Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor(arch): Radix Props の re-export 方針を明文化・整理 (closes #156) (#448)\n\n* refactor(arch): Radix 継承の公開 Props 型を curated 再宣言に置換 (closes #156)\n\n公開シグネチャから Radix 由来型を全廃する「Radix type boundary\n(anti-corruption layer)」を導入。対象 10 コンポーネント (Select / Tooltip /\nPopover / DropdownMenu / Tabs / Radio / Checkbox / Switch / Separator /\nAvatar) の Props を「native 要素 props + curated 再宣言」へ移行し、Radix\n実体の直接 re-export 9 箇所を薄いラッパに置換。境界は\nradix-type-boundary.test.tsx (drift ガード + @ts-expect-error pin) と、\ncurated props を primitive へ spread する実装自体の typecheck で機械的に\n維持する。方針本文は .claude/rules/api-stability.md へ追記。\n\ncloses #156\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs: review-pr フォローアップ (P1/P2) — changeset 追記 + asChild 規約と Radix bump 検知の明文化\n\n- changeset: 非 asChild で element child を渡していた PopoverAnchor の DOM\n  変化 (div ラッパ消失、属性が child に載る) を明記\n- component-architecture §3: 内部 asChild ヒューリスティック (text child →\n  Radix 要素 / element child → asChild) と children なし・複数 children の\n  edge を明文化\n- prepare-release Step 3: #156 以降は @radix-ui/* bump の第一検知点が\n  pnpm typecheck (curated props の spread) である旨を追記\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"18458279ff25309870426665bce5341cfc0aa88e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/git/trees/18458279ff25309870426665bce5341cfc0aa88e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/git/commits/9bbb95442ddcff3210dbf6f558d1d319f169fb08","verification":{"payload":"tree 18458279ff25309870426665bce5341cfc0aa88e\nparent 6fab05a726cf87dd13c019016bc6ab4f4aff7f78\nauthor y-ohno <30785878+yasmro@users.noreply.github.com> 1783257213 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783257213 +0900\n\nrefactor(arch): Radix Props の re-export 方針を明文化・整理 (closes #156) (#448)\n\n* refactor(arch): Radix 継承の公開 Props 型を curated 再宣言に置換 (closes #156)\n\n公開シグネチャから Radix 由来型を全廃する「Radix type boundary\n(anti-corruption layer)」を導入。対象 10 コンポーネント (Select / Tooltip /\nPopover / DropdownMenu / Tabs / Radio / Checkbox / Switch / Separator /\nAvatar) の Props を「native 要素 props + curated 再宣言」へ移行し、Radix\n実体の直接 re-export 9 箇所を薄いラッパに置換。境界は\nradix-type-boundary.test.tsx (drift ガード + @ts-expect-error pin) と、\ncurated props を primitive へ spread する実装自体の typecheck で機械的に\n維持する。方針本文は .claude/rules/api-stability.md へ追記。\n\ncloses #156\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs: review-pr フォローアップ (P1/P2) — changeset 追記 + asChild 規約と Radix bump 検知の明文化\n\n- changeset: 非 asChild で element child を渡していた PopoverAnchor の DOM\n  変化 (div ラッパ消失、属性が child に載る) を明記\n- component-architecture §3: 内部 asChild ヒューリスティック (text child →\n  Radix 要素 / element child → asChild) と children なし・複数 children の\n  edge を明文化\n- prepare-release Step 3: #156 以降は @radix-ui/* bump の第一検知点が\n  pnpm typecheck (curated props の spread) である旨を追記\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-author