_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/yasmro/schatten/commit/282b4ff3532a279091914ad2a32d0ce758551419","node_id":"C_kwDORxxzJtoAKDI4MmI0ZmYzNTMyYTI3OTA5MTkxNGFkMmEzMmQwY2U3NTg1NTE0MTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yasmro/schatten/commit/20c4dab61db62fb12789f8fb8691b3397512ee18","sha":"20c4dab61db62fb12789f8fb8691b3397512ee18","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/commits/20c4dab61db62fb12789f8fb8691b3397512ee18"}],"sha":"282b4ff3532a279091914ad2a32d0ce758551419","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/commits/282b4ff3532a279091914ad2a32d0ce758551419"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30785878?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yasmro","id":30785878,"login":"yasmro","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzg1ODc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/commits/20c4dab61db62fb12789f8fb8691b3397512ee18/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-23T11:20:56Z","email":"30785878+yasmro@users.noreply.github.com","name":"y-ohno"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-23T11:20:56Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(lv1): Field の required を aria-required として control に伝播 (closes #428) (#440)\n\nField.required を Input / Textarea / Select / Checkbox / Switch / RadioGroup に\naria-required（announce 専用）として伝播する。isError → aria-invalid と対称。\nネイティブ検証は control 直接の required prop のみが駆動し、Field からは\n有効化しない（非破壊）。\n\nRadix 4 コントロール（Checkbox / Switch / RadioGroup / Select）は自身の\nrequired から aria-required を出し consumer props を後 spread するため、\naria-required={undefined} を注入すると Radix の値を上書きしてしまう。これを\n避けるため条件注入（field.required が true のときだけ）にし、native\n（Input / Textarea）は aria-invalid と同形の || undefined を使う 2 idiom とした。\n\ncloses #428\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c7d7f2581c2065f93516e98d3cfc381bdcbc519d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/git/trees/c7d7f2581c2065f93516e98d3cfc381bdcbc519d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/git/commits/20c4dab61db62fb12789f8fb8691b3397512ee18","verification":{"payload":"tree c7d7f2581c2065f93516e98d3cfc381bdcbc519d\nparent d6c1fcf0f68ffc3fe71a206a6f25d33f698b77f7\nauthor y-ohno <30785878+yasmro@users.noreply.github.com> 1782213656 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782213656 +0900\n\nfeat(lv1): Field の required を aria-required として control に伝播 (closes #428) (#440)\n\nField.required を Input / Textarea / Select / Checkbox / Switch / RadioGroup に\naria-required（announce 専用）として伝播する。isError → aria-invalid と対称。\nネイティブ検証は control 直接の required prop のみが駆動し、Field からは\n有効化しない（非破壊）。\n\nRadix 4 コントロール（Checkbox / Switch / RadioGroup / Select）は自身の\nrequired から aria-required を出し consumer props を後 spread するため、\naria-required={undefined} を注入すると Radix の値を上書きしてしまう。これを\n避けるため条件注入（field.required が true のときだけ）にし、native\n（Input / Textarea）は aria-invalid と同形の || undefined を使う 2 idiom とした。\n\ncloses #428\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqOmwYCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAiDUQAChbnYDpYzNvDKyJFgu09emo\n3MqrF9OIgQjmCN1sHXPkAdFLp8Mgtw5MtCvLkUsy6vnjAENaCV8G1wk0fAfosVZO\nTf7d2KsAkdGjfjUIZkadX/OLhR1IUwLOKMkbORVgVB0u+IqeRAtWD2lT+LPxlgJ+\nSkUJ6RV90rDTotzVgzHnV2j6j3ae/pUuAQ3xHf0kjcA5KIgg72jp6V6KxtPdoOcc\n2pWgQYOAdHk2D8qyCEbdUYajJb7WRCITwwYt7rMW3nKozAo868aYssbbxyy3DAm7\nYz71SfeiPmEtqnV9gQE2a0XAiwSTLIz8jvEE/FddOVsFSj9HcnEY3Mh1y0i5W90H\nfoaX+CdaBRuoA33rkVWW9u80g3hhNxKB7QsWB7RM2prvsJKrb4Hf3d9x5VGJ7M+n\nBRjcNttMog9+ryQZy+EKPvEIrc9+N+xSeEcLZXdVgYvlGtoYU3om4xgtRslytZfS\n6LcJ6FtFH3vKhN5r8CZQxuCKsBH9Bhrn1QvTAnezBUH+5XnERKSyESiZJAiSdr9J\nCCKGpTwUWVqLPNmSK0I5kVzMgbn6z41BZw4/raXaT9qfOjjmRdlGb2KvhpFh7Y1S\nvwDEL8HNnWLGbuY3DP6mJF8nhwpsV9fMtGK6bhQ+A9VO7kn1HFPGCuG9/fZEl/b9\nCvy916HOeLyQ9rp0zksj\n=MenT\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-23T11:20:57Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view