ro/schatten/commit/5993fe4088f8eec3e15da2cacf41f5638bda11a4","node_id":"C_kwDORxxzJtoAKDU5OTNmZTQwODhmOGVlYzNlMTVkYTJjYWNmNDFmNTYzOGJkYTExYTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yasmro/schatten/commit/92c6d73f6cc1cc7360f422447455f3848c5782d0","sha":"92c6d73f6cc1cc7360f422447455f3848c5782d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/commits/92c6d73f6cc1cc7360f422447455f3848c5782d0"}],"sha":"5993fe4088f8eec3e15da2cacf41f5638bda11a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/commits/5993fe4088f8eec3e15da2cacf41f5638bda11a4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30785878?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yasmro","id":30785878,"login":"yasmro","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzg1ODc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/commits/92c6d73f6cc1cc7360f422447455f3848c5782d0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-20T14:42:52Z","email":"30785878+yasmro@users.noreply.github.com","name":"y-ohno"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-20T14:42:52Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"ci(audit): audit job を blocking に昇格 (#307 Phase 2) (#415)\n\ncompanion-coverage gate (#307) の Phase 1 observe 期間を終了し blocking 化する。\n現状 develop の全 lv1 が `pnpm audit:coverage --check` を pass（exit 0）しているため、\n`continue-on-error: true` を外しても既存 PR を即座に赤くしない。以降は required\ncompanion（test / VRT spec / class-API CSS / __snapshots__ baseline / index.ts\nre-export ＋ 区分 A/B の parity 系）の欠落で PR が落ちる。step は `set -o pipefail`\nで既に gap 時 exit 1 するので、continue-on-error 除去だけで赤シグナルが伝播する。\n\n`audit` を develop の required check に追加するのは repo 設定（ruleset）であり\n本 workflow 外（#346 の required-check 整備と同時に実施）。\n\nchangeset 不要（CI workflow のみ、公開 surface 不変）。\n\nRefs #307\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"91e198b97806595c5ba80369936f5ef9c767ed57","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/git/trees/91e198b97806595c5ba80369936f5ef9c767ed57"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/git/commits/92c6d73f6cc1cc7360f422447455f3848c5782d0","verification":{"payload":"tree 91e198b97806595c5ba80369936f5ef9c767ed57\nparent 3bffa4761dcc96aef0ec43a16ff00525fa61d69c\nauthor y-ohno <30785878+yasmro@users.noreply.github.com> 1781966572 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781966572 +0900\n\nci(audit): audit job を blocking に昇格 (#307 Phase 2) (#415)\n\ncompanion-coverage gate (#307) の Phase 1 observe 期間を終了し blocking 化する。\n現状 develop の全 lv1 が `pnpm audit:coverage --check` を pass（exit 0）しているため、\n`continue-on-error: true` を外しても既存 PR を即座に赤くしない。以降は required\ncompanion（test / VRT spec / class-API CSS / __snapshots__ baseline / index.ts\nre-export ＋ 区分 A/B の parity 系）の欠落で PR が落ちる。step は `set -o pipefail`\nで既に gap 時 exit 1 するので、continue-on-error 除去だけで赤シグナルが伝播する。\n\n`audit` を develop の required check に追加するのは repo 設定（ruleset）であり\n本 workflow 外（#346 の required-check 整備と同時に実施）。\n\nchangeset 不要（CI workflow のみ、公開 surface 不変）。\n\nRefs #307\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqNqbsCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAflQQAF3gsd8yWkGRuUknua1qK1Jw\nIigDErJTzSD9ZLZ28dJd8YAsdQP4T8a8wflrFzAU1KvcJhGWdKJI6u2lwr2Zh+Ek\nf6k2MF4v7sBL5sU/0ZZauExwW9YBa2se9buefgylq