"C_kwDORxxzJtoAKDA1ZWUyYzc1YjIzMTczMmJhYzlhOTc5NzFhMjQ3ZTk2YjZlNTBjNmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yasmro/schatten/commit/816ea9cb8101cf6c380353da74553d7bbe893af7","sha":"816ea9cb8101cf6c380353da74553d7bbe893af7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/commits/816ea9cb8101cf6c380353da74553d7bbe893af7"}],"sha":"05ee2c75b231732bac9a97971a247e96b6e50c6d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/commits/05ee2c75b231732bac9a97971a247e96b6e50c6d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30785878?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yasmro","id":30785878,"login":"yasmro","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzg1ODc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/commits/816ea9cb8101cf6c380353da74553d7bbe893af7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-17T23:45:21Z","email":"30785878+yasmro@users.noreply.github.com","name":"y-ohno"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-17T23:45:21Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(a11y): foreground-muted/subtle を WCAG 2.1 AA に引き上げ (#344 Phase A) (#412)\n\n* fix(a11y): foreground-muted/subtle を WCAG 2.1 AA に引き上げ (#344)\n\nmuted/subtle foreground が 1 ink rung 明るすぎて小テキストのコントラストが\n未達だった (#147 Phase 1 の axe triage)。両者を 1 rung 暗くし、muted は小テキスト\n≥ 4.5:1、subtle は三次段を維持しつつ大テキスト 3:1 を満たすようにする。\n\n- primitives: --ink-faint (sumi-500) を新設\n- semantic: muted → ink-medium / ink-medium-inverted、\n  subtle → ink-faint / ink-light-inverted（light / .dark / @media の 3 ブロック）\n- resolution.test: MODE_LAYER の leaf を更新\n- docs: ink palette に --ink-faint を追加、foreground tier の説明を AA 注記に同期、\n  subtle を小テキストに誤用していた 7 箇所を muted へ移設\n\n変数名は不変のため CSS API surface (manifest) に変更なし。\nVRT baseline は #376 (seasonal ramp retune) と合わせて一括再撮影するため本コミットでは未更新。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* test(tokens): foreground tier の WCAG コントラストを pin (#344)\n\nleaf-resolution は「どの primitive に解決するか」しか pin しておらず、\nコントラスト比そのものは誰も assert していなかった。primitive の OKLCH 値の\n再調整や tier の張り替えで muted/subtle が AA を下回っても、leaf pin は通って\nしまう。resolved token → WCAG 相対輝度 → コントラスト比を計算し、\n\n- foreground-muted ≥ 4.5:1（小テキスト、light/dark × surface/background）\n- foreground-subtle ≥ 3:1（大テキスト、設計どおり 4.5 は要求しない）\n- subtle < muted（三次段が潰れないことの hierarchy ガード）\n\nを恒久的に検証する（review-pr P1 の反映）。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* test(vrt): foreground tier の AA retune に伴う baseline 再生成 (#344)\n\n#412 の muted/subtle コントラスト引き上げで、muted/subtle テキストを描画する\n4 baseline がドリフト。diff を category 別に目視し、\n\n- Field/disabled-light · Elevation/usage-guide-light … muted テキストの色シフトのみ\n- Color/colors-light·dark … muted/subtle swatch の色変更 + --ink-faint 行追加に伴う\n  下方シフト（意図どおり）\n\nであることを確認のうえ再撮影（#376 とは切り離し #344 単独で実施）。CSSApiDist の\n大量ドリフトは full `pnpm build`（dist/css 未生成）前の artifact で、build 後は解消。\nclean compare で 0 diff を確認済み。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4ea649d1d5da8d99e31b6b6f14beb8babd99ab4b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/git/trees/4ea649d1d5da8d99e31b6b6f14beb8babd99ab4b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/git/commits/816ea9cb8101cf6c380353da74553d7bbe893af7","verification":{"payload":"tree 4ea649d1d5da8d99e31b6b6f14beb8babd99ab4b\nparent 7666aba58cb615ef89fb57ea01a1d8dc7d4f6c97\nauthor y-ohno <30785878+yasmro@users.noreply.github.com> 1781739921 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781739921 +0900\n\nfix(a11y): foreground-muted/subtle を WCAG 2.1 AA に引き上げ (#344 Phase A) (#412)\n\n* fix(a11y): foreground-muted/subtle を WCAG 2.1 AA に引き上げ (#344)\n\nmuted/subtle foreground が 1 ink rung 明るすぎて小テキストのコントラストが\n未達だった (#147 Phase 1 の axe triage)。両者を 1 rung 暗くし、muted は小テキスト\n≥ 4.5:1、subtle は三次段を維持しつつ大テキスト 3:1 を満たすようにする。\n\n- primitives: --ink-faint (sumi-500) を新設\n- semantic: muted → ink-medium / ink-medium-inverted、\n  subtle → ink-faint / ink-light-inverted（light / .dark / @media の 3 ブロック）\n- resolution.test: MODE_LAYER の leaf を更新\n- docs: ink palette に --ink-faint を追加、foreground tier の説明を AA 注記に同期、\n  subtle を小テキストに誤用していた 7 箇所を muted へ移設\n\n変数名は不変のため CSS API surface (manifest) に変更なし。\nVRT baseline は #376 (seasonal ramp retune) と合わせて一括再撮影するため本コミットでは未更新。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* test(tokens): foreground tier の WCAG コントラストを pin (#344)\n\nleaf-resolution は「どの primitive に解決するか」しか pin しておらず、\nコントラスト比そのものは誰も assert していなかった。primitive の OKLCH 値の\n再調整や tier の張り替えで muted/subtle が AA を下回っても、leaf pin は通って\nしまう。resolved token → WCAG 相対輝度 → コントラスト比を計算し、\n\n- foreground-muted ≥ 4.5:1（小テキスト、light/dark × surface/background）\n- foreground-subtle ≥ 3:1（大テキスト、設計どおり 4.5 は要求しない）\n- subtle < muted（三次段が潰れないことの hierarchy ガード）\n\nを恒久的に検証する（review-pr P1 の反映）。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* test(vrt): foreground tier の AA retune に伴う baseline 再生成 (#344)\n\n#412 の muted/subtle コントラスト引き上げで、muted/subtle テキストを描画する\n4 baseline がドリフト。diff を category 別に目視し、\n\n- Field/disabled-light · Elevation/usage-guide-light … muted テキストの色シフトのみ\n- Color/colors-light·dark … muted/subtle swatch の色変更 + --ink-faint 行追加に伴う\n  下方シフト（意図どおり）\n\nであることを確認のうえ再撮影（#376 とは切り離し #344 単独で実施）。CSSApiDist の\n大量ドリフトは full `pnpm build`（dist/css 未生成）前の artifact で、build 後は解消。\nclean compare で 0 diff を確認済み。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqMzGRCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAFUgQAH7keAeD+CizQsQ2Z6Q2moQw\nZeWEtzl18gKZuh+JVLYnb7fXwmy3/efDNOlHgb26bwoWZWRWFLn7hWedB60VbMTr\nedIgujAGRCCv0VUZyiG2vcbaSbI/X679vCGrkxcgzjRpXKlftfqBgyZEH+USGER5\nClXA5GRByjSojvc9bNSUCZLHRGFhjvWePIFK93OJGC7xKe8c1hmGbyycBgMOJxv2\n7I14D3QHT6dLW47w1qJnQfzR8JY5pU6HEa34vIZuOFjICX3ZNlj4Swa1ZOspvki1\nhUref/1f1OGyxOJozme0jkJMhsgctJpQa95sdSjGC5F0tGiKh6+wcTE9SFs4h9wp\naSru9YxvaRq+sx0XGWUiPhN/DDqIvzaA72+zekvHO1Bg3I0NnaR4zLtJmeqp9fqk\nmEiNBl4RBrcmu9fpxh+LyLjwpeN1KnMrCLgj35wTroEs1iO6pZIVGKLldVpfibSf\n9E2gFGllN7/TpYiIdK7opEsUmzsu3dLN9kO1ASSiQtgTdL39Ti15p/itql8+VKwU\nW3OYCcahHBqF3tCA2Y7yQkoJMPgj60AvzquNjFpuoCdY/Eah+nIQ4m4zgYZhUkqf\nnvFGxatxe1BCKvxGa4hPCV1mQxkgr5E3Y8ppfB3kk70BC05gW/1hKzITWN28irs3\n+SmhT44POaJK+vKphq2G\n=4tVU\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-17T23:45:22Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/yasmro/schatten/commit/816ea9cb8101cf6c380353da74553d7bbe893af7","node_id":"C_kwDORxxzJtoAKDgxNmVhOWNiODEwMWNmNmMzODAzNTNkYTc0NTUzZDdiYmU4OTNhZjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yasmro/schatten/commit/7666aba58cb615ef89fb57ea01a1d8dc7d4f6c97","sha":"7666aba58cb615ef89fb57ea01a1d8dc7d4f6c97","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/commits/7666aba58cb615ef89fb57ea01a1d8dc7d4f6c97"}],"sha":"816ea9cb8101cf6c380353da74553d7bbe893af7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/commits/816ea9cb8101cf6c380353da74553d7bbe893af7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30785878?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yasmro","id":30785878,"login":"yasmro","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzg1ODc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/commits/7666aba58cb615ef89fb57ea01a1d8dc7d4f6c97/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-17T06:39:24Z","email":"30785878+yasmro@users.noreply.github.com","name":"y-ohno"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-17T06:39:24Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(lv1): Callout/Toast のアイコン整列とアクション/クローズを改善 (#411)\n\n* feat(lv1): Callout/Toast のアイコン整列とアクション/クローズを改善\n\n- アイコンの垂直中心を title の1行目に合わせる（title+body / title+description 時）。\n  アイコン(1.25rem)が title line-box(17.5px)より高く、従来の flex-start +\n  margin-top:0.125rem だとアイコン中心が title 中心より約3px下にずれていたのを\n  margin-top: calc((0.875rem*1.25 - 1.25rem)/2) で title 行へ centering。\n  Toast の regime を :has(title):has(description) に変更し Callout とミラー。\n- action を trailing slot から __content 列内（body/description の下、\n  align-self:flex-start）へ移動。\n- close(X) を専用の .st-callout__close / .st-toast__close（1.5rem 角・\n  currentColor で tone 非依存・DS focus ring）に置換。multi-line では\n  margin-top:-0.25rem で title 行へ寄せる。Sonner swipe 対策(#318)は引き継ぎ。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* refactor(lv1): centering 式を scoped var 化 + solid×close の VRT を追加\n\n- P2: Callout/Toast のアイコン整列 offset を scoped var\n  (--schatten-{callout,toast}-icon-size / -title-size / -title-leading) から\n  導出。icon 規則・title 規則・offset が同一ソースを参照し、formula が\n  これらから drift できないように。値は不変（margin-top:-1.25px のまま、\n  VRT 全 368 green）。scoped var は @theme 外なので manifest 非公開のまま。\n- P1: Callout に \"Solid Dismissible\" story を追加し VRT roster へ登録。\n  saturated 面での currentColor close の可読性に baseline を張る\n  （subtle×close は Long Content、Toast solid×close は Solid Treatments で\n  既出）。light/dark 2枚を生成・目視確認済み。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"726083eedb9333b868016bc3368d71ae52df4a05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/git/trees/726083eedb9333b868016bc3368d71ae52df4a05"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/git/commits/7666aba58cb615ef89fb57ea01a1d8dc7d4f6c97","verification":{"payload":"tree 726083eedb9333b868016bc3368d71ae52df4a05\nparent bd76b444b0820fc73d173fd45d2d7fcadc0e47e3\nauthor y-ohno <30785878+yasmro@users.noreply.github.com> 1781678364 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781678364 +0900\n\nfeat(lv1): Callout/Toast のアイコン整列とアクション/クローズを改善 (#411)\n\n* feat(lv1): Callout/Toast のアイコン整列とアクション/クローズを改善\n\n- アイコンの垂直中心を title の1行目に合わせる（title+body / title+description 時）。\n  アイコン(1.25rem)が title line-box(17.5px)より高く、従来の flex-start +\n  margin-top:0.125rem だとアイコン中心が title 中心より約3px下にずれていたのを\n  margin-top: calc((0.875rem*1.25 - 1.25rem)/2) で title 行へ centering。\n  Toast の regime を :has(title):has(description) に変更し Callout とミラー。\n- action を trailing slot から __content 列内（body/description の下、\n  align-self:flex-start）へ移動。\n- close(X) を専用の .st-callout__close / .st-toast__close（1.5rem 角・\n  currentColor で tone 非依存・DS focus ring）に置換。multi-line では\n  margin-top:-0.25rem で title 行へ寄せる。Sonner swipe 対策(#318)は引き継ぎ。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* refactor(lv1): centering 式を scoped var 化 + solid×close の VRT を追加\n\n- P2: Callout/Toast のアイコン整列 offset を scoped var\n  (--schatten-{callout,toast}-icon-size / -title-size / -title-leading) から\n  導出。icon 規則・title 規則・offset が同一ソースを参照し、formula が\n  これらから drift できないように。値は不変（margin-top:-1.25px のまま、\n  VRT 全 368 green）。scoped var は @theme 外なので manifest 非公開のまま。\n- P1: Callout に \"Solid Dismissible\" story を追加し VRT roster へ登録。\n  saturated 面での currentColor close の可読性に baseline を張る\n  （subtle×close は Long Content、Toast solid×close は Solid Treatments で\n  既出）。light/dark 2枚を生成・目視確認済み。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqMkEcCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAADFMQAKTKGHPHWzv0DWDjdXMK/Ycs\nPlWkjvF0E/kCRVQTWghMXTMadDTfvSOPyZfSxt2cEvDLU6czVfvYFef36I78024C\n03JBPtR59vfqdnGjgAKrexWDbqKefuip2DMkIklAq5e/XRrayaI1mdDzpb+N7gOZ\nM4dUPtfDp+lo+4A+0DNnm6LZJ7zo+a7K/uV0zGyjMiOtnE6ujY5yc9nMVmMBLeaG\n6kh5Lw1xkUUPZ6hN26pirIo9MKFzKC4ZE/GEWzAuVQkwvN3GzcYEFPizyGgU/dad\nP1UquKu9acKMXXgDqEpWUT/YgaUYQ6XlUl7w+YJR3Dhh7yJMS9fZelF1Y/STZSzP\n3zFPlaGVUF39gPVrLdgcj9fMKNRw/7Auv0ZmM+aNqrB4VQM8JL74vZ/DL5F6bwKx\nh94awXbWKeczkYuykZx0YorWK9Xagh/fGxXcimCOF4KeK