owers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yasmro","id":30785878,"login":"yasmro","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzg1ODc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/commits/403091a03a9158540644b30e13d342f354bdcaf5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-16T13:24:24Z","email":"30785878+yasmro@users.noreply.github.com","name":"y-ohno"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-16T13:24:24Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(lv1): Tabs コンポーネントを追加 (closes #44) (#404)\n\n@radix-ui/react-tabs ベースの compound (Tabs / TabsList / TabsTrigger /\nTabsContent)。単一スタイルの line 型、orientation (horizontal/vertical) と\nactivationMode (automatic/manual) を公開。orientation は List/Trigger が\nRoot の値を prop で受け取れない compound 構造のため [data-orientation] 属性\nセレクタでスタイル分岐し、css-api.md に compound 例外として明文化。\n\nアクティブ下線は共有 .st-tabs__indicator を JS で配置し CSS transition で\nタブ間をスライド (prefers-reduced-motion 時は即時移動)。enabled かつ非アクティブ\nなタブは hover で --color-surface-hover の背景 (tertiary Button 同様、角丸なし。\nactive / disabled は対象外)。TabsTrigger は icon prop で左側アイコン注入に対応。\n\nベース罫線は list の inset box-shadow で描画。border だと border box（padding の\n外側）に乗りインジケータ（padding box 内側エッジ）と離れてしまうため、inset\nshadow で同じ padding box 内側エッジに乗せ、アクティブ(黒)とベース(グレー)を\n完全に一致させた。box-shadow は要素の描画なのでスクロールしても固定・可視幅\nいっぱいに残る。タブ溢れ時は主軸を overflow スクロール (バー非表示)、選択時は\nlist.scrollLeft/Top で可視範囲へ送り込む。フォーカスリングが切れないよう 4px\npadding + 相殺 margin。vertical の tab 列は flex-shrink: 0 で固定幅にして、アクティブ\npanel の内容幅で右罫線がズレないようにした。inactive tab は WCAG AA を満たす full\nforeground、active 区別は indicator + aria-selected。indicator スライド / overflow\nscroll-into-view は Playwright interaction test で固定。\n\nCSS API parity grid (CSSApiDist / CSSApi) に tabs の vanilla / React サンプルを追加。\nTabs は 区分 D だが portal でなくインライン描画なので audit の PARITY_EXEMPT に登録。\n\ncloses #44\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"97c6ca7a077054f6494ec44bcbd32608b75c2482","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/git/trees/97c6ca7a077054f6494ec44bcbd32608b75c2482"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/git/commits/403091a03a9158540644b30e13d342f354bdcaf5","verification":{"payload":"tree 97c6ca7a077054f6494ec44bcbd32608b75c2482\nparent 6ba8074b12907b67759186b336e8dca4578b669c\nauthor y-ohno <30785878+yasmro@users.noreply.github.com> 1781616264 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781616264 +0900\n\nfeat(lv1): Tabs コンポーネントを追加 (closes #44) (#404)\n\n@radix-ui/react-tabs ベースの compound (Tabs / TabsList / TabsTrigger /\nTabsContent)。単一スタイルの line 型、orientation (horizontal/vertical) と\nactivationMode (automatic/manual) を公開。orientation は List/Trigger が\nRoot の値を prop で受け取れない compound 構造のため [data-orientation] 属性\nセレクタでスタイル分岐し、css-api.md に compound 例外として明文化。\n\nアクティブ下線は共有 .st-tabs__indicator を JS で配置し CSS transition で\nタブ間をスライド (prefers-reduced-motion 時は即時移動)。enabled かつ非アクティブ\nなタブは hover で --color-surface-hover の背景 (tertiary Button 同様、角丸なし。\nactive / disabled は対象外)。TabsTrigger は icon prop で左側アイコン注入に対応。\n\nベース罫線は list の inset box-shadow で描画。border だと border box（padding の\n外側）に乗りインジケータ（padding box 内側エッジ）と離れてしまうため、inset\nshadow で同じ padding box 内側エッジに乗せ、アクティブ(黒)とベース(グレー)を\n完全に一致させた。box-shadow は要素の描画なのでスクロールしても固定・可視幅\nいっぱいに残る。タブ溢れ時は主軸を overflow スクロール (バー非表示)、選択時は\nlist.scrollLeft/Top で可視範囲へ送り込む。フォーカスリングが切れないよう 4px\npadding + 相殺 margin。vertical の tab 列は flex-shrink: 0 で固定幅にして、アクティブ\npanel の内容幅で右罫線がズレないようにした。inactive tab は WCAG AA を満たす full\nforeground、active 区別は indicator + aria-selected。indicator スライド / overflow\nscroll-into-view は Playwright interaction test で固定。\n\nCSS API parity grid (CSSApiDist / CSSApi) に tabs の vanilla / React サンプルを追加。\nTabs は 区分 D だが portal でなくインライン描画なので audit の PARITY_EXEMPT に登録。\n\ncloses #44\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqMU6ICRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA0cEQALBGEUxw8Z8xeztQuJRJ8IPk\nPJ1/eNO0vQ/4quzEWGiUwdH61FyOmMmdIeJLuPn7t5bX3mfiK+mfxI/wL0C6ib2I\nrC9n8Bg3JRfDm5twe8HUfpruhqeLJ9VXFhHNTnSqOlyPERTv536BF8iN5hUzCb3o\nfnj7We4yKs0xIH7TnVwEri+28LyffPi/jkH6DdE7OUcEKEGr8aNJZbuv4O3gThZd\n5aYvakhskv+GIZ3QdLHcdqvT8V9xQFYNDTFxoTDc7qRCVZK4NkIh1h+gKNS/zYlV\nkFaTVUxLlSVxSO8z0aGjglY8yYuIJeLTw5uxPVvv0tZZ7PyLSKRnlr+JuITwwWpc\ncytd/gc4a0D3X2JjRi4Ul9OKD6FlRhjvyzgim8hfJQwUlKEqBp/wIfg5mlXEtTaX\njqIL3mA941DUAdQBWvoIKvSTEpmcuWlTwK2fyOEvB4Qx/tUjsU4mIiI9j9yUOBUI\nhu11CXnBzi6+FbRs238KHqrhGy7qPYq+MiciOlK1z7B0TXhrAKDjXl0gqevjaYF9\njMerTQ7BYrE7wa30bdNxwP2C4qoh0bZnhpBicpmAPteVCzheVBS+ibVA3NwaCQ3r\nRZOtv5NBT6UsuTROpgDZ5R4X75XJO35WVS5B/tl7v2IB+Lc7iD9jVOG4C+BMAXM4\nKMF4uTBSzfohtSKZTNyk\n=hJx9\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-16T13:24:24Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/yasmro/schatten/commit/403091a03a9158540644b30e13d342f354bdcaf5","node_id":"C_kwDORxxzJtoAKDQwMzA5MWEwM2E5MTU4NTQwNjQ0YjMwZTEzZDM0MmYzNTRiZGNhZjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yasmro/schatten/commit/6ba8074b12907b67759186b336e8dca4578b669c","sha":"6ba8074b12907b67759186b336e8dca4578b669c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/commits/6ba8074b12907b67759186b336e8dca4578b669c"}],"sha":"403091a03a9158540644b30e13d342f354bdcaf5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/commits/403091a03a9158540644b30e13d342f354bdcaf5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30785878?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yasmro","id":30785878,"login":"yasmro","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzg1ODc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/commits/6ba8074b12907b67759186b336e8dca4578b669c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-14T16:40:17Z","email":"30785878+yasmro@users.noreply.github.com","name":"y-ohno"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-14T16:40:17Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(lv1): DropdownMenu コンポーネントを追加 (#403)\n\nRadix UI (`@radix-ui/react-dropdown-menu`) ベースの lv1 複合コンポーネント。\nDropdownMenuItem (variant: default/destructive, icon) / CheckboxItem /\nRadioGroup・RadioItem / Sub*(サブメニュー) / Label / Separator / Group /\nShortcut をフルセットで同梱。トリガは Tooltip の isTextOnly パターンで asChild\nを内部制御(公開 asChild なし)。区分 D のため parity は持たず、manifest +\nclass API unit test + React VRT で契約を担保。\n\n主な設計上の学び: portal で nested position:fixed 子(SubContent)を持つ content\nは transform/translate 禁止(containing-block トラップ)。gap は Radix\nsideOffset、開閉アニメは opacity のみ。css-api.md に規範化し、回帰ガード\n(DropdownMenu.interaction.vrt.spec.ts)を追加。\n\nメニューパネルは角丸なし、hover ハイライトは Select と揃え(四角・全幅)。\ncomponent-api-conventions の matrix に menu-item 第3類型を追記。\n\ncloses #41\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4aa24e7e34bc9fe6e00dfb7a5ecc5c200d1f5a7a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/git/trees/4aa24e7e34bc9fe6e00dfb7a5ecc5c200d1f5a7a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/git/commits/6ba8074b12907b67759186b336e8dca4578b669c","verification":{"payload":"tree 4aa24e7e34bc9fe6e00dfb7a5ecc5c200d1f5a7a\nparent 269be4fd2f4fd5f0012b526b4866d5a0d95506d4\nauthor y-ohno <30785878+yasmro@users.noreply.github.com> 1781455217 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781455217 +0900\n\nfeat(lv1): DropdownMenu コンポーネントを追加 (#403)\n\nRadix UI (`@radix-ui/react-dropdown-menu`) ベースの lv1 複合コンポーネント。\nDropdownMenuItem (variant: default/destructive, icon) / CheckboxItem /\nRadioGroup・RadioItem / Sub*(サブメニュー) / Label / Separator / Group /\nShortcut をフルセットで同梱。トリガは Tooltip の isTextOnly パターンで asChild\nを内部制御(公開 asChild なし)。区分 D のため parity は持たず、manifest +\nclass API unit test + React VRT で契約を担保。\n\n主な設計上の学び: portal で nested position:fixed 子(SubContent)を持つ content\nは transform/translate 禁止(containing-block トラップ)。gap は Radix\nsideOffset、開閉アニメは opacity のみ。css-api.md に規範化し、回帰ガード\n(DropdownMenu.interaction.vrt.spec.ts)を追加。\n\nメニューパネルは角丸なし、hover ハイライトは Select と揃え(四角・全幅)。\ncomponent-api-conventions の matrix に menu-item 第3類型を追記。\n\ncloses #41\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqLtlxCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA5SwQAGc5qNTdkw2vtPMcEakkvtbe\nPkwEjuPDY33nPwBzG4m0QyESqI07IT8lhEJmZWIYJz3M+xCfsafYG9s1NqPlbulD\nAAxrI6KzVVKhqqbB05RFia8MiaZP9ASHz95EX9m0w3Cjnp84+XcNCXBhF4SwqVFX\njEq9kAEG3u378X/3s5H3CLchnXFls65PEN8DPeS+BeU2Rk/JESHHvcCZHSEd/5Cu\nC/5cP643LOZgGKzOTFIP9jLNE6QP7+s2XK2lPOO1AvqYAdd/U1tkLlx3CB0U9Koh\n7DC5YwMaZ6HN5GpCqeYoZ7cuUo9UfO3rcDrHMiXwpeobnuBiObryYvUROLYtrmxK\nk9jVmwOQsYifB4zmZajHDfdPhjDXlt2qkkrEa8cMW3ftGDYleQSSIt09RUA7zySs\nkoUuAW3QUey+t1kJ4onNvDmLseP3HnSsgnfNvjp6OMULkG1wIN/SAUlrN8JwO8bC\nYWGPgQo+4QX/dJmP/4rgDFAlAPJgY2KlmpoSPSfrPnUR0ZDWmpTTQk/WBTSpnH6P\no/9ZFkYXqrX7s4PpiBqBqdrwpQXr6JWFIzfxSdAN8jSYzc7oxhBBm6TGPhnYtcD1\nyTofCrFV6TUWd8vlA/T5rXJwBAYwpR0rmTqW3zHWDNCZFVi0fSxQI8Vpx+jieejb\nAObnt7p4H+qBY1ZgOenj\n=394+\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-14T16:40:17Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/yasmro/schatten/commit/6ba8074b12907b67759186b336e8dca4578b669c","node_id":"C_kwDORxxzJtoAKDZiYTgwNzRiMTI5MDdiNjc3NTkxODZiMzM2ZThkY2E0NTc4YjY2OWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yasmro/schatten/commit/269be4fd2f4fd5f0012b526b4866d5a0d95506d4","sha":"269be4fd2f4fd5f0012b526b4866d5a0d95506d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/commits/269be4fd2f4fd5f0012b526b4866d5a0d95506d4"}],"sha":"6ba8074b12907b67759186b336e8dca4578b669c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/commits/6ba8074b12907b67759186b336e8dca4578b669c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30785878?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yasmro","id":30785878,"login":"yasmro","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzg1ODc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/commits/269be4fd2f4fd5f0012b526b4866d5a0d95506d4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-14T09:43:39Z","email":"30785878+yasmro@users.noreply.github.com","name":"y-ohno"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-14T09:43:39Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(lv1): Button ラベルを bold 化し destructive hover で文字色も沈むよう調整 (#401)\n\n* fix(lv1): Button ラベルを bold 化し destructive hover で文字色も沈むよう調整\n\n- `.st-btn` の font-weight を 500 → 700 にしてボタンラベルを太字化。\n  `link` variant は `font-weight: inherit` のままで段落埋め込み時に影響なし。\n- destructive variant の hover で背景の暗色化に加えラベル文字色も\n  `color-mix` で destructive base 側へシフト（primary の\n  `--color-solid-foreground-hover` 相当を、state トークンの 4-token shape を\n  崩さず CSS 側で表現）。light は白文字が暗く、dark は黒文字が明るくなる。\n- クラス API / 状態属性 / CSS 変数の追加・改名・削除なし（manifest 不変）。\n- ボタンを描画する全 VRT baseline を再生成（Button / parity / Dialog /\n  Toast(action あり) / CSSApi / CSSApiDist / Composition / Spacing /\n  ThemeAudit / SeasonalShowcase）。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* test(vrt): develop マージ後のボタン描画 baseline を再生成\n\nText #184 の cap-height 補正（--st-font-size-adjust を body reset に適用）と\n本 PR の Button bold 化が重なるため、ボタンを描画する VRT baseline を\nマージ後ソース（bold + cap-height）から再生成して両変更を反映。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* test(lv1): Button hover の文字色シフト回帰テストを追加 + AA 検証を記録\n\nP1: VRT(静止)も axe(静的状態)も hover の color シフトを検知できないため、\n実ポインタで filled variant(primary=token / destructive=color-mix)が hover で\nラベルを暗化することを luminance で pin する非スクショ Playwright テストを追加。\nghost/outline(secondary/tertiary)は不変であることも検証。\n\nP0: destructive hover の AA を実測（light 5.64:1 / dark 5.57:1、いずれも 4.5:1 超）\nし、82% mix が両 Mode で安全である根拠を Button.css コメントに記録。調整不要。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2be1a600fd44589d197d2acab8bc90018b60671a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/git/trees/2be1a600fd44589d197d2acab8bc90018b60671a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/git/commits/269be4fd2f4fd5f0012b526b4866d5a0d95506d4","verification":{"payload":"tree 2be1a600fd44589d197d2acab8bc90018b60671a\nparent 4585e560d6c87ac3b4bff4bf590b0374146dc8ae\nauthor y-ohno <30785878+yasmro@users.noreply.github.com> 1781430219 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781430219 +0900\n\nfix(lv1): Button ラベルを bold 化し destructive hover で文字色も沈むよう調整 (#401)\n\n* fix(lv1): Button ラベルを bold 化し destructive hover で文字色も沈むよう調整\n\n- `.st-btn` の font-weight を 500 → 700 にしてボタンラベルを太字化。\n  `link` variant は `font-weight: inherit` のままで段落埋め込み時に影響なし。\n- destructive variant の hover で背景の暗色化に加えラベル文字色も\n  `color-mix` で destructive base 側へシフト（primary の\n  `--color-solid-foreground-hover` 相当を、state トークンの 4-token shape を\n  崩さず CSS 側で表現）。light は白文字が暗く、dark は黒文字が明るくなる。\n- クラス API / 状態属性 / CSS 変数の追加・改名・削除なし（manifest 不変）。\n- ボタンを描画する全 VRT baseline を再生成（Button / parity / Dialog /\n  Toast(action あり) / CSSApi / CSSApiDist / Composition / Spacing /\n  ThemeAudit / SeasonalShowcase）。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* test(vrt): develop マージ後のボタン描画 baseline を再生成\n\nText #184 の cap-height 補正（--st-font-size-adjust を body reset に適用）と\n本 PR の Button bold 化が重なるため、ボタンを描画する VRT baseline を\nマージ後ソース（bold + cap-height）から再生成して両変更を反映。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* test(lv1): Button hover の文字色シフト回帰テストを追加 + AA 検証を記録\n\nP1: VRT(静止)も axe(静的状態)も hover の color シフトを検知できないため、\n実ポインタで filled variant(primary=token / destructive=color-mix)が hover で\nラベルを暗化することを luminance で pin する非スクショ Playwright テストを追加。\nghost/outline(secondary/tertiary)は不変であることも検証。\n\nP0: destructive hover の AA を実測（light 5.64:1 / dark 5.57:1、いずれも 4.5:1 超）\nし、82% mix が両 Mode で安全である根拠を Button.css コメントに記録。調整不要。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqLnfLCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA43sQADsIBcRmHEZJ7c/TpN/LbyhB\nR/eauZj6oUl/198sDEq55Icc+2ibd/H9JnRJzM7D7aFlUiwoeWFn7yvIrcbi0AdF\n2R33XjiUxczuNWZGS8rsE0WipEdUblp1hTNbNR037AWb4gMJmA1uX5RPcbo1IqD7\neTRWuIOs2nPQvZM3m1B/Bq2Kre8Glnr1kjD7KEdPi2+DKMxGSPVy7eXVPDKWCqej\nQa+dy6pSB9pqy57PiqiFNZJsMZQVBDCLA7nwxKZVL5NCZTf2HhP7hwhUJGDX0NEv\n043B0OGjKzp6EGLbeKftzra