/commit/775d1da80cdd0cc89903345f32b8df73243e91a9","sha":"775d1da80cdd0cc89903345f32b8df73243e91a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/commits/775d1da80cdd0cc89903345f32b8df73243e91a9"}],"sha":"22c2c3684bda875206660a86e89f3ced222df8f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/commits/22c2c3684bda875206660a86e89f3ced222df8f2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30785878?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yasmro","id":30785878,"login":"yasmro","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzg1ODc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yasmro","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/commits/775d1da80cdd0cc89903345f32b8df73243e91a9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-14T08:15:19Z","email":"30785878+yasmro@users.noreply.github.com","name":"y-ohno"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-14T08:15:19Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor(docs): Welcome のリンクマニフェストを非 stories モジュールへ切り出し (#399)\n\n* refactor(docs): Welcome のリンクマニフェストを非 stories モジュールへ切り出し\n\n`WELCOME_DEEP_LINKS` / `WELCOME_COMPONENT_SLUGS` は `Welcome.stories.tsx` の\nnamed export だったため、Storybook の CSF スキャナがストーリーと誤認し\n`WELCOME DEEP LINKS` / `WELCOME COMPONENT SLUGS` という空のサイドバー項目を\n2つ生成していた。\n\n定数と `WelcomeDeepLink` 型をプレーンな `Welcome.links.ts` へ移動し、\nstories と drift テストの双方がそこから import するように変更。CSF は\n`*.stories.tsx` しか走査しないため、サイドバー漏れが構造的に解消する\n(`excludeStories` のような後付け抑制が不要)。\n\n- index.json の Welcome 配下が welcome--overview の1件のみに (以前3件)\n- Welcome ページの deep-link カード27枚は href 込みで従来どおり描画\n- Welcome.drift.test.ts 56 passed / typecheck / lint いずれもクリーン\n\nStorybook 内部のみの変更で公開 surface (.st-* / props / CSS変数) に影響しない\nため changeset は不要 (story IDs are internal)。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore(changeset): add patch changeset for Welcome links extraction\n\nStorybook 内部のみの変更だが、本リポジトリの changeset gate は\n`changeset status --since=origin/<base>` で空変更を許さないため、\ndocs-only PR の慣例 (#377 等) に倣い patch + 公開 API 不変の明記とする。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7f7c1ccc804df5a5af65e089be7b3258c1a75b58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/git/trees/7f7c1ccc804df5a5af65e089be7b3258c1a75b58"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/git/commits/775d1da80cdd0cc89903345f32b8df73243e91a9","verification":{"payload":"tree 7f7c1ccc804df5a5af65e089be7b3258c1a75b58\nparent b7d6969c304aafb5ccf03f7f90e82e019f66ea46\nauthor y-ohno <30785878+yasmro@users.noreply.github.com> 1781424919 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781424919 +0900\n\nrefactor(docs): Welcome のリンクマニフェストを非 stories モジュールへ切り出し (#399)\n\n* refactor(docs): Welcome のリンクマニフェストを非 stories モジュールへ切り出し\n\n`WELCOME_DEEP_LINKS` / `WELCOME_COMPONENT_SLUGS` は `Welcome.stories.tsx` の\nnamed export だったため、Storybook の CSF スキャナがストーリーと誤認し\n`WELCOME DEEP LINKS` / `WELCOME COMPONENT SLUGS` という空のサイドバー項目を\n2つ生成していた。\n\n定数と `WelcomeDeepLink` 型をプレーンな `Welcome.links.ts` へ移動し、\nstories と drift テストの双方がそこから import するように変更。CSF は\n`*.stories.tsx` しか走査しないため、サイドバー漏れが構造的に解消する\n(`excludeStories` のような後付け抑制が不要)。\n\n- index.json の Welcome 配下が welcome--overview の1件のみに (以前3件)\n- Welcome ページの deep-link カード27枚は href 込みで従来どおり描画\n- Welcome.drift.test.ts 56 passed / typecheck / lint いずれもクリーン\n\nStorybook 内部のみの変更で公開 surface (.st-* / props / CSS変数) に影響しない\nため changeset は不要 (story IDs are internal)。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore(changeset): add patch changeset for Welcome links extraction\n\nStorybook 内部のみの変更だが、本リポジトリの changeset gate は\n`changeset status --since=origin/<base>` で空変更を許さないため、\ndocs-only PR の慣例 (#377 等) に倣い patch + 公開 API 不変の明記とする。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqLmMXCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA7qQQAKwAI+FS5og4u6Gxm/rN2CVH\nJ3TYHI4bDyGTHqthzslkfFvyoZhbyG73ckPnKPtpv3GY8wUD5qhxX/mwUKYr3KYw\n7CiMn3494kNZUr8H0kP15AtBMTqRURjxAh6vHgm2+Nz5slebPbak+RshaMkBqnCV\nEycsvcNb7hGkieW7a8sG+GNQ5n3GSz7fr4sd3KJnqoqB1JtV9xsL1+rO1whXlZBI\nbH+EIOvG0FMkWDf5TPoFriB2zHhlU0Ii7G/6rMpo4C+4z6+2nwHBXlrIBzPlY/au\nbjQvHXkZNqahN8piswYvUvcDzoj3elJL0Vd0vmCqO3oKJ98ffsB8yCGBnGd1NKsW\n2+j9UtAYJcD+xM0NGqxj4tf2gONp8KFDSBnYlWtHcjyzCHnAfMfhmKKPJ13104kR\n0AQ+c2lBwIpRQ7uPIkPyxOt/LuBWOXjlb8AHHSPlpwbJR173QMXVD6lDISSOA80b\nZcQcrY+O3ZH6SewQxh5LSwFOF1q3OFKqSlRaCFhqEp21jXawzaPFBKB5iCBqbK29\nLn2EDO8mS/tLi28O9h950vDU/S/QMxBu+23nRLZ0+kFk60FgQe6dlUI6nIGIfre9\nyjv86FLN7HbKLQ0rp3eDo6B6j1dJJdMaoZ0OP7L3mZl7x2ppzwR4zeWERa+saF0Y\nfe8BlnE4T0KHgWjpTu78\n=zpDg\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-14T08:15:20Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_ur