mro/schatten/commits/b7d6969c304aafb5ccf03f7f90e82e019f66ea46/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-14T06:15:31Z","email":"30785878+yasmro@users.noreply.github.com","name":"y-ohno"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-14T06:15:31Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor(lv1): Toast を Radix Toast から sonner に置き換え + loading 機能を追加 (#396)\n\nToast の内部実装を @radix-ui/react-toast から sonner@2.0.7 に置き換え、toast.custom() で各 toast を自前描画(実 Icon/Spinner/Button + .st-toast* クラス、Callout 構造一致)。stacking/swipe/enter-exit/auto-dismiss は Sonner 所有。toast.loading() / toast.promise()(.unwrap()/finally)を追加。expand 既定 true。close/action の実クリック不具合(id-clobber + swipe)を修正し interaction テストで担保。区分 C/D の interaction テスト必須化を rule 化。\n\ncloses #318","tree":{"sha":"bfb37466583a9c8b2008fe8bf8f856ea2c4a086f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/git/trees/bfb37466583a9c8b2008fe8bf8f856ea2c4a086f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/git/commits/b7d6969c304aafb5ccf03f7f90e82e019f66ea46","verification":{"payload":"tree bfb37466583a9c8b2008fe8bf8f856ea2c4a086f\nparent 306d9108626322303e2c6fe582b9506d34a440c7\nauthor y-ohno <30785878+yasmro@users.noreply.github.com> 1781417731 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781417731 +0900\n\nrefactor(lv1): Toast を Radix Toast から sonner に置き換え + loading 機能を追加 (#396)\n\nToast の内部実装を @radix-ui/react-toast から sonner@2.0.7 に置き換え、toast.custom() で各 toast を自前描画(実 Icon/Spinner/Button + .st-toast* クラス、Callout 構造一致)。stacking/swipe/enter-exit/auto-dismiss は Sonner 所有。toast.loading() / toast.promise()(.unwrap()/finally)を追加。expand 既定 true。close/action の実クリック不具合(id-clobber + swipe)を修正し interaction テストで担保。区分 C/D の interaction テスト必須化を rule 化。\n\ncloses #318","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqLkcECRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAbnkQAJs6by/g56HOjdes9YrmSFN9\nXaOpenyBOmaPLRBv1em07cxvsyPyP3GdilCyqlA6tqzr26Givi+G12Qpu/Uzdn1D\nlGn2keCJ7kVbEfXcFd8HyTRFKnYuOoMuAsgAnyJIvMg+i7ikkYgCdNdr1