rsion で 0.10.0→0.11.0 になる\n\n再発防止 (main→develop back-merge 運用化) は別 issue で追跡。\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"10105e4144bf369ddbe340c6ddf2352e29ad4c1b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/git/trees/10105e4144bf369ddbe340c6ddf2352e29ad4c1b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/git/commits/2fc7a06d95ca6e02709f23484fb5adf41a88b9fe","verification":{"payload":"tree 10105e4144bf369ddbe340c6ddf2352e29ad4c1b\nparent 45f2fe4d6835746b899b9befb74ce600396ed8e1\nauthor y-ohno <30785878+yasmro@users.noreply.github.com> 1781349138 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781349138 +0900\n\nfix(release): develop の version 状態を公開実態 (0.10.0) へ同期 (#387)\n\ndevelop は package.json=0.8.0 のまま固まり、v0.9.0/v0.10.0 で既に\n公開・消費済みの changeset 28 件が残留していた (リリース時の\nchangeset version が main 側でのみ実行され develop に back-merge\nされない運用の副作用)。このままだと develop で changeset version を\n走らせると 0.8.0→0.9.0 と既公開バージョンに衝突する。\n\n- package.json version: 0.8.0 → 0.10.0 (npm latest / origin/main と一致)\n- 公開済み 28 changeset を削除 (origin/main 到達履歴で消費済みと確認)\n- 残る 23 件が v0.11.0 分 → changeset version で 0.10.0→0.11.0 になる\n\n再発防止 (main→develop back-merge 運用化) は別 issue で追跡。\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqLTsSCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAXWQQAKwX3nuytWOV+JhVPx+0OGJs\nIVYUfhVOox4hkwE1o5I/xMAsVhlFOcQ8fOc3DF3HrI5OQihm7lI3vgv60rp4fqZw\nyZyjeLjFjT5RHoIHe70sX1HoRu+tNkYjEIGP2AHWZKpw41JSOhQDsTfb9CLhGsEO\nyuJrne12zO4tTi04r4sIlFYfIVRQjl4gXdSV28LeSTA4Bjn/JmHHzAEt1lbA174l\n+Fzs2V57qk9vit4utkrTqfdHsJPFIONFd6WIC4c9BY0uGTDXqP5+JE0Fw4tRTDt8\nagmoORtwExK4s34irEPk5zfk+k3mEvL0DQ1TsSsVhnT1rVwqxY1MjlWNVHB3lfNt\nIWFLa+fSNrUsqXM3OnS9CLexX1232sE50goRABEvtFHFQpKxhxj97ATWOBcOXSBz\nlVaJPGB1Nw+rFyjKS9BzG0XKOvjtyQbBJI5meas27pV5x+BE+YtfVddkF3Sz5zu4\npliRCMPl3alsvML4HGcj2m1Q3/7zhqlomDsU9TZHg3vT3YS9T8iJtk4ohgKXuiMk\n39RQxtWCapWk8TdfSTZtPYyw+h2M0bTK7NHw7kjV40kUb2n8z6KKghWR6