romExport を使い、story モジュールは import せず source を\n読む(SeasonalShowcase の import-time 副作用 / Vitest の空 ?raw を回避)。\nstorybook-guideline の deep-link 同期節に suffix(export 名)も同期対象である旨と\ndrift test への参照を追記。\n\ncloses #375\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1225576ed5af74d607c634d4aa7cf894e877b864","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/git/trees/1225576ed5af74d607c634d4aa7cf894e877b864"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yasmro/schatten/git/commits/4636ad5f9b45a37feffabad6b0098fa4a9f3dac4","verification":{"payload":"tree 1225576ed5af74d607c634d4aa7cf894e877b864\nparent b9802787713f3e445a6b29ccd5413aebd687fbe6\nauthor y-ohno <30785878+yasmro@users.noreply.github.com> 1781312203 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781312203 +0900\n\ntest(storybook): Welcome deep-link の drift test を追加 (closes #375) (#385)\n\nWelcome の navigateToStory deep link を WELCOME_DEEP_LINKS manifest に集約し、\nWelcome.drift.test.ts でリンク先 story の slug/suffix/viewMode を実定義と突合する。\ntitle rename・export rename・viewMode×entry-type drift・Patterns 網羅性・\nComponentCard slug の 5 観点を機械検知する。id 導出は Storybook 自身の\nsanitize / storyNameFromExport を使い、story モジュールは import せず source を\n読む(SeasonalShowcase の import-time 副作用 / Vitest の空 ?raw を回避)。\nstorybook-guideline の deep-link 同期節に suffix(export 名)も同期対象である旨と\ndrift test への参照を追記。\n\ncloses #375\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqLKrLCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAI7EQAEqx5DW3Ygl5EfdPoU7HJI9U\n2MeT9mmrg3RDL6RCmK/PE1Asx6IV5jDj+P7jS+yYo+bZXIjki1PbLPqGzAtADaEF\nPkLq6lHpqBNmKMNpBUiSCrDsWfajw/gcsFHTJTwCHd9uaKJFk/OT10jMFFy1rOwJ\ndFl/txbFmc3hIUaQyFSGVcL+LNZbvqNW5DS6yGr6zpUT8EGUmnI1Ri4vQ5voVRvp\ngH0/yfCNaQHj+Bw/E1hMWWW4JSYCWU2Puf7ytcqRi65wbq8C6MuSjqVkNh8IdaBr\nYSc0LjgONgxX8OuUcjh5jdh6KrUtEZEsuH5lvIcpkdaxmGVcKxZaRQovudfd73rQ\nrKjpjB3yQ7VYMd/nZHDBRKp3mkK2xGHzzOL7WJEOaLMZe+KCKefNzQ8VR+WEg23C\nmNyZd4XuegROdK8mbANGhphzYkZW+9/fZur7E+SuHwPtYOLpy4i