tatuspageAdmin permission.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n\n* fix: update requiredPermission to module-specific permission in frontend registration\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"c2519d6bbe9953a175597038f9a8f655deeac8f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-statuspage-io/git/trees/c2519d6bbe9953a175597038f9a8f655deeac8f5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-statuspage-io/git/commits/3247407c0f1b99f822469a892bd83ab5f8e35ef2","verification":{"payload":"tree c2519d6bbe9953a175597038f9a8f655deeac8f5\nparent f2289d4832ff976462d15673c7e3f51803794926\nauthor Florent BOURASSÉ <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1781084507 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781084507 +0200\n\nfeat: add statuspageAdmin permission for fine-grained RBAC (#6)\n\n* feat: add statuspageAdmin permission for fine-grained RBAC\n\nDefine statuspageAdmin as a JCR child permission of admin in\nsrc/main/import/permissions.xml so existing full admins keep access\nvia inheritance, while the updateStatuspageIoConfig GraphQL mutation\ncan now be delegated to users holding only the module-specific\nstatuspageAdmin permission.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n\n* fix: update requiredPermission to module-specific permission in frontend registration\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqKTFbCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA8xsQAGDn6ITr3Fqemsldp/IudeMg\n0hqUrvf0nsdvdxbxzMO7Tot7qGTvOE5mzIii9r3lPqwoYHgSNrVC7YIjTpX6ogF2\nnf4j6j0qDJdnQNf+O0VsPepQohbCLTZuVwjJjc8oFbEhi6slrfx0cinPnqW8Sam2\nhbczZxKd+nN30B7M0BGgEGwA30nYpb5v2R6PJTcjeJfp2xrCirTA0bWK0jCCB6f6\n93eTaxb1aO9A10zPQHUfGW21GujbKD3u7dBwJeldNe78VQdvI6LjR4FYNIQNWfF5\nU6QMWlS/rwTpXG1xRzjvhM/jGW7usRMd42dKBAyZhpHUD9Wr3NMmQORV5FMONUk9\nBafCd