mit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-10T05:58:28Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-10T05:58:28Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"fix: harden config null-safety, dedupe PID constants, add unit tests\n\nS1/R1 GqlStatuspageIoConfig.getPageId: read config once (was calling\ngetConfig() twice -> null race) and guard null service and null pageId,\nreturning empty string instead of risking NPE.\n\nS2/R2 StatuspageIoConfigServiceImpl.hash: null-safe pageId via\nStringUtils.defaultString to avoid NPE when OSGi config has no value.\n\nS3/R3 StatuspageIoConfigServiceImpl: extract duplicated magic strings\ninto CONFIG_PID and PAGE_ID_PROPERTY constants.\n\nS4/R4 Add JUnit5/AssertJ/Mockito unit tests (20) covering pageId\nvalidation (DNS-label regex, injection-shaped inputs rejected,\nlength bound), persistence flow, empty-string clear, and the\nGraphQL null-safety paths.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"11822c357d75a1d7bce3053b649b6b783673ba1b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-statuspage-io/git/trees/11822c357d75a1d7bce3053b649b6b783673ba1b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-statuspage-io/git/commits/92ecac028f2c5d82cc294ede74c077419d6d5f80","verification":{"payload":"tree 11822c357d75a1d7bce3053b649b6b783673ba1b\nparent c5fc66310ec46bdc8e21ba30c6218ef81d0e35c8\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1781071108 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1781071108 +0200\n\nfix: harden config null-safety, dedupe PID constants, add unit tests\n\nS1/R1 GqlStatuspageIoConfig.getPageId: read config once (was calling\ngetConfig() twice -> null race) and guard null service and null pageId,\nreturning empty string instead of risking NPE.\n\nS2/R2 StatuspageIoConfigServiceImpl.hash: null-safe pageId via\nStringUtils.defaultString to avoid NPE when OSGi config has no value.\n\nS3/R3 StatuspageIoConfigServiceImpl: extract duplicated magic strings\ninto CONFIG_PID and PAGE_ID_PROPERTY constants.\n\nS4/R4 Add JUnit5/AssertJ/Mockito unit tests (20) covering pageId\nvalidation (DNS-label regex, injection-shaped inputs rejected,\nlength bound), persistence flow, empty-string clear, and the\nGraphQL null-safety paths.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmoo/QQACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3mKkgf9FAAvXgNIwfFMFs7umduc2qMUGLCqXzYXWadNSkpES2pA8JeGYLejIbx5\np+Z22+vAWk7SuSBgOKrhCw07m3H1uUKoyOKe7HRe4fwpLJG6iX5erqUQ4QGWK4lZ\nT68r+mFlyIDNfql9pXux+ThsZ3HE5l7eqfOKjepUMbN1R0nxERHbOcIFOU/WqOCc\nVhIosyJCafS4FYyqrru5jvQxfjAxpQr6Cj0JkY02It+rCbHy5u3fGbrcOjGnnTVi\n8dMZPOQITJmHj02C0FNH7KvLV0WyFzs/LUuraBkHYb8YLFmbePIuqUS15RXvIjAF\n1Upe8uD0JWixEtlOr0udOpvd7abcmg==\n=dxUo\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-10T05:58:34Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/jahia-statuspage-io/commit/92ecac028f2c5d