ceived_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-statuspage-io/commits/a363117816011674900248c8e00c1c60fbfceaf4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-06T12:46:35Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T12:46:35Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"chore(deps): remove unused dependencies formik, @material-ui/core, react-redux, @apollo/react-hooks\n\nNone of these packages are imported anywhere in src/javascript. Removing them\nreduces the install surface and eliminates stale transitive dependency risk.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"6de1813e3a6e114996312aa6038d66fa52c9611e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-statuspage-io/git/trees/6de1813e3a6e114996312aa6038d66fa52c9611e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-statuspage-io/git/commits/a363117816011674900248c8e00c1c60fbfceaf4","verification":{"payload":"tree 6de1813e3a6e114996312aa6038d66fa52c9611e\nparent a3669caecc2f8b70f3fb7783095a18eab2c8c183\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1780749995 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1780749995 +0200\n\nchore(deps): remove unused dependencies formik, @material-ui/core, react-redux, @apollo/react-hooks\n\nNone of these packages are imported anywhere in src/javascript. Removing them\nreduces the install surface and eliminates stale transitive dependency risk.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmokFqsACgkQU