T12:46:08Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-06T12:46:08Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"fix(osgi): remove duplicate @Modified from activate(), guard null OSGi service and config\n\n- StatuspageIoConfigServiceImpl: drop @Modified from activate() so config\n  updates invoke only the dedicated modified() method, not both handlers.\n- StatuspageIoConfigServiceImpl: make LOGGER private static final.\n- StatuspageIoMutationExtension: null-guard BundleUtils.getOsgiService()\n  result; throw IllegalStateException with a clear message instead of NPE.\n- GqlStatuspageIoConfig: null-guard getConfig() in getPageId(); return \"\"\n  when the service has not yet completed @Activate.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"96d52431102a8886e579315553865e4d7d209bc6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-statuspage-io/git/trees/96d52431102a8886e579315553865e4d7d209bc6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-statuspage-io/git/commits/46b8405a3f447e9ec065753b79f909a4a0d9c7cf","verification":{"payload":"tree 96d52431102a8886e579315553865e4d7d209bc6\nparent 05dcb8c84b49040b5954bee9eacddbbceca45011\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1780749968 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1780749968 +0200\n\nfix(osgi): remove duplicate @Modified from activate(), guard null OSGi service and config\n\n- StatuspageIoConfigServiceImpl: drop @Modified from activate() so config\n  updates invoke only the dedicated modified() method, not both handlers.\n- StatuspageIoConfigServiceImpl: make LOGGER private static final.\n- StatuspageIoMutationExtension: null-guard BundleUtils.getOsgiService()\n  result; throw IllegalStateException with a clear message instead of NPE.\n- GqlStatuspageIoConfig: null-guard getConfig() in getPageId(); return \"\"\n  when the service has not yet completed @Activate.\n\nSigned-off-by: Fl