ASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-16T12:45:54Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"Validate Statuspage.io pageId to prevent JS injection\n\n- Enforce DNS subdomain label format (a-z, 0-9, hyphen, 1-63 chars) in\n  StatuspageIoConfigServiceImpl.updatePageId to prevent persisting\n  attacker-controlled values that would later be interpolated into an\n  iframe URL and a JS string literal.\n- In statuspageIoWidget.jsp, validate the node-stored pageId character\n  by character before injecting it into the inline <script>, and\n  validate event.origin in the postMessage listener (matching the\n  banner.js behaviour).\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"7388417e5101eb49a576a21be5aaba638734e097","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-statuspage-io/git/trees/7388417e5101eb49a576a21be5aaba638734e097"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-statuspage-io/git/commits/bd6c6ce7561de7beceb733dac672d8a063a287ee","verification":{"payload":"tree 7388417e5101eb49a576a21be5aaba638734e097\nparent 883516ec195e4abe72a7e909f58e614f030e1f1e\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778935554 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778935554 +0200\n\nValidate Statuspage.io pageId to prevent JS injection\n\n- Enforce DNS subdomain label format (a-z, 0-9, hyphen, 1-63 chars) in\n  StatuspageIoConfigServiceImpl.updatePageId to prevent persisting\n  attacker-controlled values that would later be interpolated into an\n  iframe URL and a JS string literal.\n- In statuspageIoWidget.jsp, validate the node-stored pageId character\n  by character before injecting it into the inline <script>, and\n  validate event.origin in the postMessage listener (matching the\n  banner.js behaviour).\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmoIZwIACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL