start.md — 5-minute first agent tutorial (register,\n  create task, poll queue, complete, heartbeat)\n- Add docs/agent-setup.md — registration methods, SOUL personalities,\n  config, heartbeats, agent sources\n- Add docs/orchestration.md — 7 patterns: manual assignment, queue\n  dispatch, auto-dispatch with model routing, Aegis quality review,\n  cron recurring tasks, multi-agent handoff, stale task recovery\n- Add \"Getting Started with Agents\" section to README with guide table\n- Add cross-reference links to docs/deployment.md\n\nSEO:\n- Fix app layout title/description for search ranking\n- Add og:type, og:siteName, upgrade twitter card to summary_large_image\n- Add public/robots.txt (block /api/, /setup, /login from crawlers)\n- Add public/llms.txt for AI discoverability","tree":{"sha":"f140f04c5b512e5314baeddb758df450dd7b7a40","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/watson-gpositive/custom-mission-control/git/trees/f140f04c5b512e5314baeddb758df450dd7b7a40"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/watson-gpositive/custom-mission-control/git/commits/34cbc351a1824327770bf70842ac50ca840632ca","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93952610?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0xNyk","id":93952610,"login":"0xNyk","node_id":"U_kgDOBZmaYg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.co