26-03-21T14:46:45Z","email":"0xnykcd@googlemail.com","name":"Nyk"},"message":"feat(tui): add terminal dashboard for Mission Control\n\nZero-dependency TUI using raw ANSI escape codes. Shows:\n- System health status with connection indicator\n- Agents panel (sorted by status, with last heartbeat)\n- Tasks panel (recent tasks with status and assignee)\n- Token costs summary (24h)\n\nKeyboard controls:\n- r: refresh now\n- a: focus agents panel\n- t: focus tasks panel\n- w: wake first sleeping agent\n- q/Esc: quit\n\nAuto-refreshes every 5s (configurable with --refresh flag).\nUses same profile/auth system as CLI and MCP server.\n\nRun with: pnpm mc:tui","tree":{"sha":"ea8667331d375e09a8bef401b402c14fa59bed40","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/watson-gpositive/custom-mission-control/git/trees/ea8667331d375e09a8bef401b402c14fa59bed40"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/watson-gpositive/custom-mission-control/git/commits/06cfb3d9db1f003fd94216e449f89694145fd5bb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93952610?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0xNyk","id":93952610,"login":"0xNyk","node_id":"U_kgDOBZmaYg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"http