U_kgDOBZmaYg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/watson-gpositive/custom-mission-control/commits/afa8e9dacbd24e798b00e7700db0ac4b14936472/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-21T11:45:48Z","email":"0xnykcd@googlemail.com","name":"Nyk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-21T11:45:48Z","email":"0xnykcd@googlemail.com","name":"Nyk"},"message":"fix: security hardening from audit (closes #460)\n\n- Hash session tokens (SHA-256) before storing in DB; migration for existing tokens\n- Enforce 12-char password minimum on self-service change (was 8, creation was 12)\n- Increase scrypt cost N=16384→65536 with progressive rehash on login\n- Add MC_PROXY_AUTH_TRUSTED_IPS to restrict proxy auth header spoofing\n- Enable HSTS by default in production (opt-out via MC_DISABLE_HSTS=1)\n- Restrict debug endpoint to allowlisted gateway API paths (SSRF prevention)\n- Default session cookie secure=true in production\n- Gate MC_DISABLE_RATE_LIMIT on NODE_ENV !== ''production''\n- Remove password value from insecure-default log warning\n- chmod 600 generated secrets file in Docker entrypoint","tree":{"sha":"96f5a2f537c36bd32432d0f0f7f070414c3d778a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/watson-gpositive/custom-mission-control/git/trees/96f5a2f537c36bd32432d0f0f7f070414c3d778a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/watson-gpositive/custom-mission-control/git/commits/afa8e9dacbd24e798b00e7700db0ac4b14936472","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_