:"93952610+0xNyk@users.noreply.github.com","name":"nyk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-16T05:18:12Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: migrate clawdbot CLI calls to gateway RPC and improve session labels (#407)\n\nReplace all `runClawdbot([''-c'', ...])` invocations with\n`callOpenClawGateway()` RPC calls in session control, spawn, and delete\nroutes. This eliminates the deprecated CLI dependency and uses the\nstructured gateway protocol instead.\n\nAlso add `formatSessionLabel()` helper and `useAgentSessions()` hook to\ntask-board-panel for better session dropdown display labels.\n\nCloses #401, closes #406","tree":{"sha":"b9407c759fb0ab85f8180746af90b7691e96bf67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/watson-gpositive/custom-mission-control/git/trees/b9407c759fb0ab85f8180746af90b7691e96bf67"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/watson-gpositive/custom-mission-control/git/commits/17bf0761f5effa40a7e459a4acbc1c06c8f5859e","verification":{"payload":"tree b9407c759fb0ab85f8180746af90b7691e96bf67\nparent 85b4184aa9c849fd4b41000b34b853d83c80d892\nauthor nyk <93952610+0xNyk@users.noreply.github.com> 1773638292 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773638292 +0700\n\nfix: migrate clawdbot CLI calls to gateway RPC and improve session labels (#407)\n\nReplace all `runClawdbot([''-c'', ...])` invocations with\n`callOpenClawGateway()` RPC calls in session control, spawn, and delete\nroutes. This eliminates the deprecated CLI dependency and uses the\nstructured gateway protocol instead.\n\nAlso add `formatSessionLabel()` helper and `useAgentSessions()` hook to\ntask-board-panel for better session dropdown display labels.\n\nCloses #401, closes #406","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpt5KUCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA87MQAIPQsEPXfNhT9EuGmJAyP7Af\nsfPERfW6XOSRGYBAVUUo79Iz0V7kNfrfQkD5hU8zAhK/dRdcQm9paYS091Swbb5N\nvtqt0a3itZNCyym0423rjGZEIDPBZxjaIFr4ObkOW0lZsJnsDajE3+WCqEZIGgj5\n+Cz34sC7pOrGOpJMRP+Wsy