/workspaces/current is a separate static\nroute registered earlier and is unaffected (useWorkspaceId keeps working); the\nSKIP_AUTH mock user is admin, so dev + the agents decoration test still pass via\nthe admin realm-role bypass. +12 guard tests (non-member 403, anon 401, member\n200, admin bypass — across all three routes).\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"96b0a2f88ce87723012d81cd5de535c43545263e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urule-ai/urule/git/trees/96b0a2f88ce87723012d81cd5de535c43545263e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urule-ai/urule/git/commits/34d0eb22bc01748d791f6ccbad2131cced3d79cd","verification":{"payload":"tree 96b0a2f88ce87723012d81cd5de535c43545263e\nparent db556dbd87edae56c2faabc021ec0603549ea55c\nauthor PanoramicRum <ricardobarcar@gmail.com> 1780746791 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780746791 -0600\n\nfix(registry): membership-gate the workspace-scoped read routes (#4) (#125)\n\nGET /workspaces/:wsId/agents, /workspaces/:wsId/runtimes, and /workspaces/:wsId\nwere ungated — any authenticated user could read another workspace''s agents,\nruntimes, or metadata by changing :wsId (read-IDOR). Gate all three with\nrequireMembership(workspaceParamResolver()), the same pattern used for the\nworkspace-scoped conversations list. /workspaces/current is a separate static\nroute registered earlier and is unaffected (useWorkspaceId keeps working); the\nSKIP_AUTH mock user is admin, so dev + the agents decoration test still pass via\nthe admin realm-role bypass. +12 guard tests (non-member 403, anon 401, member\n200, admin bypass — across all three routes).\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqJAonCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAPFsQAEnb4XiGchcypT5qy2eSoDoT\n81xKUBkbXq+hgzTfyLf6iVFfkfTNSM7LxceoYSyABwbM9XFS+Ccwznzy8/UfTsSY\n/b+/PlfhqWPA2r5///S6kBRhk8hKmXPT0iz+mIkPPbClU6kNm+R2Z85sAFJ1ES