/api.github.com/repos/urule-ai/urule/commits/76b0b9bd9ffa251cda44e0e54b24dbf452ea87b2"}],"sha":"ef49bca63238ad7afa79150cafe6ee947df24b30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urule-ai/urule/commits/ef49bca63238ad7afa79150cafe6ee947df24b30"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6556452?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PanoramicRum","id":6556452,"login":"PanoramicRum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NTY0NTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urule-ai/urule/commits/76b0b9bd9ffa251cda44e0e54b24dbf452ea87b2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-18T12:37:50Z","email":"ricardobarcar@gmail.com","name":"PanoramicRum"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-18T12:37:50Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(packages): resource-level authorization on the packages service (#4 phase D) (#106)\n\nPhase D of issue #4 (C-04). The `packages` service had no workspace boundary\non its routes — case B (\"read another workspace''s installations\"): a valid JWT\ncould list any workspace''s installs and read/upgrade/rollback/remove any\ninstallation by id.\n\n- config: OPENFGA_URL / OPENFGA_STORE_ID / OPENFGA_MODEL_ID.\n- server.ts: bootstrapAuthzClient (shared @urule/authz helper) + authzMiddleware\n  registered after auth-middleware.\n- New src/authz.ts — workspace-id resolvers: `wsParamResolver` (the `:wsId`\n  path routes), `bodyWorkspaceResolver` (POST /install), and\n  `installationWorkspaceResolver` (looks an installation up by `:installId`,\n  unknown id → null → 404 without leaking existence).\n- requireMembership preHandler on all 7 routes — including the GET list /\n  GET-by-id reads, which is the actual case-B fix: GET /workspaces/:wsId/packages,\n  GET /workspaces/:wsId/updates, GET /packages/:installId, POST /install,\n  POST /:installId/upgrade, POST /:installId/rollback, DELETE /:installId.\n- compose: packages gets OPENFGA_URL + depends_on openfga.\n\nTests: new tests/authz-enforcement.test.ts (non-member 403, member 2xx, admin\nbypass, unknown-id 404, cross-workspace install read blocked). packages 72 +\nrepo-wide typecheck green.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e381a18d07bf06c4622aa1e54f937d1b6b6dda53","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urule-ai/urule/git/trees/e381a18d07bf06c4622aa1e54f937d1b6b6dda53"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urule-ai/urule/git/commits/76b0b9bd9ffa251cda44e0e54b24dbf452ea87b2","verification":{"payload":"tree e381a18d07bf06c4622aa1e54f937d1b6b6dda53\nparent b1fe1537661bd52d1427681e08eb9c26f1fc5d98\nauthor PanoramicRum <ricardobarcar@gmail.com> 1779107870 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779107870 -0600\n\nfeat(packages): resource-level authorization on the packages service (#4 phase D) (#106)\n\nPhase D of issue #4 (C-04). The `packages` service had no workspace boundary\non its routes — case B (\"read another workspace''s installations\"): a valid JWT\ncould list any workspace''s installs and read/upgrade/rollback/remove any\ninstallation by id.\n\n- config: OPENFGA_URL / OPENFGA_STORE_ID / OPENFGA_MODEL_ID.\n- server.ts: bootstrapAuthzClient (shared @urule/authz helper) + authzMiddleware\n  registered after auth-middleware.\n- New src/authz.ts — workspace-id resolvers: `wsParamResolver` (the `:wsId`\n  path routes), `bodyWorkspaceResolver` (POST /install), and\n  `installationWorkspaceResolver` (looks an installation up by `:installId`,\n  unknown id → null → 404 without leaking existence).\n- requireMembership preHandler on all 7 routes — including the GET list /\n  GET-by-id reads, which is the actual case-B fix: GET /workspaces/:wsId/packages,\n  GET /workspaces/:wsId/updates, GET /packages/:installId, POST /install,\n  POST /:installId/upgrade, POST /:installId/rollback, DELETE /:installId.\n- compose: packages gets OPENFGA_URL + depends_on openfga.\n\nTests: new tests/authz-enforcement.test.ts (non-member 403, member 2xx, admin\nbypass, unknown-id 404, cross-workspace install read blocked). packages 72 +\nrepo-wide typecheck green.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqCwgeCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAgmsQADKLyOuCHrIwtybDARU+PXap\ng766Ip7MtbpcpjrK6Ls/t8c+ci9qRELbKrx+Xf1pBYssjcfjQ0ZQVDiOM2Dbw1U4\n+hTOCAxDMe5lFLNgOnyqUdJ6NOJM0JBOeBn5eIIpxhvuCAXh/V1Kefw27jPS88G2\nnc0rT+ClJ1qMFLdacZHEjU51ti7aI9f6HVE4dABJaBq1bZRQ4sGDTtcod9xtvHl/\nb+h7DLym3iqPvUct7ne1KKyWHKnXrUStsxbFwOrJL2rmF7sA+WWTo0Ql70wj6Gyq\nuJwfjgG5mWRw/0x3apWaIQCZY8e4cnzjAGyHs8HKWrNotdGaTqCY4DYcwvyvxCTR\n8eVEw91rrkLVYQvWgon2Tlc6K44iIvw59lWlAO8DNiQHReF4V/TG7iLIDccIOPCI\nto2ywpZAKIUiT7Suu+h/G7Mwc0erf9cT399tgJNP7GDItBlU4TMdAo3t8Cce1bxI\nFJ0ztGaY011g/O1EICPWQJISlN26tGtO5oW0Vd8AW+ZQWZYhRP3Uk3xhfXHhfCk4\nLpT+w3G5QNe6j9GCj7adC71ryHkryeF40hRNF63/PQvTGUyaQjDel48559HgJHER\n53aYl9v5Dck0Nl6Z2OOQWUsYMr2sckU8RMtyeGOGnuzfkr/VhiwE4uV0SEdn5qap\nDalNN1Gtm9v2B9QK+08g\n=qhp7\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-18T12:37:51Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/priv