avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6556452?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PanoramicRum","id":6556452,"login":"PanoramicRum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NTY0NTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urule-ai/urule/commits/95092d84373821def66fbb3b624c3b54a495ee6e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-14T07:02:05Z","email":"ricardobarcar@gmail.com","name":"PanoramicRum"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-14T07:02:05Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(authz-middleware): new Fastify preHandler factory package — foundation for #4 (#102)\n\nAdds @urule/authz-middleware — a small Fastify plugin + two preHandler factories\nroute handlers can use to gate on OpenFGA workspace membership / role:\n\n- `authzMiddleware` plugin — decorates `request.authz` with an `AuthzClient`\n  (caller passes in either `createAuthzClient(...)` or\n  `createMockAuthzClient()` for tests).\n- `requireMembership(getWorkspaceId, opts?)` — calls\n  `request.authz.check(''user:<id>'', <relation>, ''<objectType>:<wsId>'')` and\n  403s on deny. 401 if no authenticated user, 404 if the resolver returns null\n  (resource-not-found). `relation` defaults to `member` (the inclusive\n  URULE_AUTH_MODEL relation: members ∪ admins ∪ owners ∪ parent-org members).\n- `requireRole(role)` — pure JWT realm-role gate (no OpenFGA hit); replaces\n  the inline `roles.includes(''admin'')` checks the registry routes were doing\n  for cross-workspace endpoints (PRs #93, #96).\n\nNo service consumes this yet — landing the foundation in isolation so the\nservice-by-service rollout PRs (Tier 2 #4 phase B+) are pure wire-ups. The\nmock client from `@urule/authz/testing` keeps each route''s tests cheap (seed\ntuples, inject, assert) without a live OpenFGA instance. 13 unit tests cover\nallow/deny/anon/not-found/custom-relation/async-resolver paths.\n\nVerified: `typecheck:all` 20/20, `build:all` 15/15, full `turbo run test`\n15/15 packages, `npm audit --audit-level=critical` clean. No service-side\neffect.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0c66efab28dad1a99fcce7ca8ddfd4655c1ed277","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urule-ai/urule/git/trees/0c66efab28dad1a99fcce7ca8ddfd4655c1ed277"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urule-ai/urule/git/commits/95092d84373821def66fbb3b624c3b54a495ee6e","verification":{"payload":"tree 0c66efab28dad1a99fcce7ca8ddfd4655c1ed277\nparent a450913e653c884f386887dd809d7867b515ed79\nauthor PanoramicRum <ricardobarcar@gmail.com> 1778742125 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1778742125 -0600\n\nfeat(authz-middleware): new Fastify preHandler factory package — foundation for #4 (#102)\n\nAdds @urule/authz-middleware — a small Fastify plugin + two preHandler factories\nroute handlers can use to gate on OpenFGA workspace membership / role:\n\n- `authzMiddleware` plugin — decorates `request.authz` with an `AuthzClient`\n  (caller passes in either `createAuthzClient(...)` or\n  `createMockAuthzClient()` for tests).\n- `requireMembership(getWorkspaceId, opts?)` — calls\n  `request.authz.check(''user:<id>'', <relation>, ''<objectType>:<wsId>'')` and\n  403s on deny. 401 if no authenticated user, 404 if the resolver returns null\n  (resource-not-found). `relation` defaults to `member` (the inclusive\n  URULE_AUTH_MODEL relation: members ∪ admins ∪ owners ∪ parent-org members).\n- `requireRole(role)` — pure JWT realm-role gate (no OpenFGA hit); replaces\n  the inline `roles.includes(''admin'')` checks the registry routes were doing\n  for cross-workspace endpoints (PRs #93, #96).\n\nNo service consumes this yet — landing the foundation in isolation so the\nservice-by-service rollout PRs (Tier 2 #4 phase B+) are pure wire-ups. The\nmock client from `@urule/authz/testing` keeps each route''s tests cheap (seed\ntuples, inject, assert) without a live OpenFGA instance. 13 unit tests cover\nallow/deny/anon/not-found/custom-relation/async-resolver paths.\n\nVerified: `typecheck:all` 20/20, `build:all` 15/15, full `turbo run test`\n15/15 packages, `npm audit --audit-level=critical` clean. No service-side\neffect.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqBXNtCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAghgQAFf2/CFJVJ03Tu7GJM43ixae\nGuzcFDPcxvXKq2XxlYiNBLbi4c2Da9a57/8zAW1Ru5Pj4CJCJZzLr5tK6JE1hVGF\nYe1CiVTiLF5QI6Zchg+jC1VEBb8wxVxf+rPchO1MEu1qsd1pU4C27/wBQM3rVL6l\nWnLf8+SBGNV4KG4g8o1sCmLgX3krphunud98gi+n/sxMcMI2N/KDnplWr9HpVgWW\nMN8CY/ch+VnKeRHnL/SrzY0JNn4nJkzo4hxgcw+DHBTrU6Yw89IQVnExJ2qbpTFz\n/itmsgrL73mqmdaaMWSPK6GeH2Av/nWr6bku/tP0amGiFF7LGqAy0mmDsqoleaao\nnKlUt3xD6Qd/uL/7kk/2AlXrER4qb+DhmFGQXuJDRAI6exvJ2DxzUF7+2GW2HnrB\ndc7WwjxTQ4Adt4W2Ttpa7R/r17EAatOrOAKm4wfhheCEiCLy5CaIGzOE0fTXzYyO\n6Ro4F7DUsd9pUjtAe5Jloi4pu/aKbxbCfq1d2Fi/sF5i7hVRkVw3urWMo4k+rOTG\n2lzziSrtrSwjEgbegqtVusUuB5ZDcS4C90EXQQHSe/28p/jgh4JYBzMpJFZAgs2K\nHnKL6pQGIgDLpoZtWsADNLZ2NPG5CCeoXZsYa/Bg2JSdkjaJIbT8PUilpHbPX17q\nkW9vHuSQIf+xAlW8jfsU\n=vbbk\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-14T07:02:05Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubuserco