ut tweak\ncould break. Replace with a stable `data-testid=\"dashboard-stats\"`\nhook.\n\n- apps/office-ui/src/app/office/page.tsx:402 — add testid\n- apps/office-ui/e2e/dashboard.spec.ts:9 — switch from Tailwind class\n  scope to `page.getByTestId(''dashboard-stats'')`\n\nCloses #66.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"da4a30f68d605b01b5fb75222552568ce79380ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urule-ai/urule/git/trees/da4a30f68d605b01b5fb75222552568ce79380ad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urule-ai/urule/git/commits/9bacfbde6660c182f9e009db7bd5043a4b88c3d8","verification":{"payload":"tree da4a30f68d605b01b5fb75222552568ce79380ad\nparent c9cb2a03c43781fd071859d9ebda5b0cf37c4050\nauthor PanoramicRum <ricardobarcar@gmail.com> 1778477128 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1778477128 -0600\n\nchore(office-ui): swap dashboard stat-grid scope to data-testid (#76)\n\nSurfaced during PR #55''s review as a non-blocking follow-up: the\ndashboard.spec.ts stat-grid scope relied on Tailwind classnames\n(`div.grid.grid-cols-2.xl:grid-cols-4.gap-4`) that any layout tweak\ncould break. Replace with a stable `data-testid=\"dashboard-stats\"`\nhook.\n\n- apps/office-ui/src/app/office/page.tsx:402 — add testid\n- apps/office-ui/e2e/dashboard.spec.ts:9 — switch from Tailwind class\n  scope to `page.getByTestId(''dashboard-stats'')`\n\nCloses #66.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqAWhICRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA3GYQAIFKZzaY/CnItLOiirZRjmbh\nwF586YYzMJrj/ZfzSRuj1KGVd9kVNWH2SnBIv+JpWC6SWa6y7BMo8ndMBf7HOjeR\nBdf1R0XY1yD3O6+jEHRyhGAfLA2DqA5yCbjh6L5YFDXmMwTsERuA0f+gobFuOsdR\nbL2USKw4tbk0ystMHBMg0vGQG0bV6Rcx2kFLEOF9sMqxSr/rC/etbZYr+n35Qvib\n5XbiQ1sDl7ogb5PS3EudI58Y+glcD2MnNmib6KBeHTARCWWK/i5N6LRcgJWzDokC\n4o5JCFYQNTOblDGRq959b7QvA6Tzeg5CVN4nQiSbmGVifHKiNw7Y+BPPD7N1EdJ2\nwV1gZLNYSthOt6jkYTjTJVd7Z9h/r5rNLHiomTxsBrIqdJI9g1