"PanoramicRum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NTY0NTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urule-ai/urule/commits/deae3fd968cb16fd105469b5b6fce8418fd09bad/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-11T04:48:49Z","email":"ricardobarcar@gmail.com","name":"PanoramicRum"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-11T04:48:49Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"test: cross-service integration coverage fan-out (#70)\n\nFive new integration test files covering the highest-gap workspaces\nsurfaced by the 2026-05 test-coverage audit. All use the real\nbuildServer() with the type-provider + error handler from #67, so\nregressions in the route schemas would be caught here.\n\n- services/governance/tests/governance-routes.test.ts (+12 tests)\n  Decide endpoint, policy/evaluate, authz/check, authz/batch-check\n  with audit-event capture via console.log spy + setImmediate flush\n  for fire-and-forget event publishing.\n\n- services/packages/tests/entitlement-flow.test.ts (+8 tests, 334\n  lines). Free install short-circuits without an entitlement lookup;\n  paid with no entitlement returns 402 + paymentLink; paid with\n  entitlement succeeds; packagehub-unreachable gracefully degrades\n  (transient outages don''t block install); uninstall + concurrent\n  install dedup. packagehub stubbed via vi.stubGlobal(''fetch'', ...)\n  so no network.\n\n- services/registry/tests/unit/agent-crud.test.ts (+10 tests).\n  Agent creation, retrieval, listing with pagination, partial update,\n  delete with cascade behavior.\n\n- services/registry/tests/unit/conversation-crud.test.ts (+10 tests).\n  Conversation forking semantics, message append, branching off a\n  message, deletion behavior.\n\n- services/state/tests/collaboration-journey.test.ts (+12 tests).\n  Multi-user room + presence + task assignment + status update +\n  typing + lifecycle cleanup, exercising the full collaboration\n  surface end-to-end.\n\nWorkspace totals (in-repo only):\n- governance: 23 → 35 tests\n- packages: 56 → 64 tests\n- registry: 38 → 58 tests\n- state: 43 → 55 tests\n\nAll four services pass cleanly locally on this branch. The mock-DB\nchain pattern for Drizzle services (no Postgres needed) and the\nconsole.log audit-event capture are now established for future\nfan-out (the ROADMAP \"office-ui Vitest fan-out\" follow-up uses the\nsame pattern from the marketplace-api PR).\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"87cc6fa6d8d5b31a76f3e08c0f9b795b630d1752","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urule-ai/urule/git/trees/87cc6fa6d8d5b31a76f3e08c0f9b795b630d1752"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urule-ai/urule/git/commits/deae3fd968cb16fd105469b5b6fce8418fd09bad","verification":{"payload":"tree 87cc6fa6d8d5b31a76f3e08c0f9b795b630d1752\nparent 6de8c1184ed8bffcd3ef14175890fd7ad282dcb0\nauthor PanoramicRum <ricardobarcar@gmail.com> 1778474929 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1778474929 -0600\n\ntest: cross-service integration coverage fan-out (#70)\n\nFive new integration test files covering the highest-gap workspaces\nsurfaced by the 2026-05 test-coverage audit. All use the real\nbuildServer() with the type-provider + error handler from #67, so\nregressions in the route schemas would be caught here.\n\n- services/governance/tests/governance-routes.test.ts (+12 tests)\n  Decide endpoint, policy/evaluate, authz/check, authz/batch-check\n  with audit-event capture via console.log spy + setImmediate flush\n  for fire-and-forget event publishing.\n\n- services/packages/tests/entitlement-flow.test.ts (+8 tests, 334\n  lines). Free install short-circuits without an entitlement lookup;\n  paid with no entitlement returns 402 + paymentLink; paid with\n  entitlement succeeds; packagehub-unreachable gracefully degrades\n  (transient outages don''t block install); uninstall + concurrent\n  install dedup. packagehub stubbed via vi.stubGlobal(''fetch'', ...)\n  so no network.\n\n- services/registry/tests/unit/agent-crud.test.ts (+10 tests).\n  Agent creation, retrieval, listing with pagination, partial update,\n  delete with cascade behavior.\n\n- services/registry/tests/unit/conversation-crud.test.ts (+10 tests).\n  Conversation forking semantics, message append, branching off a\n  message, deletion behavior.\n\n- services/state/tests/collaboration-journey.test.ts (+12 tests).\n  Multi-user room + presence + task assignment + status update +\n  typing + lifecycle cleanup, exercising the full collaboration\n  surface end-to-end.\n\nWorkspace totals (in-repo only):\n- governance: 23 → 35 tests\n- packages: 56 → 64 tests\n- registry: 38 → 58 tests\n- state: 43 → 55 tests\n\nAll four services pass cleanly locally on this branch. The mock-DB\nchain pattern for Drizzle services (no Postgres needed) and the\nconsole.log audit-event capture are now established for future\nfan-out (the ROADMAP \"office-ui Vitest fan-out\" follow-up uses the\nsame pattern from the marketplace-api PR).\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqAV+xCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAkFQQADVLZ714SSBw/CtASUbxxAXn\nPf5B09yUZmWaD2dvx39noPq3c3hg5aZMFLethicMYW1jkQ0GrTeE5aIfvD82brdT\nUER551id2o+6J4NHGZFuNnU0KspjBxczEb4SnMBu5x7MP8FNTojSPrsQ2EyAqUiW\n65x9sSM9a32xUlHyZz5/LBx9qSgFCbCyEM8hnlxZaUssixdSkbVq12FzXDJUmkWk\nZ5xjHPHXYO8h6e7HactUPOXfNey8X/HvJiSrtQIdH0TYe3rB5WvBIF51pgmFpDJg\n6t4bSN3sm9DPt7uubTAdL7siu3iSJiK5hNYTiOpLuhbZdr+XVTeNmISWC6Cq