nbe filed under [Quality][Severity] prefix to mirror [Security][Severity].\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3382199e9a96f7d59bac49e65893844f7a8a1d86","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urule-ai/urule/git/trees/3382199e9a96f7d59bac49e65893844f7a8a1d86"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urule-ai/urule/git/commits/0b165c675ca68232a052b038726c04e09fcbed2c","verification":{"payload":"tree 3382199e9a96f7d59bac49e65893844f7a8a1d86\nparent c29461f3a16a06dc9d2446855ce218c66abfcef7\nauthor PanoramicRum <ricardobarcar@gmail.com> 1778329958 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1778329958 -0500\n\ndocs(audits): add 2026-05-08 external code-quality audit (#21)\n\nExternal code-quality audit covering services/, packages/, apps/office-ui,\ninfra/, and CI. 36 findings (7 H / 13 M / 12 L / 4 I). 3 directly duplicate\nalready-filed issues from the parallel security audit and are cross-referenced\nrather than re-filed.\n\nCompanion to the security audit tracking issue #20. Per-finding issues will\nbe filed under [Quality][Severity] prefix to mirror [Security][Severity].\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp/ylmCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAxfYQACNw5VguWOvwx/3HJbgzB5kB\nh8KMvx7K5Dw+F6VLPr5o05btpHzWohNWcXfAfgWUkRn9ZV3vsu1n9+OZdwvWCMx1\nJjJOoksn0xecfOlkrZ48z0y57MiEUk84ifa1z2NZQ7ECt8AnYnsBwWfNA49d18Gz\nA6ZLu7yoS2RssVYLSX1sYc0cCN1YsRIJYMFi0IgZbVvMkGQCWCAu9BGTLzE6pimG\nDdRVZW/nP/r0xJqLCpeU6AfYTMHP2Wo7vKhg7NWAudmZIrcZ8Po1d/7Y0+sP2Cpg\nNHbV0Hw0UUicpYTQaWhzASKAzkDxSIFWBEhbZNBgGjfrvry8o521Y46CUGxrbCGR\n8yIqVhDp4FOV5IPcQLmJCakz8NofAxAAbRI7oSR+ywV+Pyl4uV9FnDhGQpkaWz+x\n86/7m4xmIIY8XM6HtaJEXtZ9BOCUe+b8kBn9vbmrSBYR/r8Q1chP4qKm8KMpDtmj\nTCnG8sb5NgJGRQR+AQm7budWwkmndc7jpsD6mQFoGhJoIhnaCZWYMkNlVB6mWg55\noCi6mikArKcnQBFWkcdjXI2FZhs3tzJRuQJ+ogtgH3iozpqd14ceg3xeqS9YPrFW\nCVpmwkr4w5NiTwm99RM9F9DY1RiDw0fZW8eqPstAS9zHmCPVLlkWMhA6RdNGmG2y\nJw+g