mits/c29461f3a16a06dc9d2446855ce218c66abfcef7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6556452?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PanoramicRum","id":6556452,"login":"PanoramicRum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NTY0NTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urule-ai/urule/commits/239979641d011134cbe902bdf551d6f88d869cea/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-07T04:51:52Z","email":"richy@nimiq.com","name":"Richy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-07T04:51:52Z","email":"richy@nimiq.com","name":"Richy"},"message":"feat(registry): per-route OpenAPI annotations across all 60 routes\n\nContinues the §5 JSDoc/schema fan-out. Adds Fastify\n`schema: { tags, summary, description }` to every route across\nthe 10 registry route files:\n\n- auth.routes (2)            - workspaces.routes (8)\n- orgs.routes (3)            - conversations.routes (8)\n- runtimes.routes (3)        - agents.routes (13)\n- providers.routes (6)       - integrations.routes (13)\n- logs.routes (3)            - stats.routes (1)\n\n10 tag groups in the global swagger config (auth / orgs / workspaces\n/ agents / runtimes / providers / conversations / integrations /\nlogs / stats), each with a one-line section description.\n\nVerified via /docs/json: 60/62 routes carry a summary + description\n(only /healthz and one ops route are bare, by design).\n\nTotal in-repo annotated routes now 113 across 5 services\n(packagehub 19, packages 7, governance 4, state 23, registry 60).\n\nAll 38 registry tests still pass; typecheck + build clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"682fad56b3f3eee546de5032bc22c54a7f2ddbec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urule-ai/urule/git/trees/682fad56b3f3eee546de5032bc22c54a7f2ddbec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urule-ai/urule/git/commits/239979641d011134cbe902bdf551d6f88d869cea","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6556452?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PanoramicRum","id":6556452,"login":"PanoramicRum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NTY0NTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/urule-ai/urule/commit/239979641d011134cbe902bdf551d6f88d869cea","node_id":"C_kwDORxyz5NoAKDIzOTk3OTY0MWQwMTExMzRjYmU5MDJiZGY1NTFkNmY4OGQ4NjljZWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/urule-ai/urule/commit/f2cb9f0501afd5f1e6f5265b40dfe7e968923aff","sha":"f2cb9f0501afd5f1e6f5265b40dfe7e968923aff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urule-ai/urule/commits/f2cb9f0501afd5f1e6f5265b40dfe7e968923aff"}],"sha":"239979641d011134cbe902bdf551d6f88d869cea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urule-ai/urule/commits/239979641d011134cbe902bdf551d6f88d869cea"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6556452?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PanoramicRum","id":6556452,"login":"PanoramicRum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NTY0NTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urule-ai/urule/commits/f2cb9f0501afd5f1e6f5265b40dfe7e968923aff/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-07T04:17:26Z","email":"richy@nimiq.com","name":"Richy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-07T04:17:26Z","email":"richy@nimiq.com","name":"Richy"},"message":"feat: route-level OpenAPI annotations for packages / governance / state\n\nContinues the §5 JSDoc/schema fan-out. Adds Fastify\n`schema: { tags, summary, description }` to every public route in\nthree more services:\n\n- packages (7 routes, 2 tag groups: packages / installations)\n- governance (4 routes, 3 tag groups: governance / policy / authz)\n- state (23 routes, 5 tag groups: rooms / presence / tasks /\n  widgets / typing)\n\nTotal 34 newly-annotated routes, on top of packagehub''s 19 from the\npilot — 53 routes overall now have rich swagger-ui documentation.\nDescriptions cover error codes, idempotency rules, auth shape, and\ninter-route relationships rather than restating what the URL says.\n\nVerified end-to-end via /docs/json for each service: global tag\narrays + per-route summary/description all surface correctly.\n\nRemaining: registry (60 routes — its own iteration) and the\nstandalone-repo services (channel-router, mcp-gateway, runtime-\nbroker, langgraph-adapter, approvals — separate PRs in their\nrepos).\n\nAll test suites still pass. Typecheck clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7700bbc6dccfffd4c967864264dad1ce9f8e7489","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urule-ai/urule/git/trees/7700bbc6dccfffd4c967864264dad1ce9f8e7489"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urule-ai/urule/git/commits/f2cb9f0501afd5f1e6f5265b40dfe7e968923aff","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6556452?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PanoramicRum","id":6556452,"login":"PanoramicRum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NTY0NTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/urule-ai/urule/commit/f2cb9f0501afd5f1e6f5265b40dfe7e968923aff","node_id":"C_kwDORxyz5NoAKGYyY2I5ZjA1MDFhZmQ1ZjFlNmY1MjY1YjQwZGZlN2U5Njg5MjNhZmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/urule-ai/urule/commit/f714248488153707b22dd57a588645ccc1f99da0","sha":"f714248488153707b22dd57a588645ccc1f99da0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urule-ai/urule/commits/f714248488153707b22dd57a588645ccc1f99da0"}],"sha":"f2cb9f0501afd5f1e6f5265b40dfe7e968923aff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urule-ai/urule/commits/f2cb9f0501afd5f1e6f5265b40dfe7e968923aff"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6556452?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PanoramicRum","id":6556452,"login":"PanoramicRum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NTY0NTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urule-ai/urule/commits/f714248488153707b22dd57a588645ccc1f99da0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-07T02:30:24Z","email":"richy@nimiq.com","name":"Richy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-07T02:30:24Z","email":"richy@nimiq.com","name":"Richy"},"message":"feat(packagehub): per-route schema annotations for OpenAPI docs\n\nPilot for the §5 route-level JSDoc/schema box. Every one of the 19\npublic routes in packagehub now carries a Fastify\n`schema: { tags, summary, description }` field. Swagger-ui at /docs\n(and the underlying /docs/json) surfaces 7 tag groups — packages,\nversions, pubkeys, entitlements, reviews, dependencies, webhooks —\neach with a one-line description, and every route gains a summary +\noperationally-useful description (error codes, idempotency rules,\nauth shape, the relationship to other endpoints).\n\nMetadata-only on purpose: kept manual `safeParse()` validation in\neach handler instead of converting body/response to JSON Schema via\nfastify-type-provider-zod. That conversion is a real refactor of the\nvalidation flow and the right scope for its own follow-up — today''s\nchange is pure docs and risk-free per route.\n\nPattern is now ready to copy across the other 10 services.\n\n83 packagehub tests still pass; typecheck + build clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2fb57203896d0aa512143ba066bd0559a6fa683f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urule-ai/urule/git/trees/2fb57203896d0aa512143ba066bd0559a6fa683f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urule-ai/urule/git/commits/f714248488153707b22dd57a588645ccc1f99da0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6556452?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PanoramicRum","id":6556452,"login":"PanoramicRum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NTY0NTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/urule-ai/urule/commit/f714248488153707b22dd57a588645ccc1f99da0","node_id":"C_kwDORxyz5NoAKGY3MTQyNDg0ODgxNTM3MDdiMjJkZDU3YTU4ODY0NWNjYzFmOTlkYTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/urule-ai/urule/commit/9b17febc9dcd3fc27507ca1c2da060b4b8a49394","sha":"9b17febc9dcd3fc27507ca1c2da060b4b8a49394","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urule-ai/urule/commits/9b17febc9dcd3fc27507ca1c2da060b4b8a49394"}],"sha":"f714248488153707b22dd57a588645ccc1f99da0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urule-ai/urule/commits/f714248488153707b22dd57a588645ccc1f99da0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6556452?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PanoramicRum","id":6556452,"login":"PanoramicRum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NTY0NTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urule-ai/urule/commits/9b17febc9dcd3fc27507ca1c2da060b4b8a49394/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-06T13:21:30Z","email":"richy@nimiq.com","name":"Richy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-06T13:21:30Z","email":"richy@nimiq.com","name":"Richy"},"message":"feat(llm-providers): shared LLM streaming abstraction\n\nNew @urule/llm-providers package adds a provider-agnostic streaming\nchat surface. First two impls ship: AnthropicProvider (wraps the\nofficial @anthropic-ai/sdk streaming API; groups consecutive tool\nresults onto a single user message per Anthropic''s protocol) and\nOpenAIProvider (wraps the openai SDK; reassembles tool-call argument\ndeltas — OpenAI streams JSON args incrementally, Anthropic only\ndelivers tool_use blocks on the final message).\n\ncreateProviderRegistry returns a get/list lookup; later registrations\noverride earlier ones with the same name so deployments can swap\nin mocks for tests without forking.\n\nThe package is the foundation for the §6.2 multi-provider story\nacross every orchestrator adapter — langgraph today, CrewAI /\nAutoGen / ADK tomorrow. Adding Gemini or a local Ollama provider\nbecomes a one-file change here, consumed by every adapter.\n\nTypes:\n- LlmProvider, LlmProviderRegistry\n- LlmStreamParams (apiKey, model, systemPrompt, messages, tools,\n  maxTokens, temperature, baseUrl)\n- LlmMessage (user / assistant w/ optional toolCalls / tool)\n- LlmToolDefinition (name, description, JSON-Schema inputSchema)\n- LlmToolCall (id, name, input)\n- LlmEvent (text_delta | tool_call | message_complete | error)\n\n16 new tests: registry roundtrip, lookup misses, override semantics;\nboth providers exercise message mapping, tool-definition mapping,\ntext streaming, tool-call assembly, malformed-JSON tool-arg fallback,\nerror path.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a47106cc85dbd07181ab81bc6f0f50ca342c9985","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urule-ai/urule/git/trees/a47106cc85dbd07181ab81bc6f0f50ca342c9985"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urule-ai/urule/git/commits/9b17febc9dcd3fc27507ca1c2da060b4b8a49394","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6556452?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PanoramicRum","id":6556452,"login":"PanoramicRum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NTY0NTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/urule-ai/urule/commit/9b17febc9dcd3fc27507ca1c2da060b4b8a49394","node_id":"C_kwDORxyz5NoAKDliMTdmZWJjOWRjZDNmYzI3NTA3Y2ExYzJkYTA2MGI0YjhhNDkzOTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/urule-ai/urule/commit/d7b3d05a05b5a16c8af56873cb38152ff523abec","sha":"d7b3d05a05b5a16c8af56873cb38152ff523abec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urule-ai/urule/commits/d7b3d05a05b5a16c8af56873cb38152ff523abec"}],"sha":"9b17febc9dcd3fc27507ca1c2da060b4b8a49394","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urule-ai/urule/commits/9b17febc9dcd3fc27507ca1c2da060b4b8a49394"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6556452?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PanoramicRum","id":6556452,"login":"PanoramicRum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NTY0NTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urule-ai/urule/commits/d7b3d05a05b5a16c8af56873cb38152ff523abec/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-06T06:00:05Z","email":"richy@nimiq.com","name":"Richy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-06T06:00:05Z","email":"richy@nimiq.com","name":"Richy"},"message":"feat: Turborepo for incremental builds + caching\n\nCloses the §5 Turborepo box. New turbo.json defines a 6-task pipeline\n(build, test, typecheck, lint, dev, clean) wired across all 13\nworkspaces.\n\nPipeline shape:\n- build cascades via dependsOn: [''^build''] so consumers get sibling\n  dist/ first. Caches dist/** + .next/** (excluding .next/cache).\n- typecheck cascades the same way (.d.ts must exist for sibling\n  imports to resolve). No outputs.\n- test + lint run flat — vitest reads source, ESLint reads source +\n  per-package configs, neither needs sibling builds.\n- dev: cache: false, persistent: true.\n\nRoot scripts route through `turbo run`; :all aliases preserved for\nthe existing CI workflow.\n\nCold typecheck across 13 workspaces: 22s. Warm: 140ms (>>> FULL\nTURBO).\n\nSide fixes the introduction surfaced + unstuck:\n- office-ui build now uses `next build --no-lint`. ESLint runs in\n  the dedicated lint task — Next''s bundled lint at build time\n  duplicated work and broke build:all.\n- Missing `typecheck` script alias on office-ui (was `type-check`\n  only — npm run typecheck:all skipped it silently).\n- @hookform/resolvers 3.9 → 4.1.3 + zod 3.23 → 4.3: the rest of the\n  monorepo was already on zod v4, but office-ui''s local zod v3 was\n  shadowed by the root hoist, breaking its standalone typecheck.\n  Aligned to v4.\n- Removed the now-unnecessary `typescript.ignoreBuildErrors: true`\n  from next.config.mjs — the CI typecheck job was already the\n  source of truth, and now it actually catches real failures\n  instead of silent-swallowing.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0f0eda1653b273a95fe54c096a75a19813ac8df1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urule-ai/urule/git/trees/0f0eda1653b273a95fe54c096a75a19813ac8df1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urule-ai/urule/git/commits/d7b3d05a05b5a16c8af56873cb38152ff523abec","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6556452?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PanoramicRum","id":6556452,"login":"PanoramicRum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NTY0NTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://a