os/urule-ai/urule/commits/4233b8a1cf47d4feaed6e7ad46470b5056c60648/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-06T05:33:39Z","email":"richy@nimiq.com","name":"Richy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-06T05:33:39Z","email":"richy@nimiq.com","name":"Richy"},"message":"docs: §6.3 — flesh out Sigstore deferral with scope + rationale\n\nReplaces the one-line ROADMAP entry with a 4-step concrete plan\n(switch entry, stored identity format, signature wire shape, verifier\ndelegation to @sigstore/verify) and a Why-Deferred note: a half-\nworking stub is a soft security claim; the proper iteration pulls in\nthe upstream lib, configures the TUF mirror, parses cosign bundles,\nand integrates Fulcio root certs.\n\nThis documentation lands now (rather than in the eventual landing\ncommit) because today''s session evaluated the work and chose to ship\nelsewhere — capturing the conclusion is the right level of trace.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4f25a6c0678e19ad2a272c782853fa6edacca1b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urule-ai/urule/git/trees/4f25a6c0678e19ad2a272c782853fa6edacca1b9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urule-ai/urule/git/commits/4233b8a1cf47d4feaed6e7ad46470b5056c60648","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6556452?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PanoramicRum","id":6556452,"login":"PanoramicRum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NTY0NTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/urule-ai/urule/commit/4233b8a1cf47d4feaed6e7ad46470b5056c60648","node_id":"C_kwDORxyz5NoAKDQyMzNiOGExY2Y0N2Q0ZmVhZWQ2ZTdhZDQ2NDcwYjUwNTZjNjA2NDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/urule-ai/urule/commit/bf060890df557aa5c2c5519b156cd52937383df2","sha":"bf060890df557aa5c2c5519b156cd52937383df2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urule-ai/urule/commits/bf060890df557aa5c2c5519b156cd52937383df2"}],"sha":"4233b8a1cf47d4feaed6e7ad46470b5056c60648","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urule-ai/urule/commits/4233b8a1cf47d4feaed6e7ad46470b5056c60648"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6556452?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PanoramicRum","id":6556452,"login":"PanoramicRum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NTY0NTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urule-ai/urule/commits/bf060890df557aa5c2c5519b156cd52937383df2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-06T05:28:57Z","email":"richy@nimiq.com","name":"Richy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-06T05:28:57Z","email":"richy@nimiq.com","name":"Richy"},"message":"fix(events): export AuditActor type from public surface\n\nCloses the warning surfaced by the new TypeDoc baseline:\n> AuditActor, defined in audit-logger.ts, is referenced by\n> AuditLogger.accessDenied.actor but not included in the documentation\n\nThe type was an unexported interface in the same module as\nAuditLogger, which made every consumer of the logger end up with\na `Parameter ''actor'' implicitly has an ''any'' type` workaround\nor a duplicated definition. Hoisting it to the public index\nremoves that whole class of friction and lines up with how the\nother typed seams in @urule/events are exposed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bf7985f3482b2a2b57c8e4cd88afe518a8951e85","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urule-ai/urule/git/trees/bf7985f3482b2a2b57c8e4cd88afe518a8951e85"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urule-ai/urule/git/commits/bf060890df557aa5c2c5519b156cd52937383df2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6556452?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PanoramicRum","id":6556452,"login":"PanoramicRum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NTY0NTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/urule-ai/urule/commit/bf060890df557aa5c2c5519b156cd52937383df2","node_id":"C_kwDORxyz5NoAKGJmMDYwODkwZGY1NTdhYTVjMmM1NTE5YjE1NmNkNTI5MzczODNkZjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/urule-ai/urule/commit/a8d729e2fbb516f0d95883fdbeb48afc2377dc42","sha":"a8d729e2fbb516f0d95883fdbeb48afc2377dc42","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urule-ai/urule/commits/a8d729e2fbb516f0d95883fdbeb48afc2377dc42"}],"sha":"bf060890df557aa5c2c5519b156cd52937383df2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urule-ai/urule/commits/bf060890df557aa5c2c5519b156cd52937383df2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6556452?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PanoramicRum","id":6556452,"login":"PanoramicRum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1NTY0NTI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urule-ai/urule/commits/a8d729e2fbb516f0d95883fdbeb48afc2377dc42/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-06T05:19:40Z","email":"richy@nimiq.com","name":"Richy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-06T05:19:40Z","email":"richy@nimiq.com","name":"Richy"},"message":"feat: TypeDoc auto-generated API documentation\n\nCloses the Libraries → TypeDoc box. Root typedoc.json runs an\nentryPointStrategy=''packages'' build across the six published libs\n(auth-middleware, authz, correlation-id, events, observability, spec);\nper-package typedoc.json shims point each at src/index.ts so the\ngenerator reads source, not dist/.\n\nNew scripts at the workspace root:\n- npm run docs:api          — one-shot build → docs/api/\n- npm run docs:api:watch    — incremental rebuild during doc work\n\nOutput is gitignored; CI reproduces deterministically. New\ndocs/API.md is the human-facing entry point: generate, add a\npackage, hosting notes, troubleshooting.\n\nThe 0-error baseline keeps the build cheap; surfaced warnings flag\ngenuine leaks (AuditActor referenced from AuditLogger.accessDenied.\nactor but not exported from @urule/events — follow-up export-type\nadd).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"94d1b8650cb655d3c815370661f49f230728d89a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urule-ai/urule/git/trees/94d1b8650cb655d3c815370661f49f230728d89a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/urule-ai/urule/git/commits/a8d729e2fbb516f0d95883fdbeb48afc2377dc42","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6556452?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PanoramicRum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Pano