4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hexplus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hexplus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hexplus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hexplus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hexplus","id":3751819,"login":"hexplus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NTE4MTk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hexplus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hexplus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hexplus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hexplus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hexplus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hexplus","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hexplus/sibujs/commits/f8813d9b80dcf921f01f0a7cc5a9daf9d3ca03d2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-09T15:26:50Z","email":"jframonge@gmail.com","name":"Jose Ramírez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-09T15:26:50Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Bugfix/several bugs (#18)\n\n* Updated CHANGELOG and package.json\n\n* ci: use npm install instead of npm ci\n\n* trusted-publisher\n\n* fix: reconciler cached element corruption, boolean attr handling, lint disable comments (v1.2.0)\n\n- Fix bindChildNode identity-aware reconciliation: reused nodes are no longer\n  removed and re-inserted, preventing DOM corruption when reactive nodes\n  functions return the same HTMLElement instance across re-evaluations\n- Fix tagFactory boolean attribute handling: false now calls removeAttribute()\n  instead of being silently skipped; IDL properties (checked, disabled,\n  selected) set as DOM properties directly, matching bindAttribute behavior\n- Add inline disable comments for no-direct-dom-mutation lint rule:\n  // sibujs-disable-next-line and // sibujs-disable on same line\n- Bump version to 1.2.0\n\n* Linter fixes","tree":{"sha":"389beed1f5dab8effa95f4ea1093ca6a2b60fc1c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hexplus/sibujs/git/trees/389beed1f5dab8effa95f4ea1093ca6a2b60fc1c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hexplus/sibujs/git/commits/f8813d9b80dcf921f01f0a7cc5a9daf9d3ca03d2","verification":{"payload":"tree 389beed1f5dab8effa95f4ea1093ca6a2b60fc1c\nparent f94b1ffc10eaef56a429abd87f869371da4bd086\nauthor Jose Ramírez <jframonge@gmail.com> 1775748410 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1775748410 -0600\n\nBugfix/several bugs (#18)\n\n* Updated CHANGELOG and package.json\n\n* ci: use npm install instead of npm ci\n\n* trusted-publisher\n\n* fix: reconciler cached element corruption, boolean attr handling, lint disable comments (v1.2.0)\n\n- Fix bindChildNode identity-aware reconciliation: reused nodes are no longer\n  removed and re-inserted, preventing DOM corruption when reactive nodes\n  functions return the same HTMLElement instance across re-evaluations\n- Fix tagFactory boolean attribute handling: false now calls removeAttribute()\n  instead of being silently skipped; IDL properties (checked, disabled,\n  selected) set as DOM properties directly, matching bindAttribute behavior\n- Add inline disable comments for no-direct-dom-mutation lint rule:\n  // sibujs-disable-next-line and // sibujs-disable on same line\n- Bump version to 1.2.0\n\n* Linter fixes","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp18U6CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAuDEQAF/LRU/5AitJbOk73FAZ2I2x\nRSUoZkw3vgVIP2Nh3sDFix5hbbKbX4fzt5MBscn5Ln9WsYu1foaTvHYQMFIPnUyH\nHoaZKxpUVnFOz1EpJc3KQ6fynoo+sjFDAFnb0l7VwljiYxRF87Fw5uZ+8uF5M3mE\nWlhtU9xA82u34gNKLS54jExMkehDiU71bhXv5gvDQ5kPiug4OdHbnNiJLGJoLrlG\nD4OqmpuPcXxaQi2KBGq+F2z2vQmsVAxsLNz5TJI9WC0fuAyKVp9+EK3aFdOpmzor\nk1HYPVD21rp40yypoGrSr+HbEpxa8EJcPgKcoBtsB2cbpEyVA8xvreqPQSkN/ZVF\n5s1FddxMZ/xZi0P4+wUdxJCbTx2SbP5/RNsG75E/k8aXUenPtFF1oueGoVoUJRoL\nIEpFE6RLRB0LW7ErJdgIZycs8Lp7st1gL