us/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hexplus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hexplus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hexplus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hexplus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hexplus","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hexplus/sibujs/commits/4081144b847506b8a0fc7eb444ce2bd0464f5caa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-28T21:07:47Z","email":"jframonge@gmail.com","name":"José Ramírez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-28T21:07:47Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"1.0.3 (#2)\n\n* - Widen node types, add onCleanup, query select, and formatNumber\n- Widen NodeChild to include boolean and NodeChildren to accept nested\n  arrays and full reactive functions, eliminating most  casts\n- Filter boolean values in appendChildren and bindChildNode so that\n   patterns work seamlessly\n- Add onCleanup(callback, element) lifecycle hook that integrates with\n  dispose() for resource cleanup when when()/match()/each() swap content\n- Add select option to query() for transforming fetched data before\n  returning to consumers while keeping raw data in cache\n- Add formatNumber() and formatCurrency() utilities in sibujs/browser\n- Fix unused variable lint warning in router.basic.test.ts\n\n* Fix boolean filtering in fragment.ts and htm.ts, remove unnecessary as any casts in tests\n\n- Filter booleans in Fragment() loop and resolveChild to prevent\n  rendering false/true as visible text nodes\n- Filter booleans in htm.ts executeElement and multi-root paths\n  (4 locations) for consistency with tagFactory and bindChildNode\n- Remove as any casts from tagFactory boolean tests since the\n  widened NodeChild type now accepts booleans directly\n- Fix misleading test comment in query select test","tree":{"sha":"29c7c1ad9d0b848588e939cf2e7f7ea7a073cd8f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hexplus/sibujs/git/trees/29c7c1ad9d0b848588e939cf2e7f7ea7a073cd8f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hexplus/sibujs/git/commits/4081144b847506b8a0fc7eb444ce2bd0464f5caa","verification":{"payload":"tree 29c7c1ad9d0b848588e939cf2e7f7ea7a073cd8f\nparent 731fcc1a9cd341f96d3e7ff5f091047e6ad7280a\nauthor José Ramírez <jframonge@gmail.com> 1774732067 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1774732067 -0600\n\n1.0.3 (#2)\n\n* - Widen node types, add onCleanup, query select, and formatNumber\n- Widen NodeChild to include boolean and NodeChildren to accept nested\n  arrays and full reactive functions, eliminating most  casts\n- Filter boolean values in appendChildren and bindChildNode so that\n   patterns work seamlessly\n- Add onCleanup(callback, element) lifecycle hook that integrates with\n  dispose() for resource cleanup when when()/match()/each() swap content\n- Add select option to query() for transforming fetched data before\n  returning to consumers while keeping raw data in cache\n- Add formatNumber() and formatCurrency() utilities in sibujs/browser\n- Fix unused variable lint warning in router.basic.test.ts\n\n* Fix boolean filtering in fragment.ts and htm.ts, remove unnecessary as any casts in tests\n\n- Filter booleans in Fragment() loop and resolveChild to prevent\n  rendering false/true as visible text nodes\n- Filter booleans in htm.ts executeElement and multi-root paths\n  (4 locations) for consistency with tagFactory and bindChildNode\n- Remove as any casts from tagFactory boolean tests since the\n  widened NodeChild type now accepts booleans directly\n- Fix misleading test comment in query select test","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpyEMjCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA49YQADi5CPqNhL+3d9DGzeUOJyay\nQAVnnchPD2L8R6Fd2qq/mRiN1J/aJCsn5IW3nK2k2bxKMR5QadLY+n9hcvps0Eup\nHqaCHynPH9wXJLhrGewhAyH1/BoEaAThXw93AFX1r7NHWgoy3s8X32zJIQ7UV0eC\nmDqu4e0uQpRRODL7rGi05OA61MgFgD5