{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shadownrx/windows/commits/d1f049cfca762430e515a797cd482b372fa60d71/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T13:10:10Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T13:10:10Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Bring Nex Assistant to the mobile PWA shell\n\nDesktop.tsx returns MobileShell before ever reaching the taskbar/\nNexAssistantPanel branch, so on phones the assistant simply didn''t\nexist. Wired it into MobileShell instead:\n\n- NexAssistantPanel now renders as a bottom sheet on phone (useIsPhone),\n  sliding up from the bottom with a drag handle and tap-outside backdrop,\n  instead of the 400px desktop side drawer.\n- Entry point: a gradient banner in the pull-down control center\n  (MobileShade) — reachable from the home screen or from inside any app.\n- Wired into the Android/PWA back-gesture (goBack) and the intercepting\n  history-state logic so hardware/gesture back closes it like any other\n  mobile overlay.","tree":{"sha":"6c2a5028adf227a4c1c8a9b60d15d3dd5bc785d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shadownrx/windows/git/trees/6c2a5028adf227a4c1c8a9b60d15d3dd5bc785d6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shadownrx/windows/git/commits/d1f049cfca762430e515a797cd482b372fa60d71","verification":{"payload":"tree 6c2a5028adf227a4c1c8a9b60d15d3dd5bc785d6\nparent 29ab69457fc05a2abce3ea9b988c79218e1341db\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1787663410 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1787663410 +0000\n\nBring Nex Assistant to the mobile PWA shell\n\nDesktop.tsx returns MobileShell before ever reaching the taskbar/\nNexAssistantPanel branch, so on phones the assistant simply didn''t\nexist. Wired it into MobileShell instead:\n\n- NexAssistantPanel now renders as a bottom sheet on phone (useIsPhone),\n  sliding up from the bottom with a drag handle and tap-outside backdrop,\n  instead of the 400px desktop side drawer.\n- Entry point: a gradient banner in the pull-down control center\n  (MobileShade) — reachable from the home screen or from inside any app.\n- Wired into the Android/PWA back-gesture (goBack) and the intercepting\n  history-state logic so hardware/gesture back closes it like any other\n  mobile overlay.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQOR8hatO\n4MqeopvgcCOojjo+BSoyt08i4dGCprrLc93dCGtpaiSlJhjjpTcm9cYtcCqNzrvilHll3tvDgL7R\n/wU=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-25T13:10:16Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs