 해소 — GOJIRA_* → bare 결정적 매핑 (v0.1.33)\n\nlauncher 는 GOJIRA_USER/GOJIRA_REPO_ROOT 로 주입하는데 스킬은 bare ${USER}/${CODE}/\n${PROJECT_ROOT}(468곳)로 참조 → 그 다리를 LLM(gojira.md export)에 맡겨 누락/오판\n여지가 있었다. 특히 CODE 는 env 주입 자체가 없어 \"메시지 추출\" 에 의존(오판 위험).\n\n- spawn.go: GOJIRA_CODE 주입(누락 해소, GOJIRA_ 접두사 유지) + BASH_ENV=_bootstrap.sh —\n  모든 bash 호출이 시작 시 자동 source 하도록 지정.\n- _scripts/_bootstrap.sh 신설: GOJIRA_* → CODE/USER/PROJECT_ROOT 결정적 매핑\n  (CODE 없으면 basename fallback). stdout 무출력(매 bash 전 source 되므로 명령 출력 오염 방지).\n- gojira.md 입력 파싱: 자동 매핑 전제로 단순화 — 메시지추출 우선순위 제거, export 는 안전망으로.\n- const version 0.1.32 → 0.1.33.\n\n효과: GOJIRA_* 단일 진실 유지(bare USER 전역 오염 없음), bare 이름은 매 bash 자동 파생,\n스킬 468곳 무변경.\n\n실측: BASH_ENV honor(bash -c) + 매핑값 정확(CODE/USER/ROOT) + stdout 무오염 + 배포이미지\n임베드·추출 확인 + 크로스컴파일(win/darwin) + v0.1.33 서빙.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Kj3Xj6jqdyFQXbY6L9SB5Q","tree":{"sha":"d319daaecd1f0fd744286b5635a12594dee7c6ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/git/trees/d319daaecd1f0fd744286b5635a12594dee7c6ac"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/git/commits/fb14f237ce7bf9efcb792bac603c19cd7eab74e7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/222582245?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dkdoc7","id":222582245,"login":"dkdoc7","node_id":"U_kgDODURV5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commit/fb14f237ce7bf9efcb792bac603c19cd7eab74e7","node_id":"C_kwDORyCU2NoAKGZiMTRmMjM3Y2U3YmY5ZWZjYjc5MmJhYzYwM2MxOWNkN2VhYjc0ZTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commit/b8840308e22cdf22a0b8f583c06f27472cac66e5","sha":"b8840308e22cdf22a0b8f583c06f27472cac66e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commits/b8840308e22cdf22a0b8f583c06f27472cac66e5"}],"sha":"fb14f237ce7bf9efcb792bac603c19cd7eab74e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commits/fb14f237ce7bf9efcb792bac603c19cd7eab74e7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/222582245?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dkdoc7","id":222582245,"login":"dkdoc7","node_id":"U_kgDODURV5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commits/b8840308e22cdf22a0b8f583c06f27472cac66e5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T01:04:29Z","email":"duke.kimm7@gmail.com","name":"Duke Kimm"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T01:04:29Z","email":"duke.kimm7@gmail.com","name":"Duke Kimm"},"message":"feat(archive): 프로젝트 삭제 시 로컬 clone 정리 — launcher /remove-clone (v0.1.32)\n\n서버측 archive(Gitea repo + Mongo)만 정리되고 사용자 PC 의 launcher clone\n(RepoRoot/{code})은 서버가 닿을 수 없어 남아 있었다. launcher 에 삭제 핸들러가\n없던 설계 누락.\n\n- gojira-launcher: POST /remove-clone → RemoveAll(RepoRoot/{code}). code 경로\n  가드(../,구분자 차단), 멱등(이미 없으면 removed:false 성공), secure(token).\n  const version 0.1.31 → 0.1.32.\n- web-ui launcher.js: requestRemoveClone 클라이언트 추가.\n- GoJIRA-App ProjectMap: 삭제(archive) 성공 후 launcher 로 clone 삭제 호출.\n  UI 시작 원칙 준수. best-effort — launcher 오프라인/실패/이미삭제여도 전체 삭제는\n  중단하지 않고 상태만 보고(수동 조치분 있어도 끝까지 정리 원칙).\n  삭제 확인 문구도 서버 백업 + 로컬 클론 정리로 갱신.\n\n검증: 로컬 런처 구동 실측 — 정상삭제/멱등/경로가드(400)/무토큰(401) 4케이스 통과.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Kj3Xj6jqdyFQXbY6L9SB5Q","tree":{"sha":"a5cce9c55c5a681f9d6ff49d9311bf7514d1fe96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/git/trees/a5cce9c55c5a681f9d6ff49d9311bf7514d1fe96"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/git/commits/b8840308e22cdf22a0b8f583c06f27472cac66e5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/222582245?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dkdoc7","id":222582245,"login":"dkdoc7","node_id":"U_kgDODURV5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/repos","