-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commit/27062e512c5d345e8a071c64d9e556727f40e214","node_id":"C_kwDORyCU2NoAKDI3MDYyZTUxMmM1ZDM0NWU4YTA3MWM2NGQ5ZTU1NjcyN2Y0MGUyMTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commit/39617956d7ddd841c7868f8bd7d665a44af411f1","sha":"39617956d7ddd841c7868f8bd7d665a44af411f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commits/39617956d7ddd841c7868f8bd7d665a44af411f1"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commit/c019f3e198611d3354d789986252181fa02f629f","sha":"c019f3e198611d3354d789986252181fa02f629f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commits/c019f3e198611d3354d789986252181fa02f629f"}],"sha":"27062e512c5d345e8a071c64d9e556727f40e214","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commits/27062e512c5d345e8a071c64d9e556727f40e214"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commits/c019f3e198611d3354d789986252181fa02f629f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-11T05:53:40Z","email":"dukekimm@Duke-Kimm-Mac-mini.local","name":"Duke Kimm"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-11T05:53:40Z","email":"dukekimm@Duke-Kimm-Mac-mini.local","name":"Duke Kimm"},"message":"fix(GoJIRA-App): pex-core 로더 base 를 Vite BASE_URL 로 결정 — 편집 버튼 404 해결\n\nPlantUML 블록 편집 클릭 시 \"pex-core script 로드 실패: /pex-core/inline.js\"\n발생. CRA→Vite 6 이전(7/6) 후 pexLoader 의 __webpack_public_path__ 가 항상\n미정의라 same-origin 폴백으로 빠졌고, 게이트웨이 토폴로지에서 루트(/)는\nplatform-app 셸이라 /pex-core/* 가 404 였다.\n\nvite.config 의 base(''/gojira/'', 게이트웨이 프리픽스)가 import.meta.env.BASE_URL\n로 번들에 박히므로 이를 1순위로 사용. dev(3000→3001) 폴백과 same-origin\n폴백은 유지. pumlex vendor(public/pex-core/*)는 무수정.\n\n검증: 재빌드 후 번들에 /gojira/ base 인라인 확인, gateway 경유\n/gojira/pex-core/{geom,meta,inline}.js 3종 HTTP 200.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Kj3Xj6jqdyFQXbY6L9SB5Q","tree":{"sha":"705850812ee1bc9dce6829a4f54043204c781296","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/git/trees/705850812ee1bc9dce6829a4f54043204c781296"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/git/commits/c019f3e198611d3354d789986252181fa02f629f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commit/c019f3e198611d3354d789986252181fa02f629f","node_id":"C_kwDORyCU2NoAKGMwMTlmM2UxOTg2MTFkMzM1NGQ3ODk5ODYyNTIxODFmYTAyZjYyOWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commit/93203c86005482c2e0ce7d6e74c993b0ad2ce4be","sha":"93203c86005482c2e0ce7d6e74c993b0ad2ce4be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commits/93203c86005482c2e0ce7d6e74c993b0ad2ce4be"}],"sha":"c019f3e198611d3354d789986252181fa02f629f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commits/c019f3e198611d3354d789986252181fa02f629f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/222582245?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dkdoc7","id":222582245,"login":"dkdoc7","node_id":"U_kgDODURV5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/use