l":"dukekimm@Duke-Kimm-Mac-mini.local","name":"Duke Kimm"},"message":"chore(launcher): v0.1.31 — desc/description 스키마 가드 스킬 재추출\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Kj3Xj6jqdyFQXbY6L9SB5Q","tree":{"sha":"f894771b58b7de2d1e516cc79b6ed5c12c5fb7bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/git/trees/f894771b58b7de2d1e516cc79b6ed5c12c5fb7bd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/git/commits/6678efa288d8378af6ec1dfcc126674c8227efb6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commit/6678efa288d8378af6ec1dfcc126674c8227efb6","node_id":"C_kwDORyCU2NoAKDY2NzhlZmEyODhkODM3OGFmNmVjMWRmY2MxMjY2NzRjODIyN2VmYjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commit/0d8ea1240cf012e79ed8e57e52491392e1c2011b","sha":"0d8ea1240cf012e79ed8e57e52491392e1c2011b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commits/0d8ea1240cf012e79ed8e57e52491392e1c2011b"}],"sha":"6678efa288d8378af6ec1dfcc126674c8227efb6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commits/6678efa288d8378af6ec1dfcc126674c8227efb6"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commits/0d8ea1240cf012e79ed8e57e52491392e1c2011b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-11T03:04:15Z","email":"dukekimm@Duke-Kimm-Mac-mini.local","name":"Duke Kimm"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-11T03:07:31Z","email":"dukekimm@Duke-Kimm-Mac-mini.local","name":"Duke Kimm"},"message":"fix(skills): 이슈 생성 desc/description 스키마 혼용 사고 차단\n\n에이전트가 vos-collect 실행 중 초안 스키마의 description 필드를 배치 입력에\n그대로 가져와, batch 스크립트가 미지 필드로 무시 → 본문이 빈 이슈가 조용히\n생성되는 사고 발생. 원인은 스킬 설계의 스키마 3벌 혼용(초안 description /\n생성 입력 desc / PUT data description).\n\n- issue-batch-create.sh: 생성 시작 전 원자적 사전 검증 추가 —\n  배열 타입 확인, issueType/summary/desc 필수(하나라도 비면 아무것도 생성\n  하지 않고 중단), description-only 항목은 desc 로 자동 정규화 + stderr 경고\n- vos-collect: 초안 스키마 description → desc 통일(초안→배치 무변환 흐름),\n  자가검증 critical 에 필드명 위반 추가, PUT 비대칭(desc/description) 명시\n- requirement-refine: 초안 스키마는 validator 규약(description) 유지하되,\n  배치 JSON 손 타이핑 금지 — draft-io.sh load + jq 결정적 변환으로 교체\n  (description→desc 매핑 + NFR 추가필드 유지, mode=create 필터)\n\n실측: 검증 3케이스(누락/별칭+누락/비배열) fail-fast 정상, jq 변환식\n샘플 검증 통과.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Kj3Xj6jqdyFQXbY6L9SB5Q","tree":{"sha":"d7ec425a7b3551d9d94796d349a0a63afbdd6478","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/git/trees/d7ec425a7b3551d9d94796d349a0a63afbdd6478"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/git/commits/0d8ea1240cf012e79ed8e57e52491392e1c2011b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commit/0d8ea1240cf012e79ed8e57e52491392e1c2011b","node_id":"C_kwDORyCU2NoAKDBkOGVhMTI0MGNmMDEyZTc5ZWQ4ZTU3ZTUyNDkxMzkyZTFjMjAxMWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commit/902738961db3ee0331ba20b9b35048b92dafe199","sha":"902738961db3ee0331ba20b9b35048b92dafe199","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commits/902738961db3ee0331ba20b9b35048b92dafe199"}],"sha":"0d8ea1240cf012e79ed8e57e52491392e1c2011b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commits/0d8ea1240cf012e79ed8e57e52491392e1c2011b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/222582245?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dkdoc7","id":222582245,"login":"dkdoc7"