RA/commit/1158edd5475da694d72c6b00add708ba9b23ae94","sha":"1158edd5475da694d72c6b00add708ba9b23ae94","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commits/1158edd5475da694d72c6b00add708ba9b23ae94"}],"sha":"902738961db3ee0331ba20b9b35048b92dafe199","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commits/902738961db3ee0331ba20b9b35048b92dafe199"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commits/1158edd5475da694d72c6b00add708ba9b23ae94/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-10T08:34:44Z","email":"dukekimm@Duke-Kimm-Mac-mini.local","name":"Duke Kimm"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-10T08:34:44Z","email":"dukekimm@Duke-Kimm-Mac-mini.local","name":"Duke Kimm"},"message":"fix(skills): 조회 스킬 3종 curl 원문을 _scripts 헬퍼로 캡슐화 (런처 v0.1.30)\n\n에이전트(특히 GLM 계열)가 SKILL.md 의 curl 블록을 임의 변형해 REST 관례식\n경로(/projects/{code}/issues 등)를 추측 호출하다 404 를 내는 문제의 후속.\nissue-query.sh(#94,#97) 와 같은 패턴을 남은 조회 스킬 전체로 확장해,\nSKILL.md 에서 조립 가능한 curl 원문을 제거한다.\n\n- _scripts/project-query.sh 신설 — /Project 목록(요약)/단건(전체 오브젝트)\n- _scripts/pr-list.sh 신설 — /DocRepo/{code}/prs, STATE 검증 + 비배열 응답 가드\n- _scripts/doc-history.sh 신설 — /DocRepo/{code}/commits, branch URL 인코딩 + 가드\n- project-query/pr-list/doc-history SKILL.md — curl 제거, 스크립트 호출로 전환\n- gojira.md·assets-extra/CLAUDE.md — 신규 헬퍼 3종 지침 반영\n- 런처 v0.1.29 → v0.1.30 (스킬 재추출 게이트)\n\n로컬 실측: project-query 목록/단건 정상, pr-list STATE 오입력·비배열 응답\nfail-fast, doc-history 에러 감지 정상 (bash -n 3종 통과).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Kj3Xj6jqdyFQXbY6L9SB5Q","tree":{"sha":"97e130cc84e5ccfbbb8cbe65ae72ed407b6655b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/git/trees/97e130cc84e5ccfbbb8cbe65ae72ed407b6655b5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/git/commits/1158edd5475da694d72c6b00add708ba9b23ae94","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified