hi-duke/GoJIRA/commits/34fc91d9e8c6596cd34766e84786574f3837b5fd"}],"sha":"e8c378b34e9cdb7fdb7fdba9a0ef333292357273","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commits/e8c378b34e9cdb7fdb7fdba9a0ef333292357273"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commits/34fc91d9e8c6596cd34766e84786574f3837b5fd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-10T04:59:16Z","email":"dukekimm@Duke-Kimm-Mac-mini.local","name":"Duke Kimm"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-10T04:59:16Z","email":"dukekimm@Duke-Kimm-Mac-mini.local","name":"Duke Kimm"},"message":"fix(DocEditor): 런처 focus 재감지 시 launcher state 안정화로 프로비저닝 깜빡임 제거\n\nfocus 이벤트마다 detectLauncher()가 새 객체(성공) 또는 null(미응답)을 반환해\nlauncher?.ready 가 true↔undefined 로 토글되면서 refreshDocState useEffect 가\n재실행되고 /files 재호출로 프로비저닝 인디케이터가 깜빡였다. 사내망 /files 2.4s\n환경에서만 육안 노출(사외 수십ms 는 350ms 임계 미만이라 안 보임).\n\nsetLauncher 를 함수형으로 전환 — null(일시 미응답)은 마지막 성공 상태를 보존해\n토글을 차단하고, 실질 동일(ready/token/version)하면 참조를 유지해 불필요한\n재렌더/effect 재평가를 막는다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Kj3Xj6jqdyFQXbY6L9SB5Q","tree":{"sha":"604d771590c4a4d8948906be59b51c83f4fae76a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/git/trees/604d771590c4a4d8948906be59b51c83f4fae76a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/git/commits/34fc91d9e8c6596cd34766e84786574f3837b5fd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commit/34fc91d9e8c6596cd34766e84786574f3837b5fd","node_id":"C_kwDORyCU2NoAKDM0ZmM5MWQ5ZThjNjU5NmNkMzQ3NjZlODQ3ODY1NzRmMzgzN2I1ZmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commit/50d7b521c72847dfcf8b707bf28beac51795112f","sha":"50d7b521c72847dfcf8b707bf28beac51795112f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commits/50d7b521c72847dfcf8b707bf2