er}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dkdoc7","id":222582245,"login":"dkdoc7","node_id":"U_kgDODURV5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commits/37615c57f15388044724ffd2950348dd52dc1939/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T11:02:44Z","email":"duke.kimm7@gmail.com","name":"duke.kimm"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T11:02:44Z","email":"duke.kimm7@gmail.com","name":"duke.kimm"},"message":"fix(agent): CLAUDE.md에도 issue-query.sh 사용 지침 추가 (런처 v0.1.29)\n\nPR #95 에서 OpenCode 용 gojira.md 는 고쳤지만, Claude Code 가 쓰는\ngojira-launcher/assets-extra/CLAUDE.md 에는 이슈 조회 방법에 대한 안내가\n아예 없었다. 그 결과 Claude Code 세션도 안내 없이 /projects/{code}/issues\n같은 존재하지 않는 REST 경로를 추측해 curl 로 직접 호출 → 404 → 문서/스크립트\n탐색으로 시간을 허비하는 동일한 증상이 실사용 로그로 확인됨.\n\ngojira.md 와 동일한 근거(Mongo는 PR 머지 시점에만 갱신, GoJIRA-API는\nXBody 헤더 기반 비-REST 규약)로 issue-query.sh 사용을 명시하는 섹션을\nCLAUDE.md 에 추가.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DPiSsNM9jfm2tknpYLs74i","tree":{"sha":"b8d0afa748dc0ade7154b872ebabc3c8daeb0688","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/git/trees/b8d0afa748dc0ade7154b872ebabc3c8daeb0688"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/git/commits/37615c57f15388044724ffd2950348dd52dc1939","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/222582245?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dkdoc7","id":222582245,"login":"dkdoc7","node_id":"U_kgDODURV5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commit/37615c57f15388044724ffd2950348dd52dc1939","node_id":"C_kwDORyCU2NoAKDM3NjE1YzU3ZjE1Mzg4MDQ0NzI0ZmZkMjk1MDM0OGRkNTJkYzE5Mzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commit/13b1023a526db53a5609356ed17da3ed182f824c","sha":"13b1023a526db53a5609356ed17da3ed182f824c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commits/13b1023a526db53a5609356ed17da3ed182f824c"}],"sha":"37615c57f15388044724ffd2950348dd52dc1939","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commits/37615c57f15388044724ffd2950348dd52dc1939"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/222582245?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dkdoc7","id":222582245,"login":"dkdoc7","node_id":"U_kgDODURV5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commits/6372d18b66aa681943f3725a2ab649fcfceb7adb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T08:05:48Z","email":"duke.kimm7@gmail.com","name":"duke.kimm"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T08:05:48Z","email":"duke.kimm7@gmail.com","name":"duke.kimm"},"message":"perf(launcher): /files 트리 조회에 mtime+size 기반 blob SHA 캐시 적용 (v0.1.29)\n\n웹 \"로컬\" 탭을 열거나 새로고침할 때마다 /files 가 전체 작업 트리 파일 내용을\n매번 다시 읽어 git blob SHA 를 재계산하고 있었다 — 프로젝트 이슈 조회에 쓰이는\n\"정렬 게이트\"(EnsureRepoLocal, 세션당 1회만 실행)와는 무관한 별도 병목으로,\n파일 개수/크기에 비례해 매번 커지는 지연이었다.\n\nlistLocalTree 에 repoPath 별 in-memory 캐시(경로→{mtime,size,sha})를 추가해,\nmtime+size 가 그대로인 파일은 재해시를 건너뛴다. 외부에서 파일을 직접 수정해도\nmtime 이 바뀌므로 별도 무효화 로직 없이 정확하게 재계산되고, 삭제/rename 된\n파일은 캐시 재구성 시 자연히 빠진다.\n\n로컬 실측: DKDOC(~55 파일) 기준 cold 934ms → warm 318ms.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DPiSsNM9jfm2tknpYLs74i","tree":{"sha":"4c714bdb76d1c4525488f67cbc746636327818da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/git/trees/4c714bdb76d1c4525488f67cbc746636327818da"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/git/commits/6372d18b66aa681943f3725a2ab649fcfceb7adb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/222582245?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkd