d17da3ed182f824c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/222582245?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dkdoc7","id":222582245,"login":"dkdoc7","node_id":"U_kgDODURV5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commits/ca4f219b71056ec8e01d8b89e5ac83d8af94b19b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T06:52:25Z","email":"duke.kimm7@gmail.com","name":"duke.kimm"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T06:52:25Z","email":"duke.kimm7@gmail.com","name":"duke.kimm"},"message":"fix(agent): GLM 계열 에이전트의 curl 직접 호출/경로 대소문자 오류 방지 (런처 v0.1.28)\n\n증상: OpenCode의 GLM 계열 모델이 issue-query.sh 대신 curl로 GoJIRA-API를\n직접 호출하고, 그 과정에서 경로 대소문자를 잘못 추측해 엉뚱한 라우트를\n호출하는 문제. fable 모델로 원인 분석 후 3단계로 대응:\n\n1. .opencode/agents/gojira.md — \"이슈 조회 → skill(issue-query) → 내부\n   curl 실행\"이라는 낡은 문구가 GLM에게 \"이슈 조회=curl\"이라고 적극적으로\n   잘못 가르치고 있었음. issue-query.sh 사용을 명시하고 이유(Mongo는 PR\n   머지 시점에만 갱신)를 반복 기술하도록 수정.\n2. GoJIRA-API/main.go — caseInsensitiveRouting을 Issue 하위 세그먼트\n   (ingest/label/link/comment/fetch/field/relations)까지 확장. Project\n   류는 다음 세그먼트가 {jiraCode} 실값이라 정규화 대상에서 제외(코드\n   손상 방지, 유닛테스트로 고정).\n3. r.NotFound 핸들러 추가 — 잘못된 경로 호출 시 맨 404 대신 issue-query.sh\n   사용 안내 + 올바른 경로 목록을 JSON으로 반환.\n\nAPI 경로 전체 소문자 통일(더 근본적인 대안)은 프론트엔드/gojira-cli/전체\n스킬의 breaking change라 별도 작업으로 보류하기로 사용자와 합의.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DPiSsNM9jfm2tknpYLs74i","tree":{"sha":"5fca32fd9953bb19d4d3fb9392a2e0191e6a7e7e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/git/trees/5fca32fd9953bb19d4d3fb9392a2e0191e6a7e7e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/git/commits/ca4f219b71056ec8e01d8b89e5ac83d8af94b19b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/222582245?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dkdoc7","id":222582245,"login":"dkdoc7","node_id":"U_kgDODURV5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commit/ca4f219b71056ec8e01d8b89e5ac83d8af94b19b","node_id":"C_kwDORyCU2NoAKGNhNGYyMTliNzEwNTZlYzhlMDFkOGI4OWU1YWM4M2Q4YWY5NGIxOWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commit/06836c644e2d06a574291a49243f9e4f8a7022f7","sha":"06836c644e2d06a574291a49243f9e4f8a7022f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commits/06836c644e2d06a574291a49243f9e4f8a7022f7"}],"sha":"ca4f219b71056ec8e01d8b89e5ac83d8af94b