ame":"duke.kimm"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T02:55:06Z","email":"duke.kimm7@gmail.com","name":"duke.kimm"},"message":"refactor(skills): \"2\" 접미사 스킬 이름 정리, 구버전 satam-analyze 제거 (런처 v0.1.27)\n\ndesign-decide2/design-integrate2/driver-select2/requirement-refine2/\nsatam-analyze2/style-define2/usecase-analyze2/vos-collect2 를 각각\n\"2\" 없는 이름으로 rename. 유일하게 이름이 겹쳤던 구버전 satam-analyze\n(읽기 전용 리포트, 실제 SATAM 판정/기록은 satam-analyze2 가 담당)는\n삭제하고 satam-analyze2 를 satam-analyze 로 승격.\n\n모든 SKILL.md 상호 참조 + _scripts/*.py + _shared/*.md + opencode\nagents/gojira.md 의 스킬명 참조를 함께 갱신. docs/ 아래 과거 설계/의사결정\n문서는 이력 보존을 위해 그대로 둠.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DPiSsNM9jfm2tknpYLs74i","tree":{"sha":"9e6e11e630923fccf205c9e9446e64192ea27dfb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/git/trees/9e6e11e630923fccf205c9e9446e64192ea27dfb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/git/commits/3e2c4c0e2eb7343631365a0bd0e9a948653360a3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/222582245?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dkdoc7","id":222582245,"login":"dkdoc7","node_id":"U_kgDODURV5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commit/3e2c4c0e2eb7343631365a0bd0e9a948653360a3","node_id":"C_kwDORyCU2NoAKDNlMmM0YzBlMmViNzM0MzYzMTM2NWEwYmQwZTlhOTQ4NjUzMzYwYTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commit/752aef9179bb2ef9f13e7d3dbe776a3b52587168","sha":"752aef9179bb2ef9f13e7d3dbe776a3b52587168","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commits/752aef9179bb2ef9f13e7d3dbe776a3b52587168"}],"sha":"3e2c4c0e2eb7343631365a0bd0e9a948653360a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commits/3e2c4c0e2eb7343631365a0bd0e9a948653360a3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/222582245?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dkdoc7","id":222582245,"login":"dkdoc7","node_id":"U_kgDODURV5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commits/752aef9179bb2ef9f13e7d3dbe776a3b52587168/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T02:39:27Z","email":"duke.kimm7@gmail.com","name":"duke.kimm"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T02:39:27Z","email":"duke.kimm7@gmail.com","name":"duke.kimm"},"message":"fix(skills): 세션 중 이슈 조회를 Mongo 대신 로컬 clone에서 읽도록 수정 (런처 v0.1.26)\n\n이슈 쓰기(POST/PUT /Issue)는 X-Local-Write로 로컬 clone에만 기록되고 Mongo는\nPR 머지 시점에만 갱신되는데, 여러 스킬이 curl로 Mongo를 직접 조회해 세션 중\n방금 만든 이슈를 못 보는 문제가 있었다. project-status.sh/drift-check.py/\n5개 assemble 스크립트 + 15개 SKILL.md의 이슈 조회를 신규 issue_local.py\n(PyYAML 미사용 최소 YAML 파서) 기반 issue-query.sh로 전환. issue-create-*의\n중복 체크가 가장 심각한 케이스로, 방치 시 중복 이슈 생성으로 이어질 수 있었다.\narchSettings/usecase-artifacts는 원래부터 Mongo 직접쓰기라 API 조회 유지.\n\n부수로 발견한 gateway_derive_test.go의 persistGateway (PR #93에서\npersistInstallAnswers로 리네임된 후 미갱신) 참조도 함께 수정.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DPiSsNM9jfm2tknpYLs74i","tree":{"sha":"64dd8a97b1b2e3bc9bb81e80bf7336414c509c38","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/git/trees/64dd8a97b1b2e3bc9bb81e80bf7336414c509c38"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/git/commits/752aef9179bb2ef9f13e7d3dbe776a3b52587168","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/222582245?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dkdoc7","id":222582245,"login":"dkdoc7","node_id":"U_kgDODURV5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commit/752aef9179bb2e