,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commit/50d7b521c72847dfcf8b707bf28beac51795112f","node_id":"C_kwDORyCU2NoAKDUwZDdiNTIxYzcyODQ3ZGZjZjhiNzA3YmYyOGJlYWM1MTc5NTExMmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commit/d9cee440adc5d20aae554b28c134efb9e334a227","sha":"d9cee440adc5d20aae554b28c134efb9e334a227","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commits/d9cee440adc5d20aae554b28c134efb9e334a227"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commit/52aad55763d7161b301c9c560c83e598b709c957","sha":"52aad55763d7161b301c9c560c83e598b709c957","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commits/52aad55763d7161b301c9c560c83e598b709c957"}],"sha":"50d7b521c72847dfcf8b707bf28beac51795112f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commits/50d7b521c72847dfcf8b707bf28beac51795112f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/222582245?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dkdoc7","id":222582245,"login":"dkdoc7","node_id":"U_kgDODURV5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commits/52aad55763d7161b301c9c560c83e598b709c957/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T12:32:30Z","email":"duke.kimm7@gmail.com","name":"duke.kimm"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T12:32:30Z","email":"duke.kimm7@gmail.com","name":"duke.kimm"},"message":"feat(launcher): install 대화형 입력(gateway/git.user/git.token) 지원 (v0.1.25)\n\n터미널에서 install 을 직접 실행하는 경우, gateway/git.user/git.token 값을\nlauncher.json 을 손으로 열어 채우지 않고 대화형으로 입력받도록 했다. 이미 값이\n있으면(재설치) 재입력 없이 Enter 로 유지, 토큰은 마스킹 표시.\n\n- stdin 이 TTY 일 때만 프롬프트(os.ModeCharDevice 판별, 외부 의존성 없음) — 비대화형\n  (CI/스크립트/`install --gateway` 자동화)은 기존 동작 그대로, 프롬프트 없이 통과.\n- --gateway 플래그가 있으면 그 값을 우선(재프롬프트 안 함).\n- persistGateway 를 persistInstallAnswers 로 일반화 — gateway 뿐 아니라 git.user/\n  git.token 도 한 round-trip 으로 기록(다른 필드는 보존).\n- 웹 설치 안내 모달이 이미 gateway 를 자동으로 채운 명령을 제시하므로, 남은 수동\n  단계(git.user/git.token JSON 편집)를 이걸로 없앴다. gateway 자체를 API push 로\n  대체하는 방안은 검토했으나 origin 허용목록이 gateway 로부터 파생되는 구조라\n  (webOrigins 비어있으면 브라우저發 요청이 전부 403) 순환 문제가 있어 보류.\n\nWSL 격리 환경에서 --gateway 자동화 경로(비대화형)가 프롬프트 없이 기존과 동일하게\n동작하는 것까지 재검증.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DPiSsNM9jfm2tknpYLs74i","tree":{"sha":"4296a4bdcd795027c18e8bb5f083769d1579dd0e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/git/trees/4296a4bdcd795027c18e8bb5f083769d1579dd0e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/git/commits/52aad55763d7161b301c9c560c83e598b709c957","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22258