9076a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commits/3f863826646b1877528fb2e7d703114e7a9076a6"}],"sha":"d9cee440adc5d20aae554b28c134efb9e334a227","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commits/d9cee440adc5d20aae554b28c134efb9e334a227"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/222582245?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dkdoc7","id":222582245,"login":"dkdoc7","node_id":"U_kgDODURV5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commits/3f863826646b1877528fb2e7d703114e7a9076a6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T11:34:01Z","email":"duke.kimm7@gmail.com","name":"duke.kimm"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T11:34:01Z","email":"duke.kimm7@gmail.com","name":"duke.kimm"},"message":"fix(launcher): install 시 기존 데몬 자동 종료+재기동, issue-write.sh fail-fast (v0.1.24)\n\nlauncher.json은 데몬 기동 시 1회만 읽는데, `install`(--gateway 포함)이 이미 떠 있는\n데몬을 자동으로 내리지 않아 설정 변경이 반영되려면 사람이 수동 재시작을 해야 했다\n(그 재시작을 놓치는 게 사내망에서 GOJIRA_API/PLATFORM_API 가 계속 비어보이던 실제\n원인). POST /shutdown 엔드포인트(토큰 필요)를 추가하고, install 이 exe 복사 전에\n먼저 이 엔드포인트로 기존 데몬을 정상 종료하도록 수정 — 이제 install(--gateway) 한\n번 실행이면 충분하다.\n\n순서 버그도 함께 발견·수정: 기존 데몬 종료를 copyFile 이후에 두면 실행 중인 자기\n자신의 exe 를 덮어쓰려다 \"text file busy\" 로 실패한다(update.go 의 자동 업데이트가\n.old/.new staged swap 을 쓰는 것과 동일한 이유). copyFile 이전으로 이동.\n\nWSL 격리 환경(throwaway HOME)에서 install → install --gateway 전체 흐름을 실제\n재현해 검증 완료 — 기존엔 두 번째 install 이 \"text file busy\" 로 실패했고, 수정 후엔\n기존 데몬 종료 → exe 교체 → gateway 반영 → 재기동까지 정상 통과.\n\n이슈-write.sh 는 GOJIRA_API 미설정 시 조용히 localhost:9001 로 폴백하던 걸\nfail-fast(다른 스크립트들과 동일 패턴)로 수정 — 이게 사내망에서 관찰된\n\"http://localhost:9001/api/v2/Issue 호출\" 증상의 직접 원인이었다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DPiSsNM9jfm2tknpYLs74i","tree":{"sha":"941f6a4427fbf3258018c410502e85ca1e2819b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/git/trees/941f6a4427fbf3258018c410502e85ca1e2819b4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/git/commits/3f863826646b1877528fb2e7d703114e7a9076a6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/222582245?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dkdoc7","id":222582245,"login":"dkdoc7","node_id":"U_kgDODURV5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commit/3f863826646b1877528fb2e7d703114e7a9076a6","node_id":"C_kwDORyCU2NoAKDNmODYzODI2N