bscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commits/3e7af06fee86182b2ffffa3e0918422a3f21ee5b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T10:47:18Z","email":"duke.kimm7@gmail.com","name":"duke.kimm"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T10:47:18Z","email":"duke.kimm7@gmail.com","name":"duke.kimm"},"message":"fix(launcher): opencode 에이전트 stale 환경변수 지시 수정 (런처 v0.1.22)\n\n.opencode/agents/gojira.md 가 D10~D12 로컬화 이전(서버 worktree 시절) 문서 그대로였음:\n- USER=\"batman\" 하드코딩 기본값 + 이후 전부 맨 $USER 참조 → 실제 로그인 사용자\n  대신 가짜 사용자로 동작할 위험. GOJIRA_USER(launcher 주입, knox ID) 기반으로 수정.\n- PROJECT_ROOT 기본값이 /home/parallels/works/GoJIRA (Mac/Parallels 개발 경로,\n  사내망에 없음) → GOJIRA_REPO_ROOT 기반으로 수정.\n- 존재하지 않는 _edit-release.sh, 폐기된 worktree/EditSession lock 컨벤션 섹션 제거\n  (doc-save.sh 는 이미 로컬 clone 직접 write 로 전환됨, 서버 lock 미사용).\n\nCLAUDE.md 는 PROJECT_ROOT 안내가 빠져있었음 — 모든 SKILL.md 스크립트가\n${PROJECT_ROOT}/.claude/skills/_scripts/... 를 참조하는데 export 하는 곳이\n없었음. GOJIRA_REPO_ROOT 기반 export 지시 추가.\n\n로컬 dev WSL 스택에서 재빌드 + /launcher/version 이 0.1.22 서빙하는 것까지 검증.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DPiSsNM9jfm2tknpYLs74i","tree":{"sha":"f59e6ba025b7821f90d164a75720466ce6717dd6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/git/trees/f59e6ba025b7821f90d164a75720466ce6717dd6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/git/commits/3e7af06fee86182b2ffffa3e0918422a3f21ee5b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/222582245?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dk