ts{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dkdoc7","id":222582245,"login":"dkdoc7","node_id":"U_kgDODURV5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commits/dcbafe0d2047393ca6af5201045877ca6da571aa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-07T04:35:52Z","email":"duke.kimm7@gmail.com","name":"duke.kimm"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-07T04:35:52Z","email":"duke.kimm7@gmail.com","name":"duke.kimm"},"message":"fix(shell): AuthGroups 화면에서 ID 컬럼 제거\n\n기존 시드 그룹은 사람이 읽는 문자열 id(ag_master 등), 신규 생성 그룹은\nMongoDB ObjectId 라 생성 규칙이 달라 혼란스러움 — 이름/코드/앱만으로\n구분하고 ID 는 화면에 노출하지 않는다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DPiSsNM9jfm2tknpYLs74i","tree":{"sha":"02faee0dc122e965ab2e881225cd2651b5ccb27c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/git/trees/02faee0dc122e965ab2e881225cd2651b5ccb27c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/git/commits/dcbafe0d2047393ca6af5201045877ca6da571aa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/222582245?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dkdoc7","id":222582245,"login":"dkdoc7","node_id":"U_kgDODURV5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commit/dcbafe0d2047393ca6af5201045877ca6da571aa","node_id":"C_kwDORyCU2NoAKGRjYmFmZTBkMjA0NzM5M2NhNmFmNTIwMTA0NTg3N2NhNmRhNTcxYWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commit/355fcc09819075d476d28b0fa29ec24230431315","sha":"355fcc09819075d476d28b0fa29ec24230431315","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commits/355fcc09819075d476d28b0fa29ec24230431315"}],"sha":"dcbafe0d2047393ca6af5201045877ca6da571aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commits/dcbafe0d2047393ca6af5201045877ca6da571aa"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/222582245?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dkdoc7","id":222582245,"login":"dkdoc7","node_id":"U_kgDODURV5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commits/355fcc09819075d476d28b0fa29ec24230431315/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-07T04:05:54Z","email":"duke.kimm7@gmail.com","name":"duke.kimm"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-07T04:05:54Z","email":"duke.kimm7@gmail.com","name":"duke.kimm"},"message":"feat(platform): platform 스코프 = 전체 조회 모델 + 원본 정리 (D9)\n\n사용자 결정: 계정/공지 데이터는 app 태그로 구분하되 각 앱은 자기 것만\n필터, platform 은 전체 조회(메타 관리 콘솔).\n\n- appFilter 에 ''all'' 지원 — platform 관리 화면(users/authGroups/notices)\n  이 app=all 로 전체 조회. 권한 계산·공지 팝업은 스코프별 유지.\n- D8 부트스트랩 폴백 2단(resolveAuthorityScope, 로스터 대체) 제거 —\n  신규 앱 온보딩은 platform 화면에서 그 앱 그룹 생성+배정으로 수행.\n- UI: 사용자 권한그룹은 name 표시(미매핑 id 숨김, platform 은 ''이름(앱)''),\n  platform 전용 컬럼 — Users ''소속 앱'', AuthGroups ID/앱(name 첫 컬럼),\n  Notice 앱. 생성 다이얼로그에 platform 전용 앱 선택 select.\n- gojira DB 의 D8 이관 원본(users/authGroups/orgUnits/notices) drop —\n  cleanup-gojira-platform-collections.js (platform 쪽 건수 확인 가드, 멱등).\n- 계약 05 §5.5 갱신(app=all, 폴백 제거), 결정 로그 D9.\n\n검증(실브라우저, 44300): platform Users 3명+소속앱 컬럼+''Viewer(gojira)''\n표기, AuthGroups 6개(이름/코드/ID/앱), Notice 앱 컬럼, gojira 스코프\n그룹명 raw id 제거 확인, ragaas 스코프 메뉴 없음(배정 전 정상). 에러 0\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DPiSsNM9jfm2tknpYLs74i","tree":{"sha":"1c08c9a169d8fbf0a76a20df5b5f7cf3de687b5d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/git/trees/1c08c9a169d8fbf0a76a20df5b5f7cf3de687b5d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/git/commits/355fcc09819075d476d28b0fa29ec24230431315","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/222582245?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dkdoc7","id":222582245,"login":"dkdoc7","node_id":"U_kgDODURV5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commit/355fcc09819075d476d28b0fa29ec24230431315","node_id":"C_kwDORyCU2NoAKDM1NWZjYzA5ODE5MDc1ZDQ3NmQyOGIwZmEyOWVjMjQyMzA0MzEzMTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commit/cb8f4abbaeb8fb46b35bef2cd4e155e41575b2fc","sha":"cb8f4abbaeb8fb46b35bef2cd4e155e41575b2fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commits/cb8f4abbaeb8fb46b35bef2cd4e155e41575b2fc"}],"sha":"355fcc09819075d476d28b0fa29ec24230431315","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commits/355fcc09819075d476d28b0fa29ec24230431315"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/222582245?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dkdoc7","id":222582245,"login":"dkdoc7","node_id":"U_kgDODURV5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commits/cb8f4abbaeb8fb46b35bef2cd4e155e41575b2fc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-07T03:07:26Z","email":"duke.kimm7@gmail.com","name":"duke.kimm"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-07T03:07:26Z","email":"duke.kimm7@gmail.com","name":"duke.kimm"},"message":"feat(platform): Account/Notice 앱 스코핑 + Platform DB 분리 (D8)\n\n계정 관리·공지는 계속 Platform-API/셸 단독 소유이되, 데이터를 앱별로\n분리한다 — 전역 신원 + 앱별 권한(AuthGroup.app/Notice.app). 기존\n데이터는 app:''platform'' 귀속, GoJIRA 연속성을 위해 platform 그룹을\n_gojira 로 복제 + 기존 사용자 링크. RAGaaS 는 authGroup 0건으로\n진짜 빈 상태 시작.\n\n- Platform-API 소유 데이터 DB 를 gojira → platform 분리\n  (PLATFORM_MONGO_DB 기본값 변경). DocRepo 의 projects 직접 갱신은\n  별도 gojiraDB 핸들(PLATFORM_GOJIRA_MONGO_DB)로 유지.\n  deploy/scripts/migrate-platform-db.js: grant + 컬렉션 이관 +\n  태깅 + gojira 그룹 복제, 멱등.\n- GoJIRA-API 의 account_mgmt.go/notice.go 등 6개 파일 삭제 — 조사\n  결과 main.go 라우터에 전혀 등록되지 않은 죽은 코드였음(GoJIRA-API\n  가 Platform 소유 컬렉션에 HTTP 경유 없이 직접 Mongo 접근하던 코드).\n- Account/Notice API 에 ?app= 쿼리 파라미터. 신규 앱 부트스트랩\n  폴백 2단: (1) authGroup 0건이면 권한계산만 platform 권한으로\n  폴백해 마스터가 최초 진입 가능 (2) 소속 사용자 0명이면 온보딩\n  후보로 플랫폼 로스터 표시 — 최초 그룹 배정 전까지만.\n- 프론트: App.jsx authority 조회에 app=scope(스코프 전환마다\n  재계산), AccountManager/NoticeManager/NoticePopup 에 app prop.\n  NoticePopup \"3일간 보지 않기\" 도 앱별 분리.\n- 계약 02(getAuthority 는 remote 자기 스코프 기준)/03(공지 앱\n  스코핑)/05(§5.5 API, §5.6 DB) 갱신. 결정 로그 D7(누락분 소급)+D8.\n  RAGaaS 통지(조치 불필요, 부트스트랩 방법 안내).\n\n검증(실브라우저+API, 44300): platform/gojira 3명, ragaas 0명→\n부트스트랩 후 마스터 권한+로스터 노출. GoJIRA Project 기능 무영향.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DPiSsNM9jfm2tknpYLs74i","tree":{"sha":"b26564cb2306b2a6f3bd46d502b3d1cc1199e34b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/git/trees/b26564cb2306b2a6f3bd46d502b3d1cc1199e34b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/git/commits/cb8f4abbaeb8fb46b35bef2cd4e155e41575b2fc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/222582245?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dkdoc7","id":222582245,"login":"dkdoc7","node_id":"U_kgDODURV5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commit/cb8f4abbaeb8fb46b35bef2cd4e155e41575b2fc","node_id":"C_kwDORyCU2NoAKGNiOGY0YWJiYWViOGZiNDZiMzViZWYyY2Q0ZTE1NWU0MTU3NWIyZmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commit/c799ea5c9c8db113d07b39c848566423afae7a61","sha":"c799ea5c9c8db113d07b39c848566423afae7a61","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commits/c799ea5c9c8db113d07b39c848566423afae7a61"}],"sha":"cb8f4abbaeb8fb46b35bef2cd4e155e41575b2fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commits/cb8f4abbaeb8fb46b35bef2cd4e155e41575b2fc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/222582245?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dkdoc7","id":222582245,"login":"dkdoc7","node_id":"U_kgDODURV5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commits/c799ea5c9c8db113d07b39c848566423afae7a61/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-07T01:20:06Z","email":"duke.kimm7@gmail.com","name":"duke.kimm"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-07T01:20:06Z","email":"duke.kimm7@gmail.com","name":"duke.kimm"},"message":"feat(shell): 스코프별 타이틀 아이콘 동작 + 노출 플랫폼 메뉴 설정 (D7)\n\nregistry 항목에 titlebarAction(''agent''|''home'')/platformMenus(키 목록)\n추가, 플랫폼 스코프는 PLATFORM_SCOPE_CONFIG 로 별도 지정.\n\n- platform: home(초기 화면=제품 카드 목록), [account, notice]\n- gojira:   agent(로컬 에이전트 채팅), [account, notice, repository]\n- ragaas:   home(그 스코프 기본 화면 복귀), [account, notice]\n\nvisiblePlatformMenus 를 activeScopeConfig.platformMenus 로 필터링해\n스코프별로 다른 메뉴 집합이 자연히 도출되도록 단일화 (기존 authCode\n권한 필터와 이중 적용).\n\n검증(실브라우저): 3 스코프 모두 메뉴 목록/타이틀 툴팁/클릭 동작 기대값과 일치\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DPiSsNM9jfm2tknpYLs74i","tree":{"sha":"76cf3cd2b2d39b5727be6bc2432e13624d64f01c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-