wers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dkdoc7","id":222582245,"login":"dkdoc7","node_id":"U_kgDODURV5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commits/fae7e09f1a50769b0e16bd6d88890a0af9ee55a9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-07T01:07:11Z","email":"duke.kimm7@gmail.com","name":"duke.kimm"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-07T01:07:11Z","email":"duke.kimm7@gmail.com","name":"duke.kimm"},"message":"fix(shell): 홈 카드의 GoJIRA 아이콘이 흰 배경에 묻히는 문제 수정\n\n로고가 거의 흰색(#f8f8f8)이라 흰 카드 배경에서 안 보였다\n(titlebar 는 어두운 배경이라 무증상이었음). 아이콘/글자배지를\ntitlebar 색(#2c3e50) 원형 칩으로 통일해 항상 보이게 함.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DPiSsNM9jfm2tknpYLs74i","tree":{"sha":"f7875cb8f45ac0602e5441bea2c3cbcf2ca69296","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/git/trees/f7875cb8f45ac0602e5441bea2c3cbcf2ca69296"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/git/commits/fae7e09f1a50769b0e16bd6d88890a0af9ee55a9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/222582245?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/