ps://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commits/d7fbe1d48929a7abd76f5585af6531c1eed756a0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-07T00:15:04Z","email":"duke.kimm7@gmail.com","name":"duke.kimm"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-07T00:15:04Z","email":"duke.kimm7@gmail.com","name":"duke.kimm"},"message":"feat(shell): 제품 스코프에서 마스터에게 플랫폼 내장 메뉴 노출 (D5 보강)\n\nUSR>=15 사용자는 /gojira 등 제품 스코프에서도 구분선 뒤에\nAccount/Notice/Repository 를 본다 (개별 authCode 필터 중첩).\n클릭 시 같은 스코프 안에서 내장 화면 렌더 — 브랜드/URL 유지.\n비마스터는 제품 메뉴만.\n\n검증(실브라우저): duke.kimm(마스터) /gojira → Project | Account Notice\nRepository, Account 클릭 → 사용자 관리 렌더(URL /gojira 유지),\nbatman(비마스터) 전환 → Project 만. 에러 0\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DPiSsNM9jfm2tknpYLs74i","tree":{"sha":"8b9c43107a9eae6d53bb0f658434f53dc0f1f305","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/git/trees/8b9c43107a9eae6d53bb0f658434f53dc0f1f305"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/git/commits/d7fbe1d48929a7abd76f5585af6531c1eed756a0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/222582245?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dkdoc7","id":222582245,"login":"dkdoc7","node_id":"U_kgDODURV5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/r