GoJIRA manifest: Project 메뉴\n- RemoteAppProps 에 page prop 추가 (메뉴 클릭 키 전달)\n- URL 의미: 제품 세그먼트 = 스코프 진입점, 탭/메뉴 전환은 URL 불변,\n  /account 등 내장 딥링크 유지. document.title = 스코프 브랜드\n- 계약 01 §2 갱신 + 결정 D5 + RAGaaS 통지 §3.5\n\n검증(실브라우저): / NETRIX+5탭, /gojira GoJIRA+Project만(아이콘 remote 경유),\n/ragaas RAGaaS+바디, /gojira/ 302 경유 동일, /account 딥링크 정상 — 에러 0\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DPiSsNM9jfm2tknpYLs74i","tree":{"sha":"623d46ec0c51e6228e81fae3e1cf9c9187a8ff5a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/git/trees/623d46ec0c51e6228e81fae3e1cf9c9187a8ff5a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/git/commits/e76667bdad03cecad39f5db1c8a2f87d46fc9590","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/222582245?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dkdoc7","id":222582245,"login":"dkdoc7","node_id":"U_kgDODURV5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commit/e76667bdad03cecad39f5db1c8a2f87d46fc9590","node_id":"C_kwDORyCU2NoAKGU3NjY2N2JkYWQwM2NlY2FkMzlmNWRiMWM4YTJmODdkNDZmYzk1OTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commit/a910fe748951347051d86051810f1bfd6883d8a2","sha":"a910fe748951347051d86051810f1bfd6883d8a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commits/a910fe748951347051d86051810f1bfd6883d8a2"}],"sha":"e76667bdad03cecad39f5db1c8a2f87d46fc9590","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commits/e76667bdad03cecad39f5db1c8a2f87d46fc9590"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/222582245?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dkdoc7","id":222582245,"login":"dkdoc7","node_id":"U_kgDODURV5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commits/a910fe748951347051d86051810f1bfd6883d8a2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T22:55:58Z","email":"duke.kimm7@gmail.com","name":"duke.kimm"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T22:55:58Z","email":"duke.kimm7@gmail.com","name":"duke.kimm"},"message":"feat(gateway): remote=바디전용 확정 — standalone 진입 셸로 302 수렴 (D4)\n\n크롬(타이틀바/플랫폼 메뉴/사용자 표시)은 셸 단독 소유로 계약 01 확정.\n- location = /<제품>/ → 302 /<제품> (자산/remoteEntry/API 는 통과)\n- location = /<제품> exact 를 셸에 프록시 — nginx 프리픽스 location 의\n  암묵 301(무슬래시→유슬래시) 차단. 이 301 때문에 셸 딥링크가 여태\n  standalone 으로 새고 있었고(D12 잠복 버그), 302 와 루프도 생겼다.\n- 계약 05 §4 갱신 + v1 alias 목록 오기(치환 오염 잔재) 정정\n- RAGaaS 통지문 §0 추가: base 수정 필수→선택 다운그레이드\n\n검증: /ragaas/ 진입 → 셸 크롬 + Knowledge Bases, /gojira/ → 셸 + 맵 (실브라우저)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DPiSsNM9jfm2tknpYLs74i","tree":{"sha":"597e63db2b72ba6fc0a197fc6c71cae41d4fd5da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/git/trees/597e63db2b72ba6fc0a197fc6c71cae41d4fd5da"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/git/commits/a910fe748951347051d86051810f1bfd6883d8a2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/222582245?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dkdoc7","id":222582245,"login":"dkdoc7","node_id":"U_kgDODURV5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commit/a910fe748951347051d86051810f1bfd6883d8a2","node_id":"C_kwDORyCU2NoAKGE5MTBmZTc0ODk1MTM0NzA1MWQ4NjA1MTgxMGYxYmZkNjg4M2Q4YTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commit/5af75444ff2b323b6282b5367a3369eb0b60c9af","sha":"5af75444ff2b323b6282b5367a3369eb0b60c9af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commits/5af75444ff2b323b6282b5367a3369eb0b60c9af"}],"sha":"a910fe748951347051