or":{"date":"2026-07-06T12:56:26Z","email":"duke.kimm7@gmail.com","name":"duke.kimm"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T12:56:26Z","email":"duke.kimm7@gmail.com","name":"duke.kimm"},"message":"docs(platform): RAGaaS 갱신 통지 프롬프트 — 경로 v2/tarball 준비완료/shared-net 조인\n\n기존 지시서 수신자를 전제로 변경 3건만 전달하는 통지문. 갱신판 온보딩 프롬프트와\n함께 재전달용. 변경없음(안심 목록)과 진행상황 공유 요청 포함.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DPiSsNM9jfm2tknpYLs74i","tree":{"sha":"6761936abb9e453ed59f8e53d6489b839b70c65b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/git/trees/6761936abb9e453ed59f8e53d6489b839b70c65b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/git/commits/1fc15c04f702d4480f7c5befba0cfed3abf9a222","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/222582245?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dkdoc7","id":222582245,"login":"dkdoc7","node_id":"U_kgDODURV5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commit/1fc15c04f702d4480f7c5befba0cfed3abf9a222","node_id":"C_kwDORyCU2NoAKDFmYzE1YzA0ZjcwMmQ0NDgwZjdjNWJlZmJhMGNmZWQzYWJmOWEyMjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commit/81f2a01e4e70d94145a19ff52f6312b27813255c","sha":"81f2a01e4e70d94145a19ff52f6312b27813255c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commits/81f2a01e4e70d94145a19ff52f6312b27813255c"}],"sha":"1fc15c04f702d4480f7c5befba0cfed3abf9a222","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commits/1fc15c04f702d4480f7c5befba0cfed3abf9a222"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/222582245?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dkdoc7","id":222582245,"login":"dkdoc7","node_id":"U_kgDODURV5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commits/81f2a01e4e70d94145a19ff52f6312b27813255c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T12:52:45Z","email":"duke.kimm7@gmail.com","name":"duke.kimm"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T12:52:45Z","email":"duke.kimm7@gmail.com","name":"duke.kimm"},"message":"feat(gateway): 경로 체계 v2 — 제품 프리픽스 단일화, -app/-api 접미사 제거 (D16)\n\n- 신경로: /platform/api/v2(공용), /<제품>/(프론트), /<제품>/api/v2(백엔드).\n  -api/api 이중성 제거. nginx 최장일치로 /gojira/api/ > /gojira/ 분기,\n  백엔드 수신 경로(/api/v2/...)는 불변. /platform/webhook/ 게이트웨이 경유 옵션 추가\n- 구경로 5종은 deprecated alias 유지 — 런처 <=0.1.15 가 gateway origin 에서\n  구경로를 파생하므로 fleet 자동업데이트 완료까지 무중단 호환\n- 런처 0.1.16: deriveGateway 가 신경로 파생(기동 시 파생이라 launcher.json 무변경),\n  테스트 갱신, launcher-dist 3종 재빌드\n- compose x-react-env 신경로 조립, RAGAAS_APP_REMOTE 예시 /ragaas\n- 문서: 계약 05 §4 개정(딥링크 슬래시 구분 명문화), 01/06/온보딩 프롬프트/ports/\n  deploy 문서 일괄 갱신, decisions D16 (문서 치환 중 이미지 태그 오염→복구 기록)\n- 검증(44300 라이브): 셸+remote 가 /gojira/remoteEntry.js 로 로드·실데이터,\n  v2/v1(alias) API 전부 200, /ragaas/api/ ragaas-backend 관통, /account 딥링크+그리드,\n  /gojira/ standalone 200, 에러 0\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DPiSsNM9jfm2tknpYLs74i","tree":{"sha":"cb0b536c79609d61aafbc5e7d6512a98ede9d603","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/git/trees/cb0b536c79609d61aafbc5e7d6512a98ede9d603"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/git/commits/81f2a01e4e70d94145a19ff52f6312b27813255c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/222582245?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dkdoc7","id":222582245,"login":"dkdoc7","node_id":"U_kgDODURV5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commit/81f2a01e4e70d94145a19ff52f6312b27813255c","node_id":"C_kwDORyCU2NoAKDgxZjJhMDFlNGU3MGQ5NDE0NWExOWZmNTJmNjMxMmIyNzgxMzI1NWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commit/06fc0fedc877a07453b00133284d6ff9d10f1482","sha":"06fc0fedc877a07453b00133284d6ff9d10f1482","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commits/06fc0fedc877a07453b00133284d6ff9d10f1482"}],"sha":"81f2a01e4e70d94145a19ff52f6312b27813255c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commits/81f2a01e4e70d94145a19ff52f6312b27813255c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/222582245?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dkdoc7","id":222582245,"login":"dkdoc7","node_id":"U_kgDODURV5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commits/06fc0fedc877a07453b00133284d6ff9d10f1482/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T12:30:19Z","email":"duke.kimm7@gmail.com","name":"duke.kimm"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T12:30:19Z","email":"duke.kimm7@gmail.com","name":"duke.kimm"},"message":"feat(platform): RAGaaS 온보딩 GoJIRA측 준비 — 셸 registry/게이트웨이/web-ui tarball (B1~B3, B7)\n\n- B7(블로커 해소): web-ui exports 맵 + deploy/scripts/pack-web-ui.sh →\n  deploy/dist/platform-web-ui-<ver>.tgz. 외부 Vite 프로젝트에서 tarball 설치→\n  서브패스 import→빌드 실검증 (node_modules 내 .jsx 변환 확인)\n- B1/B2: 셸 registry RAGaaS 엔트리 — env 게이트(REACT_APP_RAGAAS_APP_REMOTE 미설정시\n  탭 미노출). makeRemote 공통화, TAB_PATHS registry 파생(/ragaas 딥링크 자동),\n  RemoteErrorBoundary 문구 label 일반화. entrypoint/compose 직렬화 추가\n- B3: 게이트웨이 /ragaas-app/ /ragaas-api/ — 런타임 DNS(resolver+변수 proxy_pass)로\n  미배포시에도 기동 무영향. gateway shared-net 조인.\n  실검증: /ragaas-api 는 라이브 ragaas-backend 관통(API 루트 응답 수신).\n  /ragaas-app 은 ragaas-frontend 의 shared-net 미조인(그쪽 compose 수정 전달사항)\n- B4 불필요 확정: 타 제품 컨테이너는 자기 compose + shared-net 이 원칙\n- 셸 검증: env 없음→탭 없음(회귀무), env 주입→탭+/ragaas URL+폴백 UI, 기존 라우트 200\n- 문서: 06 체크리스트 B 상태 갱신, 04 §2 tarball 소비 확정, 온보딩 프롬프트 §3/§5 갱신,\n  decisions D15, .gitignore deploy/dist\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DPiSsNM9jfm2tknpYLs74i","tree":{"sha":"eda5fd386b8e47dfb9bbec6bc13cf393a9457628","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/git/trees/eda5fd386b8e47dfb9bbec6bc13cf393a9457628"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/git/commits/06fc0fedc877a07453b00133284d6ff9d10f1482","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/222582245?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dkdoc7","id":222582245,"login":"dkdoc7","node_id":"U_kgDODURV5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/