URV5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commits/3288afead9d457b0de693eca089723a4fab91b88/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T00:30:08Z","email":"duke.kimm7@gmail.com","name":"duke.kimm"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T00:30:08Z","email":"duke.kimm7@gmail.com","name":"duke.kimm"},"message":"feat(front): @platform/web-ui 소스 패키지 — 복붙 공통코드 12종 흡수 (P2-B, 계약 04 이행)\n\n- packages/web-ui 신설: components(AlertModal/CommonBar/NoticePopup/DiffAnalysis),\n  utils(exportUtils/authUser), runtime(env/auth/sseManager/eventQueue/launcher)\n- 판 선정: AlertModal·CommonBar·launcher = GoJIRA 슈퍼셋 판, NoticePopup·sseManager\n  = Platform 판(WS subscribe + user별 HIDE_KEY)\n- 소비 = vite resolve.alias (1단계, D11): lockfile/build-cache-node 무변경,\n  Dockerfile 은 COPY packages/ 한 줄. MF singleton 승격은 Kendo 도입 시\n- runtime/env.js 가 캐노니컬 env 키 단일 소비 지점 — 앱별 config 키 분기가 공유\n  모듈로 번지던 부채 원인 제거 (web-ui 는 앱 config import 금지)\n- web-ui 서드파티(html2canvas/diff)는 앱 node_modules 로 alias 고정\n  (react/react-dom 은 MF shared 변환이 처리하므로 alias 금지)\n- 양 앱 로컬 복제 24파일 삭제, import 12파일 재배선\n- 의도적 동작 통일: GoJIRA standalone 공지 EventSource->WS, 공지 3일숨김 키 user별\n- 검증: 양 앱 빌드 + 헤드리스 렌더(셸 임베디드/standalone) 정상\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DPiSsNM9jfm2tknpYLs74i","tree":{"sha":"f0fbf0f119a785b99e760840a51299bd25484412","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/git/trees/f0fbf0f119a785b99e760840a51299bd25484412"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos