atch 제거, __setSession 으로 user/authority 동기화\n- GoJIRA-App/src/platform/auth.js: 어댑터 — 셸 게시본 1순위(호출시점 조회),\n  standalone 로컬 폴백(구 patch 와 동일 의미: Bearer/X-User-Id)\n- 플랫폼 API 호출 16파일 87개소 fetch -> authFetch 치환 (비 API URL 은 pass-through\n  라 안전). GoJIRAApp 의 patch 도 제거\n- D6 버그 3건 해소: platform-app entrypoint 에 REACT_APP_USE_SSO/DEV_USER 직렬화,\n  DEV_USER 하드코딩 -> REACT_APP_DEV_USER 런타임 키(compose x-react-env 추가),\n  미정의 config.PLATFORM_API 참조는 patch 제거로 소멸\n- 계약 02 §5 어댑터 스니펫을 실구현(게시본 우선)으로 갱신 + decisions D10\n- 검증: 양 앱 빌드, 셸 임베디드/standalone 헤드리스 렌더에서 프로젝트 데이터\n  (pm-prj-name/milestone) 로드 확인 — dev 경로 authFetch 정상\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DPiSsNM9jfm2tknpYLs74i","tree":{"sha":"0be8dacfb758089b79082fd0ac905d92e17de074","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/git/trees/0be8dacfb758089b79082fd0ac905d92e17de074"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/git/commits/ebfe7df0844c7b4e772618f278da32ce6e9bc95b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/222582245?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dkdoc7","id":222582245,"login":"dkdoc7","node_id":"U_kgDODURV5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/