ore UMD 가림막 보존, %PUBLIC_URL% 제거\n- config.js env 폴백 process.env -> import.meta.env (envPrefix REACT_APP_ 유지)\n- outDir ''build'' 유지 -> deploy Dockerfile/entrypoint/nginx 무변경 (build-cache-node 만 재생성 필요)\n- 동작 변화(버그 수리): GoJIRAApp 의 try/catch require 가 eventQueue 부재로 SSE 구독까지\n  noop 이던 죽은 경로 -> eventQueue.js 복사 + 정적 import 로 의도된 구독 복원\n- CRA 잔재 제거: craco.config/react-scripts/testing-library/reportWebVitals/App.test\n- 검증: 양 앱 vite build 성공, dev 기동 후 헤드리스 렌더로 셸+remote 마운트,\n  standalone(3001), remote 다운 시 폴백 UI(연결할 수 없습니다/다시 시도) 확인\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DPiSsNM9jfm2tknpYLs74i","tree":{"sha":"625c6d45188ad81869db0bb86b8d36e20d101d3e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/git/trees/625c6d45188ad81869db0bb86b8d36e20d101d3e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/git/commits/1fd2ee51113c22cc22d5685d11020a83f7b15517","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/222582245?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dkdoc7","id":222582245,"login":"dkdoc7","node_id":"U_kgDODURV5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/archi-d