llowing_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dkdoc7","id":222582245,"login":"dkdoc7","node_id":"U_kgDODURV5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commits/74d0e48a480eb0af1900c5497e9c6fd1d48757cf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-05T22:48:50Z","email":"duke.kimm7@gmail.com","name":"duke.kimm"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-05T22:48:50Z","email":"duke.kimm7@gmail.com","name":"duke.kimm"},"message":"docs(platform): P0 플랫폼 통합 계약 v1.0-draft — MFE 셸 표준 (RAGaaS 합류 계약)\n\n- 01 MF 호스트 계약: 이름/expose(./App)/shared singleton 3종/런타임 remote URL/폴백\n- 02 인증 제공 계약: platformApp/auth exposed 모듈 확정(axios 근거), standalone 폴백\n- 03 공지 위젯 계약: 셸 소유 + platformApp/notice 마운트 규약\n- 04 @platform/web-ui: Kendo 단독 소유(현재 0건 — 예방 계약), MF singleton, 테마 스코프\n- 05 백엔드 언어중립 계약: 신원확정 알고리즘/introspect 스펙/X-Service-Token/게이트웨이 경로/env.js\n- 06 신규 제품 온보딩 체크리스트 + openapi-auth.yaml\n- 조사로 발견한 계약 위반 3건 기록(entrypoint USE_SSO 누락 등) — P2 수정 목록\n- decisions 2026-07-06 (D1~D7)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DPiSsNM9jfm2tknpYLs74i","tree":{"sha":"7a5b41a4edf49c0706c0fa619aefadd680102baa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/git/trees/7a5b41a4edf49c0706c0fa619aefadd680102baa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/git/commits/74d0e48a480eb0af1900c5497e9c6fd1d48757cf","verifica