s://github.com/dkdoc7","id":222582245,"login":"dkdoc7","node_id":"U_kgDODURV5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commits/27ee99c2f31f65eb0cc14604e92de62baf6ec893/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-04T16:37:50Z","email":"duke.kimm7@gmail.com","name":"duke.kimm"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-04T16:37:50Z","email":"duke.kimm7@gmail.com","name":"duke.kimm"},"message":"feat(infra): shared-infra 계약 리스너 설치 (consumer-template 반영)\n\nshared-infra 의 연결 계약(컨테이너명/포트/계정/env 키) 변경을 자동 감지하는\n소비자측 장치 — consumer-template 을 GoJIRA 에 맞게 설치:\n\n- .infra-deps.yml: 의존 표면 선언 — 실사용 기준 [mongo, gitea]\n  (redis 는 미사용이라 제외, gitea 는 이관 대기지만 선언해 두면 추가 시 additive)\n- .contract/contract.lock.json: 수용한 계약 기준선 (발행본 1.0.0)\n- tools/infra_contract.py: 계약 추출/비교 엔진. read_text() encoding 미지정으로\n  Windows(cp949)에서 UTF-8 한글 주석 파싱이 깨지는 버그 수정(encoding=utf-8)\n- .github/workflows/infra-contract-listener.yml: additive 는 lock 자동 갱신,\n  breaking 은 영향 스캔 + 승인 PR. shared-infra GitHub 미공개(404) 동안 매시\n  스케줄이 실패로 쌓이지 않게 fetch 가드 추가\n- .claude/settings.json + hooks: SessionStart 마다 드리프트 감지해 컨텍스트 주입.\n  .gitignore 에 .claude/settings.json·hooks/ 추적 예외 추가\n\n검증: compare(GoJIRA 관점) verdict 0, SessionStart 훅 정상 종료.\nshared-infra 측 전달사항(encoding 버그, 발행본 1.0.0 낡음)은\ndocs/shared-infra-handoff.md 에 기록.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DPiSsNM9jfm2tknpYLs74i","tree":{"sha":"a088add14115b4ffe8b2dee5279043e0c51fc1c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/git/trees/a088add14115b4ffe8b2dee5279043e0c51fc1c7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/git/commits/27ee99c2f31f65eb0cc14604e92de62baf6ec893","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/222582245?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dkdoc7","id":222582245,"login":"dkdoc7","node_id":"U_kgDODURV5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commit/27ee99c2f31f65eb0cc14604e92de62baf6ec893","node_id":"C_kwDORyCU2NoAKDI3ZWU5OWMyZjMxZjY1ZWIwY2MxNDYwNGU5MmRlNjJiYWY2ZWM4OTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commit/2a7a30eb65891fb9fb5443832b6443a248d8c327","sha":"2a7a30eb65891fb9fb5443832b6443a248d8c327","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commits/2a7a30eb65891fb9fb5443832b6443a248d8c327"}],"sha":"27ee99c2f31f65eb0cc14604e92de62baf6ec893","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/archi-duke/GoJIRA/commits/27ee99c2f31f65eb0cc14604e92de62baf6ec893"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/222582245?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkdoc7/follow