riptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yehor-hammer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Genaker/Tailwind-Luna/commit/f1dead32c3fea0fea6bdf3c5628aa36378ce6155","node_id":"C_kwDORyNDeNoAKGYxZGVhZDMyYzNmZWEwZmVhNmJkZjNjNTYyOGFhMzYzNzhjZTYxNTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Genaker/Tailwind-Luna/commit/d324e1dabccf81116b139d99cdd5a7655691ad69","sha":"d324e1dabccf81116b139d99cdd5a7655691ad69","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Genaker/Tailwind-Luna/commits/d324e1dabccf81116b139d99cdd5a7655691ad69"}],"sha":"f1dead32c3fea0fea6bdf3c5628aa36378ce6155","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Genaker/Tailwind-Luna/commits/f1dead32c3fea0fea6bdf3c5628aa36378ce6155"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/251054188?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yehor-hammer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yehor-hammer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yehor-hammer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yehor-hammer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yehor-hammer","id":251054188,"login":"yehor-hammer","node_id":"U_kgDODvbIbA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yehor-hammer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yehor-hammer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yehor-hammer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yehor-hammer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yehor-hammer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yehor-hammer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Genaker/Tailwind-Luna/commits/d324e1dabccf81116b139d99cdd5a7655691ad69/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-02T06:33:31Z","email":"yshytikov@hammer.net","name":"Yehor(George) Shytikov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-02T06:33:31Z","email":"yshytikov@hammer.net","name":"Yehor(George) Shytikov"},"message":"feat: styles.yaml support, JS defer, CSS dedup, a11y fixes, docs update\n\nSCSS build pipeline\n- Add styles.yaml / styles.yml discovery (OroInc-inspired architecture):\n  any module root can declare SCSS inputs without touching web/tailwind/\n- sources.cjs: add stylesYamlGlobs array (vendor, app/code, src)\n- scss-config.cjs: inline YAML parser, KNOWN_YAML_KEYS, collectStylesYamlPaths,\n  load styles.yaml inputs into mergeRoots with tier support\n- styles.yaml: theme-root entry point with full format documentation\n- Fix test 9 fixture: invalid CSS class starting with digit → comment form\n\nCSS deduplication\n- footer.scss: remove duplicate .page-footer / .footer.content grid rules\n  (layout.scss is now single source of truth for shell layout)\n- header.scss: remove .page-header / .panel.wrapper / .header.content blocks\n  migrated to layout.scss\n- layout.scss: consolidate overflow:visible and z-index from header.scss\n- actions-forms.scss: merge .action.tocart into .action.primary group\n\nPerformance\n- default_head_blocks.xml: remove mage/calendar.css from all pages\n- logo.phtml: add loading=\"lazy\" fetchpriority=\"low\" to logo img\n- DeferJsObserver: move ALL script tags to before </body> preserving order;\n  opt-out via no-defer attribute; skip KO template containers\n- Add ThemeModule events.xml, config.xml, acl.xml, adminhtml/system.xml\n  for defer-js store config toggle\n\nAccessibility\n- sorter.phtml: label hidden → sr-only (visible to screen readers)\n- limiter.phtml: label hidden → sr-only (visible to screen readers)\n\nDocumentation\n- docs/CSS_MERGE.md: full styles.yaml section (format, discovery globs,\n  decision table, example)\n- docs/CSS_BUILD_ARCHITECTURE.md: update flow diagram, components table,\n  \"Where CSS is authored\" with styles.yaml extension point\n- README.md: inputs table + docs table updated with styles.yaml entry\n- docs/MAGENTO_JS_PERFORMANCE.md: new article on fixing Magento JS perf\n  without Hyvä replatforming\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"22f8ebbc521c6ecc5b60db3110f7301106aa3426","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Genaker/Tailwind-Luna/git/trees/22f8ebbc521c6ecc5b60db3110f7301106aa3426"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Genaker/Tailwind-Luna/git/commits/d324e1dabccf81116b139d99cdd5a7655691ad69","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/251054188?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yehor-hammer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yehor-hammer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yehor-hammer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yehor-hammer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yehor-hammer","id":251054188,"login":"yehor-hammer","node_id":"U_kgDODvbIbA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yehor-hammer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yehor-hammer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yehor-hammer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yehor-hammer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yehor-hammer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yehor-hammer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Genaker/Tailwind-Luna/commit/d324e1dabccf81116b139d99cdd5a7655691ad69","node_id":"C_kwDORyNDeNoAKGQzMjRlMWRhYmNjZjgxMTE2YjEzOWQ5OWNkZDVhNzY1NTY5MWFkNjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Genaker/Tailwind-Luna/commit/597e29491e62e411be29a9cd37dbaf9ddddc19fb","sha":"597e29491e62e411be29a9cd37dbaf9ddddc19fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Genaker/Tailwind-Luna/commits/597e29491e62e411be29a9cd37dbaf9ddddc19fb"}],"sha":"d324e1dabccf81116b139d99cdd5a76